window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2601,"title":"Chapter 2601 - Provocation (2)","paragraphs":["Lu Qi became confident again and went back to slandering Feng Wu.","The neutral group remained neutral.","The fans refused to listen to Lu Qi. No matter what Wang Junwen said, they still believed that Feng Wu was a capable cultivator.","Therefore, they confronted Wang Junwen.","Zhao Zhen spoke first.","“Wang Junwen, this is Class E’s territory. Why did you bring so many people here? A challenge? We’re in Class E, and you’re in Class D. One can hardly call that a challenge, don’t you think? Aren’t you afraid that people will laugh at you?”","Yu Hong smirked. “Feng Wu dared to say that she’s better than Wang Junwen, which is a total lie! Why can’t we expose her?!”","“A lie?” Chaoge couldn’t take it anymore. “Didn’t Xiao Wu defeat Wang Junwen? Didn’t she kick you away? Was that a lie, too?”","Yu Hong’s face flushed in frustration.","Yes, both he and Wang Junwen lost. That was why they brought more people to help them this time.","Yu Hong smirked. “Cut the crap. Just answer me: Are you going to accept the challenge or not?”","When Feng Wu finished her cultivation, she woke up to find Wang Junwen glaring down at her.","She had thick bandages wrapped around her neck.","From afar, it almost looked like she was wearing a scarf.","Feng Wu frowned. “What now?”","Wang Junwen glared at her. “Five to five. Do you accept the challenge?”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you mean?”","Sun Jingyu quickly explained to her, “It’s a common practice here in the academy. Each side has a team of five people, and the members will perform one-on-one battles.","She wasn’t sure if Feng Wu could follow, so she added, “Each team selects a player, and the two players will battle. The winner will remain on stage, and the losing team will choose a second player to go up, and so on and so forth. A player only leaves the stage when they lose the battle.","“The last person left on stage is the winner, and their team wins.” Sun Jingyu then lowered her voice. “If you ask me, I don’t think you should accept the challenge.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Sun Jingyu glanced at the other team and said, “That very tall man is Lei Bao. He’s two meters tall and is ranked quite high on Class D’s billboard. I don’t think you’re his match. There’s more.”","She pointed at the two people next to Lei Bao. “They’re Hua Yan and Hua Xu. They’re brothers and are both very capable. I wouldn’t stand a chance.","“Then there’s Wang Junwen and Yu Hong. You can defeat them, but we can’t.”","She said thoughtfully, “You can defeat two or three of them, but you can’t fight all five. I suggest you turn down the challenge.”","Wang Junwen smirked when she heard what Sun Jingyu said. “What? Are you afraid?”","Sun Jingyu said, “We’re from Class E. Normally, we aren’t your match. So what if we’re afraid of fighting you?”","Wang Junwen didn’t expect Sun Jingyu to be so frank and was rendered speechless.","The other Class E students didn’t like the way Sun Jingyu put it.","Those people had come to their own territory to insult them. Although she was telling the truth, it didn’t make it any less frustrating.","Lu Qi was still trying to incite her classmates. “If not for Feng Wu, we would never have to go through this! It’s all her fault!”","The number of anti-fans began to increase again."]},{"number":2602,"title":"Chapter 2602 - Provocation (3)","paragraphs":["“Xiao Wu, don’t say yes!” Zi Ling tugged at Feng Wu’s sleeve and shook her head. “Be patient in one moment of anger, and you’ll escape a hundred days of sorrow!”","The other students of Class E were all infuriated, but they tried to talk Feng Wu out of it as well.","“Forget it. We won’t blame you. Just tell them no.”","“There are five of them; you can never defeat them all. You’ll be killed for nothing.”","“We know you’re capable. You’re the top student of our class, but you can’t beat Class D.”","Lu Qi and her friends couldn’t wait to see Feng Wu’s downfall, whereas both the neutral group and Feng Wu’s fans tried to persuade her to not accept the challenge.","Wang Junwen sneered at Feng Wu.","Would she say no?","Feng Wu said, “Sure.”","Sure? What was that supposed to mean?","Everyone gave her strange looks.","Wang Junwen was taken aback as well. She stared at Feng Wu and asked, “Is that a yes?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Wang Junwen couldn’t believe it at first, but she was then elated.","Feng Wu must have lost her mind! What an idiot! She said yes!","Fearing that Feng Wu would go back on her word, Wang Junwen said, “Today feels like a good time. Let’s do it now!”","“Xiao Wu!”","The people around Feng Wu all looked at her in astonishment, including Sun Jingyu and Pei Si.","Feng Wu said casually, “I have a request.”","Wang Junwen asked, “What is it?”","Feng Wu said, “Class E doesn’t stand much of a chance in a five-on-five battle against Class D. We won’t become your punching bags for nothing. You’re going to give us some points as a reward.”","Wang Junwen had been about to tempt Feng Wu with points in the first place, so she wasn’t surprised by the request.","“How many points are we talking about?”","Feng Wu said, “If we win, you’ll give each of our five players 5,000 points.”","“No way!” Wang Junwen stared at her. “One person can transfer no more than 1,000 points per month, so 1,000 a player is all I’m going to offer.”","Mr. Zhu had told Feng Wu that rule before, so Feng Wu didn’t object. She nodded and said, “Alright.”","Wang Junwen asked, “What if you lose?”","Feng Wu said innocently, “Aren’t we your potential punching bags? Do we have to lose points as well? Forget it, then.”","Wang Junwen had come here to kill Feng Wu in public.","Feng Wu never put a hit on her head, so Wang Junwen only had an excuse to kill Feng Wu in a duel.","She gritted her teeth. “Fine! Have it your way! If your team wins, each player will earn 1,000 points! If you lose, you can’t blame anyone for your death. None of us can.”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","“You have ten minutes to choose your players!” said Wang Junwen.","Only so many people in Class E could take up the challenge, and Sun Jingyu and Pei Si would definitely be in the team. Wang Junwen was determined to teach them a lesson for betraying her.","Feng Wu then turned to her friends.","Chaoge said, “Count me in.”","Zi Ling said timidly, “I won’t help you much in the battle, but if Xiao Wu needs me, I’ll join in.”","Feng Wu nodded.","She then turned to Sun Jingyu.","Sun Jingyu’s stomach lurched. This was the thing she feared most.","“I...” She gave Feng Wu a pleading look. “I’ve offended Wang Junwen, and part of her rage is directed toward me. I’m worried that...”","Feng Wu kept her gaze on Sun Jingyu."]},{"number":2603,"title":"Chapter 2603 - Provocation (4)","paragraphs":["Sun Jingyu said, “If you have to have me on the team, I guess I can do it...”","Feng Wu then turned to Pei Si.","Pei Si said, “I think Gu Xingyuan would be a better choice, wouldn’t he? He’s the second best student in our class and will have a much better chance.” In other words, she didn’t want to be on the team.","Before Feng Wu could ask, Gu Xingyuan crossed his arms, distancing himself from the crowd. He snorted. “I’m not cleaning up after you.”","He then moved further away from Feng Wu.","Chu Junying gave Feng Wu a contemptuous look and followed Gu Xingyuan.","The students became very quiet.","It was supposed to be a five-person team, but there were only four members now. Feng Wu, Chaoge, Zi Ling and Sun Jingyu.","Chaoge looked at Mu Qianqian.","Mu Qianqian hesitated. Just then, someone walked up to Feng Wu. “Boss Wu, what about me? If you can’t find a fifth member, count me in.”","It was Zhao Zhen, the head of Feng Wu’s fan group.","Feng Wu didn’t know who she was, so Zi Ling introduced her.","Wang Junwen was pleased when she saw how hard it was for Feng Wu to put together a team. She chuckled coldly. “If you have a death wish, feel free to join her team!”","In other words, she was going to be ruthless.","Feng Wu asked Zhao Zhen, “Aren’t you afraid?”","Zhao Zhen was so nervous that her hands shook, but she was equally excited. She shook her head solemnly. “I’m not afraid!”","Feng Wu said, “Good. You’re in.”","Feng Wu gathered the other four around her and told them her strategy.","Her team members cried out in surprise.","“What?!”","“What?!”","“What?!”","“How can we do that?!”","...","In the distance, their classmates were all confused. What was Feng Wu’s strategy? Why were they so surprised?","They were still wondering, when Wang Junwen shouted in a sarcastic tone, “Can we start now?”","Feng Wu nodded and led her team to the stage.","A high platform about 100-square-meters-wide stood at one end of the square. It was the battle arena of Class E, and all tests were taken there.","Pei Si gave Sun Jingyu a sympathetic look when Sun Jingyu walked past her. “You should have said no.”","Sun Jingyu smirked. “Since I’ve chosen Feng Wu, I’ll stick with her no matter what. I’m not a fencesitter like you!”","Pei Si said, “You’re an idiot.”","Sun Jingyu walked past Pei Si with her chin raised.","In fact, she was crying inwardly. She would never have come up here if her hand hadn’t been forced.","She kept her struggle to herself.","All ten people went up to the stage.","Wang Junwen looked at each of Feng Wu’s team members in turn until her gaze landed on Feng Wu. She sneered at them. “Who’s the first one?”","Wang Junwen was the first player on Feng Wu’s team.","Zi Ling stepped out and walked up to Wang Junwen.","Wang Junwen’s eyes glinted coldly.","She hadn’t heard of Zi Ling’s name until she investigated Feng Wu. She now knew that Zi Ling was in the same dormitory as Feng Wu.","Wang Junwen had brought a lethal weapon with her, something she had borrowed from her uncle, Mr. Wang. That was why she had volunteered to be the first player; she thought that she could kill Feng Wu all by herself.","Since Zi Ling was Feng Wu’s fan, she decided to teach the girl a lesson.","Zi Ling hopped around like a bunny and bowed when she was in front of Wang Junwen. “Hello, Sister Wang Junwen.”","Feng Wu crossed her hands behind her back and smiled. If Wang Junwen knew what her plan was..."]},{"number":2604,"title":"Chapter 2604 - Shocked (1)","paragraphs":["Zhen Ya was furious when she noticed that Lu Xiao couldn’t keep his eyes off Zi Ling. “Do you care so much about her?!”","They had fought numerous times because of Zi Ling, so Lu Xiao ignored her.","Zhen Ya smirked. “You better stop caring. Do you see the look in Wang Junwen’s eyes? She looks like she’s going to swallow Zi Ling whole. She’s going to be relentless, and Zi Ling is as good as dead!”","Lu Xiao still didn’t respond. Zhen Ya was so frustrated that she prayed for Zi Ling’s death.","She was going to be disappointed.","After Zi Ling greeted Wang Junwen with a bow, Wang Junwen snorted. “Are you ready?”","Zi Ling nodded. “Yes.”","Wang Junwen had just picked up her sword, when Zi Ling said, “I give up.”","What?","Everyone was astonished.","Zhen Ya’s mouth fell open.","Pei Si didn’t know what to say.","All the students couldn’t believe their ears.","She gave up. Just like that?","They were expecting to see Wang Junwen beat up Zi Ling, and blood splash everywhere, but none of that was going to happen!","Wang Junwen was obviously shocked by what Zi Ling said.","She stared at Zi Ling. “What did you say?”","Zi Ling said innocently, “I said I give up. The rules don’t say that I can’t do that. Am I not allowed to give up?”","Today, Zi Ling wore a cape with white fur trimming, and the hood had fluffy rabbit ears on it. Her hair accessories were tiny fluffy orbs that swayed when she walked, giving her an adorable look.","When she looked at Wang Junwen, she was as innocent as a bunny.","Wang Junwen was so furious that she thought she was going to explode. Zi Ling ran back to her team and gave her team members high fives.","Wang Junwen didn’t know what to say.","The other students were all speechless.","Zhen Ya said, “Damn it! Why won’t she die?!”","Lu Xiao glanced at her and wondered when the kind Zhen Ya became so vicious. She wanted Zi Ling to die. That was horrible.","At that thought, he took a step away from Zhen Ya, but Zhen Ya was too overwhelmed by her rage to notice.","Zhao Zhen was the second player to go on stage.","She was as lovely as Zi Ling. Walking up to Wang Junwen, she said sternly, “You’re a student of Class D, but you’re forcing us to take part in this five-to-five battle with you! That’s preposterous! Even if you win, this unequal contest won’t bring you any honor!”","Wang Junwen didn’t know what to say.","She had never expected a petty student of Class E to insult her like that.","She was determined to kill Zhao Zhen.","However, before she could do anything, Zhao Zhen rested her hands on her hips and smirked. “I’m not fighting a bad person like you! It won’t be a fair battle! I give up!”","She quickly ran off the stage after that.","Wang Junwen’s eyes widened.","She had been insulted for nothing.","And it didn’t stop there. Sun Jingyu was the next player, and she gave up as well.","Wang Junwen could live with that because Sun Jingyu wasn’t all that close to Feng Wu, so it was only normal that she didn’t want to die for her, but Chaoge was a different story. She hardly ever left Feng Wu’s side. However, even she walked up to Wang Junwen, snorted, and said she gave up.","She ran off the stage as well."]},{"number":2605,"title":"Chapter 2605 - Shocked (2)","paragraphs":["Wang Junwen was so furious.","She would vent all her rage on Feng Wu, the last player.","Feng Wu’s other teammates all gave up and didn’t have even a single scratch on them, but that also meant that they stood very little chance of winning.","That was what everyone else believed.","Led by Lu Qi, the anti-fans started doing their thing again, spreading all sorts of rumors about Feng Wu.","The neutral ones didn’t say anything, but they were all frowning.","Feng Wu’s fans felt defeated. Despite the frustration, they managed to stay strong. They cheered for Feng Wu and tried to explain Feng Wu’s defeat, saying that it wasn’t a fair battle.","Up on stage, Wang Junwen stared at Feng Wu.","She decided that Feng Wu wasn’t going to get away this time.","She said, “Feng Wu, are you going to act like a coward and give up just like your teammates? If so, I’ll despise you as well as all of Class E!”","That was a clever thing to say.","She tied Feng Wu’s behavior to the honor of all of Class E. Damaging her own reputation would be the same as damaging that of their class. If Feng Wu admitted defeat without fighting, the whole class would hate her.","All the students of Class E stared at Feng Wu.","What would she do?","If she gave in, she would be disgraced together with Class E.","If not, she would have to fight all five people, including Lei Bao, who was supposed to be very powerful.","What choice would Feng Wu make?","Feng Wu glanced at her and nodded.","Wang Junwen stared at her. “Are you giving up?”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at her. “You talk too much.”","Wang Junwen’s eyes widened.","Feng Wu said, “Just get on with the fighting already. What’s with all the trash-talk? Don’t you know that talking too much can get you killed?”","“Me? Killed? Ha!” Wang Junwen laughed. “We’re going to fight until one of us drops. If that doesn’t scare you, bring it on!”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","Wang Junwen was elated. She didn’t give Feng Wu time to react and struck at Feng Wu’s head with the saber that contained Mr. Wang’s full power.","“Oh, no,” Sun Jingyu murmured.","Everyone looked at her.","Sun Jingyu said, “The saber belongs to Mr. Wang, and he can infuse it with his spiritual essence. That is to say, Wang Junwen borrowed his power!”","“Gosh... What is Feng Wu going to do?” Many people paled.","Wang Junwen was from Class D, and she had borrowed Mr. Wang’s power to boot. Feng Wu wouldn’t stand a chance!","“Can she somehow dodge that blow?”","“That’s impossible. She’s going to die. She shouldn’t have agreed to fight to the death. Now, no one can avenge her anymore.”","Everyone was talking at the same time.","They were right. The saber was indeed Wang Junwen’s secret weapon.","She had received it from Mr. Wang, her uncle, and the saber contained his full power. The attack would be terrifying if she exerted all the energy at once.","She was confident that she would win.","However —","When she struck at Feng Wu, Feng Wu jumped up and kicked at the edge of the blade.","The saber’s energy backfired, and Wang Junwen became the target instead."]},{"number":2606,"title":"Chapter 2606 - Shocked (3)","paragraphs":["There was no way that Wang Junwen could withstand such power.","Thud!","The blade hit her on the head.","It instantly split her skull open.","What?!","Everyone stared at Wang Junwen and the saber buried in her skull.","Then, their gazes shifted to Feng Wu.","“Wang Junwen’s head is cut up...”","“She’s dead...”","“What did Feng Wu do?”","“I don’t think she did anything... She just jumped up and kicked the saber.”","“Then Wang Junwen is dead...”","“...”","This turn of events shocked everyone. Their mouths hung open, and they didn’t know how to react.","They weren’t the only ones.","Wang Junwen’s four friends were equally baffled.","Yu Hong ran to Wang Junwen’s side and held her body in his arms. He screamed her name, “Junwen! Junwen!”","They had managed to save Wang Junwen when her neck was cut open, but her head was split in two now, and there was nothing they could do.","Yu Hong kept banging his fists against his head. “It’s all my fault! It’s all my fault! You barely escaped death, but now... If I had known, I would have stopped you!”","The students of Class E didn’t know what to say.","If Yu Hong hadn’t brought it up, they would have forgotten that Wang Junwen had been defeated by Feng Wu once. She didn’t even wait an hour before she came here, trying to get revenge with that saber. However, she couldn’t be brought back to life this time.","“She totally had it coming. I don’t know if I should feel sorry for her or laugh at her.”","No one showed any sympathy. Not only that, they also laughed at her, making her death seem pathetic.","Yu Hong put down Wang Junwen and walked up to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Shall we begin?”","Begin? Yu Hong didn’t want to die.","He knew perfectly well how formidable Feng Wu was.","“I give up!” Yu Hong gave Feng Wu a dirty look before leaving.","Everyone was speechless.","Wang Junwen had despised Feng Wu’s teammates for giving up. What Yu Hong did was practically mocking her.","The third and fourth players in Wang Junwen’s team looked at each other.","The battle between Feng Wu and Wang Junwen was proof enough of Feng Wu’s capability. There was no need to struggle. They had no chance at all.","Both players admitted defeat without putting up a fight.","The students of Class D had given up.","Feng Wu frowned. “I still think we should have a battle. I promise I won’t kill you.”","The third player flushed and walked away.","The fourth player considered the offer and made up his mind. “Let’s do it, then!”","Feng Wu kept her promise. They exchanged quite a few blows before she kicked the player off the stage, saying, “Good job.”","The player thought,? No, it wasn’t. You could have defeated me with a single blow.","Flushing, he cupped his fists at Feng Wu and ran off.","Lei Bao was the only player left."]},{"number":2607,"title":"Chapter 2607 - Shocked (4)","paragraphs":["Lei Bao’s eyes glinted coldly.","It had cost Wang Junwen quite a few points to convince Lei Bao to join her in battle. Since he had taken the reward in advance, he thought he should see it through.","Now that Wang Junwen was dead, he couldn’t return the points and had no choice but to fight Feng Wu.","He stared at her. “Let’s do this.”","Feng Wu was far more capable than Lei Bao and could easily kill him, but she didn’t want to create any unnecessary trouble.","Wang Junwen had it coming, but Lei Bao was a different story. After all, killing people should be avoided if one could help it.","Feng Wu casually exchanged a few blows with Lei Bao before kicking him off the stage.","“Wow!”","The crowd was shocked when Lei Bao was defeated.","“Did Feng Wu win the battle?”","“Lei Bao is a capable fighter even in Class D, and he just lost the battle to Feng Wu!”","“Oh my god! Feng Wu is such a hidden treasure!”","Earlier, when Feng Wu became first on the billboard, Lu Qi and her friends tried to convince themselves that it was a mistake with the system. Now, however, they couldn’t deny the fact that Feng Wu had defeated Lei Bao.","Lei Bao lay flat on his stomach on the ground, too baffled to move.","He had lost.","How did that happen?","A student from Class E had defeated him.","Had this world gone insane, or had the students of Class E made unexpected improvements?","The students of Class E weren’t helping either.","“Is Class D getting weaker?”","“Why do I feel that they’re not as tough as before?”","“Am I correct to assume that if I go up there, I can kick some of them off the stage as well?”","“There I was, wondering how tough Class D was, and here they are, having lost a five-on-five battle to our class!”","The third and fourth players in Wang Junwen’s team were utterly embarrassed. They picked up Lei Bao and were ready to leave.","“Wait.” Feng Wu stopped them.","Yu Hong said, “Feng Wu, you’ve killed Wang Junwen. What more do you want? You need to back off!”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “What’s your relationship with Wang Junwen?”","Yu Hong said, “I... I was her boyfriend.”","Feng Wu said, “Good. Pay up. Wang Junwen promised each of us 1,000 points; we’re ready to receive what we’re owed.”","Yu Hong’s cheeks flushed in frustration.","Students of Class D could earn points a little faster than those of Class E, but the points were still as valuable to them as to everyone else. He didn’t have 5,000 points to spare.","“I don’t have so many points!” Yu Hong flushed.","Feng Wu crossed her arms and smiled at the four students of Class D. “You don’t have them, you say? In that case, no one is leaving.”","Everyone else was goggling at the four people, and Lei Bao couldn’t stand the humiliation. He gritted his teeth and said, “I have them!”","He paid all 5,000 points for his teammates.","After that, they practically fled the scene.","The students of Class E were still trying to digest the information.","Feng Wu had won the battle.","Not only that, she also killed Wang Junwen.","What was more, she defeated Lei Bao.","Moreover, she received 5,000 points from Lei Bao.","5,000 points!","Everyone in Feng Wu’s team would get 1,000 points each.","What did the other four players do?","Nothing. They jumped onto the stage, stood in front of Wang Junwen, and said they gave up.","They promptly left the stage after that.","It was the most straightforward task, and they all earned 1,000 points for it!","Earning points was always a difficult thing to do."]},{"number":2608,"title":"Chapter 2608 - Formidable Feng Wu (1)","paragraphs":["It was the most straightforward task, and they all earned 1,000 points for it!","Earning points was always a difficult thing to do.","The attitudes of the students of Class E toward Feng Wu had utterly changed. They now worshiped the ground she walked on.","Pei Si regretted it so much.","She smacked herself on the forehead.","She could have grabbed the chance while she had it, but she had been too scared to do so, and had turned down the offer. She had said no to 1,000 points.","She had only needed to tell Wang Junwen that she would give up in order to earn 1,000 points. Pei Si was so frustrated that she was almost in tears.","What was more, the looks her classmates gave her made her feel like a fool.","Despite their astonishment, the students discussed the matter avidly among themselves.","Zhao Zhen and other fans of Feng Wu capered about, shouting and laughing.","Zhao Zhen was kind enough to distribute her points so that all her fans received a little reward. Because of that, they became even more excited.","Lu Qi and her fellow anti-fans felt utterly defeated. They were filled with rage but had no way to vent their frustration.","Even more students had left the group and switched sides to the fans.","Nothing Lu Qi said could persuade them to stay, and she stomped her foot in rage.","She gave Feng Wu a dirty look. “What are you smiling about? You really killed Wang Junwen this time. Mr. Wang will make you pay!”","Her friend tugged her sleeve and whispered, “But they were supposed to fight to the death. They agreed to it beforehand.”","Lu Qi snorted. “So what if they did? Mr. Wang won’t be able to do anything openly, but he can make her life miserable in a hundred ways. Just wait and see!”","Her friends nodded, looking forward to seeing Mr. Wang’s revenge.","Mr. Zhu didn’t know whether to laugh or to cry.","Feng Wu was more courageous and capable than he had expected. He thought that if His Royal Highness really cared about her as much as he was rumored to, she had every reason to be courageous.","Something happened before the crowd scattered.","“Do you hear that?”","“Those are heavy footsteps!”","They turned around to find a large group of people.","They were students of Class D.","There were so many of them...","There were at least 1,000 students.","The Class E students paled.","What did these people want?","Soon, they were faced with all the Class D students.","There were indeed over 1,000 students.","They were led by Mr. Wang.","The energy the Class D students gave off was too much for Class E to withstand. Their eyes were bloodshot red, and they looked like they were going to collapse.","Mr. Zhu stepped forward and stared coldly at Mr. Wang.","“Mr. Wang, what are you doing?”","Mr. Wang ignored him and only stared at Feng Wu.","Frustrated, Mr. Zhu studied the aggressive Class D before looking at Mr. Wang again.","“Mr. Wang, please explain yourself! Are they all here to start a group fight with Class E?!” Mr. Zhu raised his voice.","Mr. Wang glanced at him and snorted. “We teachers should stay out of it. It’s a student matter.”","He then moved aside with a vicious look in his eyes."]},{"number":2609,"title":"Chapter 2609 - Formidable Feng Wu (2)","paragraphs":["Wang Junwen was dead. Although Mr. Wang had paid Class E a visit, Wang Junwen had still been killed in the end. The humiliation was too great for Mr. Wang to bear.","When he stepped aside, someone said quietly, “This is a student matter. Mr. Zhu, please leave it to us.”","It was Wu Lingyue, the 11th student on Class D’s billboard and the most popular girl in the class.","Mr. Zhu frowned and gave Feng Wu a concerned look. It was evident that these people were here because of Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled at Mr. Zhu and gave him a nod.","Mr. Zhu finally stepped aside.","“So, you’re Feng Wu.” Wu Lingyue was alarmed as soon as she saw Feng Wu.","What a beautiful girl,? she thought.","Feng Wu had exquisite features and the smoothest skin. She wouldn’t blink even if Mount Everest crumbled in front of her. No worldly matters seemed to be able to affect her.","Wu Lingyue was jealous.","She felt threatened.","It was said that Feng Wu had defeated Lei Bao. That was to say, she was definitely good enough to join Class D. When that happened, Wu Lingyue wouldn’t be the most popular girl anymore.","She deemed Feng Wu the enemy of her life at first glance, but Feng Wu had no idea of any of it.","Wu Lingyue stared at Feng Wu.","“You killed Wang Junwen!","“You insulted my classmates!","“Kneel and apologize!”","Wu Lingyue pointed at her classmates behind her and raised her chin when she spoke to Feng Wu.","No matter how pretty Feng Wu was, after she knelt on the ground, no one would respect her after she went to Class D, and Wu Lingyue could still be the most popular girl.","Kneel and apologize?","Chaoge was furious. She pointed at Wu Lingyue and said, “I’m warning you, you’ve crossed the line!”","Wu Lingyue raised her hand and was going to slap Chaoge.","“How dare a mere Class E student talk to me that way?!”","However, as soon as she made a move, Feng Wu stepped out and slapped Wu Lingyue instead.","Smack!","The crisp sound resonated in the air.","Feng Wu had slapped Wu Lingyue. It was the last thing everyone expected to see.","Wu Lingyue was like a princess in Class D.","Many boys were in love with her.","As expected, everyone was astonished.","They couldn’t believe how bold Feng Wu was.","Wu Lingyue was the first to react. She stared at Feng Wu and said, “You, you...”","She covered her right cheek and didn’t know what else to say.","She had been slapped.","She couldn’t believe it.","She glared at Feng Wu. “You hit me! How dare you?!”","All her classmates took a few steps forward, and nearly all the boys stood around Wu Lingyue.","Wu Lingyue was both the class president and their dream girl.","“Feng Wu, do you think I’m too afraid to kill you?!” Wu Lingyue gritted her teeth.","Feng Wu glanced at her and asked sarcastically, “Can you?”","Wu Lingyue was rendered speechless.","The pretty girl standing next to her said, “Lingyue, you don’t need to show her mercy.”","Wu Lingyue nodded and said to Feng Wu, “You forced Wang Junwen to fight to the death and humiliated my classmates! It’s too late for you to apologize now!”"]},{"number":2610,"title":"Chapter 2610 - Formidable Feng Wu (3)","paragraphs":["“Feng Wu, prepare to be challenged!” Wu Lingyue smirked.","Feng Wu was a little intrigued.","Wu Lingyue said, “You’re going to fight to the death because that was how you killed Wang Junwen and humiliated my class! We’re going to do the same to you! Face your death!”","The Class E students were shocked.","Seriously? Another challenge?","That was twice in a row.","Sun Jingyu lowered her voice. “We’re in trouble.”","Chaoge smirked. “No, we’re not. Just beat them.”","Sun Jingyu frowned. “You don’t know what you’re talking about. Class E students usually have to pass an exam to get into Class D. That is to say, they’re generally better than us.”","Chaoge said, “So what? We won, didn’t we?”","Sun Jingyu said, “That’s not the same! Lei Bao was their best fighter. Although we consider him a capable fighter, he’s only an average student in Class D.","“Look at the people Wu Lingyue brought with her!” Sun Jingyu was almost in tears. “Wu Lingyue is 11th herself, and the teenagers behind her are ranked from 6th to 10th.”","Chaoge said, “I don’t care what their rankings are. Xiao Wu can beat them all.”","Sun Jingyu was too frustrated to speak. Feng Wu couldn’t possibly beat them all, because there were 1,000 Class D students here!","Feng Wu found Wu Lingyue’s suggestion idiotic. “Why should I do as you say?”","After being slapped by Feng Wu, Wu Lingyue wanted to kill her this instant. She asked coldly, “What would it take to make you participate?”","Feng Wu asked, “What kind of fight will it be?”","Wu Lingyue said, “1,000 Class D students will take turns fighting 1,000 Class E students, one at a time!”","Feng Wu glanced at her. “Are you trying to turn us into your punching bags? We’re not idiots. No way.”","Wu Lingyue grew impatient. “You made a bet with Wang Junwen earlier, didn’t you, using points as the stake?”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “What are you suggesting?”","Wu Lingyue said, “We can do the same!”","Feng Wu said, “Our agreement with Wang Junwen was that we would earn points if we won, but if we lost, we didn’t need to pay anything.”","Wu Lingyue said, “I can live with that.”","Feng Wu said, “If you lose, each of your team members will give us 1,000 points.”","Wu Lingyue said, “I can live with that.”","Feng Wu looked at her in amazement. “You do realize what you’ve agreed to do, right?”","Wu Lingyue smirked. “I do, but we have one more request.”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","“You’ll be the first in line! You need to fight first!” Wu Lingyue smirked. “You’re going to be our first punching bag!”","She didn’t want that “I give up” fiasco to happen again.","“And you’re not allowed to admit defeat! If you agree to that, all of us will offer 1,000 points each as the stake.","“Agreed?” she asked the Class D students behind her.","Students of Class D were so angry because Yu Hong had gone back to tell them that Class E had humiliated Class D.","That was why they had come here full of anger.","“Agreed!” the students of Class D said in unison.","Wu Lingyue sneered at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu shrugged and asked the students of Class E, “We can all earn 1,000 points for free. Isn’t that a sweet deal?”"]},{"number":2611,"title":"Chapter 2611 - Formidable Feng Wu (4)","paragraphs":["Class E was intimidated by Class D at first, but seeing how calm Feng Wu was, they felt much more reassured.","Zhao Zhen had enjoyed being part of the last bet, and was the first to step out. “I’ll do it!”","Feng Wu’s other fans followed suit. “I’ll do it, too!”","“Count me in!”","“Count me in!”","So what if they might be beaten up for nothing? Feng Wu needed their support!","They were all prepared to lose their fights.","Feng Wu currently had 700 fans.","The neutral group remained unbiased.","Lu Qi immediately saw what she had to do. She needed to stop them from switching to Feng Wu’s side so that Feng Wu would be even more humiliated.","She snorted. “Are you people idiots? You know you’re going to lose, but you’re still supporting Feng Wu.”","Zhao Zhen asked, “How do you know we’ll lose?”","Lu Qi said, “Are you blind? Do you know who they are? They’re from Class D!","“Do you know what that means? They had to pass a test to get there, which means that they used to be the best students of Class E! Frankly speaking, the weakest Class E student is still better than our top student!”","Zhao Zhen said, “But Xiao Wu...”","“She’s an exception. Can’t you see that? Even if she can beat 50 or 100 people, can she defeat 1,000 of them?”","Zhao Zhen didn’t know what to say.","Lu Qi said, “It’s an impossible fight! You’ll never win and will be beaten up for nothing. That’s not even the worst case scenario. What if they kill you? You’ll die for nothing!”","The neutral party didn’t know what to say.","Lu Qi said, “Only idiots will join Feng Wu!”","She turned around and saw that there were fewer than 200 anti-fans left. They all stood there, showing no intention to fight.","Very nice.","Just then, Sun Jingyu said, “Since the honor of Class E is concerned, as the class president, I have to do something.”","After joining Feng Wu, Sun Jingyu looked back at her fellow classmates and smirked. “Have you forgotten how Class D picks on you all the time? If you want to swallow that humiliation, be my guest.”","Pei Si regretted missing out the first time, and wasn’t going to miss this opportunity. She joined Feng Wu’s team as well. “Only when we’re too scared to fight will we truly lose the battle. I don’t want to lose.”","Seeing that the previous top two students had joined Feng Wu, even the neutral group grew excited.","“Class D won’t stop picking on us, and they’ve come to our doorstep!”","“That’s right! It was a fair fight. One of them died in battle, and they’re making it sound like it’s our fault!”","“They’ve crossed the line!”","“Why did we even become martial arts practitioners? To swallow this kind of humiliation? You do what you want, but I’m going to fight!”","Members of the neutral group joined Feng Wu’s team one after another.","The team was filled up almost instantly.","There were only two places left.","“Where is Gu Xingyuan? Isn’t he the second-best student in our class now? How can he miss such a big event?”","“That’s right. Does he value the honor of our class at all?”","The students glared at Gu Xingyuan.","They used to respect him, but that had changed."]},{"number":2612,"title":"Chapter 2612 - 1 vs 1,000 (1)","paragraphs":["Since Gu Xingyuan was second on the billboard, it was only natural for him to step up when his class was in trouble.","However, Gu Xingyuan crossed his arms and smirked.","Chu Junying tugged at his sleeve. “Shall we pretend to give them a hand?”","Gu Xingyuan gritted his teeth. “I’ll give anything to see her killed!”","His classmates were speechless.","Their impression of Gu Xingyuan immediately deteriorated.","“I don’t care what grudge he holds against Feng Wu. When the honor of this class is concerned, he should put aside his personal vendetta.”","“Class D has humiliated our class, and we’re going to fight for our honor. It’s not about Feng Wu!”","“That’s right! We’re defending our dignity!”","Wu Lingyue frowned.","She had been told that everybody in Class E despised Feng Wu, but why were they defending her now?","So be it. Soon, they would all hate Feng Wu.","Wu Lingyue stared at Feng Wu and said coldly, “Each team will consist of 1,000 students. I don’t care in what order your classmates will take the challenge, but you have to be the first player!”","Feng Wu turned around and said to the other students of Class E, “We’ll go in the order of your rankings on the billboard, from top to bottom.”","She was to go first, followed by Sun Jingyu, Pei Si, and the other students.","Class D students were doing it the other way round.","The first player was the 1,000th student on Class D’s billboard.","Wu Lingyue sneered at Feng Wu and thought, “She thinks she’s so amazing, does she? She’ll be killed by the exhaustion!”","She was eager to see how long Feng Wu could endure.","Chang Zhi was ranked 1,000th on Class D’s billboard.","Wu Lingyue was his goddess, and Feng Wu had just slapped Wu Lingyue. Because of that, Chang Zhi hated Feng Wu. He smirked at her and said, “How dare a mere Class E student behave so arrogantly? I’m gonna kill you!”","However, Feng Wu brushed him away before his fist could touch her.","Chang Zhi flew to the side, fell to the ground and was incapacitated.","The other students were all speechless.","The students of Class E had seen how Feng Wu handled Wang Junwen before and weren’t surprised, but the students of Class D didn’t expect to see this.","One punch.","How could a Class E student be so capable? She took out Chang Zhi with a single punch!","Feng Wu frowned. “This is too slow. Why don’t you come all at once?”","All at once?","All 1,000 of them? That was ridiculous!","The students of Class D felt humiliated.","“How dare she do this to us? She must have a death wish!”","“That’s right! We should teach her a lesson!”","The 999th student went over to Feng Wu and shouted, “Go to hell!”","Before he could utter another word, he was sent flying backward.","Feng Wu shook her head at Wu Lingyue. “You guys are so slow.”","Wu Lingyue felt her cheeks burn.","The weakest student of Class D was supposed to be better than the strongest student in Class E. This wasn’t supposed to happen!","Wu Lingyue stared at Feng Wu. “The rule says that we should fight in turn, but if you insist, we can send two players at a time.”","That would be faster, so Feng Wu nodded.","The 998th and 997th students went up on stage together.","They exchanged looks before they sneered at Feng Wu. “What a bold request. You’re going to regret it!”","Thump!","Feng Wu kicked both of them away before they could say another word."]},{"number":2613,"title":"Chapter 2613 - 1 vs 1,000 (2)","paragraphs":["The 998th and 997th students flew off in different directions.","Feng Wu’s classmates were amazed. They knew Feng Wu was good, but they didn’t think she was that good!","The Class D students frowned, and their faces darkened.","The 996th and 995th students went on stage...","Then the 994th and 993rd...","This continued until the 894th and 893rd, and Feng Wu lost her patience.","“Can you send more people?”","Wu Lingyue was speechless.","So were the students of Class D.","“Isn’t she tired after so many battles?”","One of the students said gingerly, “She only needed to use one kick each round, which probably isn’t too demanding...”","Wu Lingyue glared at her.","The student lowered her head.","Wu Lingyue took a deep breath. “We’ll go in groups of threes!”","That didn’t change anything. None of the groups could withstand a single strike.","Wu Lingyue said, “Four, then!”","Feng Wu still didn’t need to strike twice.","She yawned. “I’m getting sleepy. You guys should put more effort into it.”","The 555th student had just been kicked off the stage, and he wanted to cry when he heard those words.","“Put more effort into it? She makes it sound like we don’t want to, but we never get the chance! She kicks us off the stage before we can figure out what to do. How humiliating!”","Feng Wu urged Wu Lingyue. “Send more people.”","Wu Lingyue was shocked.","She looked like she had seen a ghost.","When Yu Hong and his friends said that Feng Wu was good, Wu Lingyue hadn’t thought much of it. After all, how good could a Class E student be?","However...","They were down to the 555th student.","And they had gone in groups of fours, but she still managed to kick away four people with a single kick. No one had seen her use a second strike. Was she even human?","Class D was crestfallen, while Class E was astonished.","“Feng Wu has just defeated the 555th student in a one-on-four battle. Does that mean that if she enters Class D now, she’ll be at least 555th among them?”","“She kicked away four students, including the 555th, all at once. Do you still think that she’d be the 555th?”","“What are you suggesting?”","“Just wait and see. I’m looking forward to the final outcome!”","“Do you think it’ll be like last time? Maybe none of us needs to fight, and we’ll each get 1,000 points for free!”","Lu Qi sneered at her classmates, finding their conversation stupid. “Are you idiots? Can’t you see that it was the weaker ones who went on stage first?","“They’ve only sent out 555 students, and the capable ones have yet to come!”","The Class E students immediately stopped cheering.","“That’s right... the stronger players haven’t gone up to the stage yet...”","They didn’t know how long Feng Wu could keep doing this for.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu asked Wu Lingyue, “Can you send more people?”","More people? Why was she asking for more people? Wu Lingyue looked resentfully at Feng Wu.","She was embarrassed that they still hadn’t been able to make Feng Wu strike twice, so she nodded. “We’ll attack her in groups of six students!”","Feng Wu shook her head. “Don’t be so stingy. What good can six people do?"]},{"number":2614,"title":"Chapter 2614 - 1 vs 1,000 (3)","paragraphs":["Stingy? Wu Lingyue was furious.","“Fine! I see you’re very proud of yourself!” Wu Lingyue turned to the next group of six students. “You know what to do.”","The leader of the group was a teenager called Yuan Shan, and he nodded. “Our top priority is to defeat Feng Wu!”","“Yes!” Wu Lingyue clenched her fists.","However, she was doomed to be disappointed.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Just like before, the six students were kicked off the stage.","They created large holes in the ground when they landed.","Wu Lingyue was speechless.","So were the other students of Class D.","Feng Wu shook her head at Wu Lingyue. “I told you so.”","Wu Lingyue was speechless.","She had sent over 500 classmates up on stage.","Six such students put together should be equivalent to at least one top 400 student.","This Feng Wu... This Feng Wu...","Students were applauding.","They were Feng Wu’s fellow classmates and had been prompted by Chaoge.","The applause continued.","All the Class E students rose to their feet excitedly and shouted as they clapped.","“You’re amazing, Feng Wu!”","“Keep up the good work!”","“Go get them!”","Her fans were so thrilled that they jumped to their feet.","Feng Wu fought six opponents at once, and it only took her one strike to beat them. Her fans were so proud of her!","The students of Class D were so frustrated that they all clenched their fists and wanted to fight Feng Wu.","Some even asked Wu Lingyue to send them up next.","Everyone was shouting at the same time.","Wu Lingyue almost lost control of the situation.","Over on Class E’s side.","Hearing the hubbub, Feng Wu gestured downward with her palm.","Everyone instantly quieted down.","It was amazing how easily she got everything under control.","Feng Wu turned to Wu Lingyue. “I’m getting sleepy. I want to go to bed.”","Wu Lingyue’s eyes widened. “Are you going to quit now?”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at her.","Chaoge chimed in, “We told you to send more people, but you wouldn’t. Why are you so fussy?! Can’t you read between the lines? Send more people!”","The Class E students were used to being bullied by Class D, and had never felt so satisfied before.","Hearing what Chaoge said, they hooted, “Send more people! Send more people!”","Even Sun Jingyu and Pei Si joined in.","Seeing how popular Feng Wu had become, Gu Xingyuan was displeased.","Wu Lingyue gritted her teeth and stared at Feng Wu. “I was going to make it easy for you, but you wouldn’t take the chance when you had it. Fine. You’ll get what you want!”","She gave the order. “Next ten, you’re up!”","The ten students were thrilled.","Finally, they could save Class D’s dignity.","However...","Thump! Thump! Thump!","It still only took Feng Wu one kick.","The ten students flew backward.","Wu Lingyue was speechless.","They all fell off the stage and landed on their heads.","When they were pulled out of the holes created by the impact, their heads were covered in blood. It was a shocking scene.","The students of Class D didn’t know what to say.","The students who had yet to go up were frightened.","They weren’t much more capable than those people; would the same thing happen to them?","Wu Lingyue said, “Send 20!”","Ten more people couldn’t make a difference; it had still only taken Feng Wu one kick."]},{"number":2615,"title":"Chapter 2615 - 1 vs 1,000 (4)","paragraphs":["Things moved much faster now that they were fighting in groups of 20 students.","Before long, there were only 50 students left, including Wu Lingyue.","At the same time...","All the students in both classes were astonished.","Feng Wu...","How could she be so capable?","There were fewer than a hundred students left, and no one could even touch her.","Was she even human?","The students of Class E were the most excited ones.","They had joined the fight on the spur of the moment, but once they could think straight again, they were shocked by their own choice.","They were going to confront the students of Class D. It could get them killed! However, they had already said that they would stand alongside Feng Wu; it would be too embarrassing to back out, so they decided to wait and see.","Then, they watched as Feng Wu annihilated Class D.","It was one-on-one battles at first, and it soon became one-on-two, one-on-four, and all the way to one-on-twenty.","Feng Wu kept winning.","She finished every battle with a single kick.","Was she even human?!","In Class E.","Sun Jingyu clapped until her palms were all red, but she went on clapping.","She knew she had underestimated Feng Wu, but she realized that “underestimated” was an understatement.","Pei Si was so astonished that she didn’t know what to say. The thought of her previous attempt to assassinate Feng Wu made her want to look for a hole to crawl into.","Countless people capered and clapped, but many people were displeased as well.","Lu Qi was one of the displeased ones.","The students who didn’t join the fight sat slightly further away.","“Damn it!”","Lu Qi was furious. She couldn’t understand how Feng Wu could be so capable.","“Lu Qi, do you think Feng Wu will defeat all of them?” one of Lu Qi’s friends asked timidly.","“Nonsense!” Lu Qi shouted. “That’s not going to happen! They still have 50 students to go. Although the top five students are out on a mission, what they have here is enough to crush Feng Wu!”","“But what if...”","Lu Qi smacked her forehead. “You’re right. Go find Huo Shan and the others! Now!”","Huo Shan was the top student of Class D.","Feng Wu looked at Wu Lingyue while Wu Lingyue stared back at her.","Feng Wu sighed. “How many people do you have left?”","Wu Lingyue ground her teeth. “50.”","Feng Wu casually suggested, “How about you send them all in one big group?”","Wu Lingyue asked, “Do you think we’re that weak?”","Feng Wu snapped, “I don’t want to think that way, but can you persuade me otherwise?”","“Shut up!”","“You’ve crossed the line!”","“She’s humiliating us, and I won’t have it!”","All the Class D students reacted strongly and demanded, “Let us fight her!”","They all wanted to be the next to fight Feng Wu.","Wu Lingyue felt conflicted.","Having observed Feng Wu for this long, she knew perfectly well that none of her classmates could beat Feng Wu in a one-on-one battle.","“Fine. All 50, then!” Wu Lingyue made up her mind.","“Wu Lingyue, what’s that supposed to mean? All 50? That’s not fair!” one of the Class D students questioned her decision.","Wu Lingyue ground her teeth.","Of course she wanted one-on-one battles, but Feng Wu wasn’t that kind of an opponent! She wasn’t even sure if 50 people would be enough to take Feng Wu down."]},{"number":2616,"title":"Chapter 2616 - Lost Again (1)","paragraphs":["“Fine. All 50, then!” Wu Lingyue made up her mind.","“Wu Lingyue, what’s that supposed to mean? All 50? That’s not fair!” One of the Class D students questioned her decision.","Wu Lingyue ground her teeth.","Of course she wanted 1v1 battles, but Feng Wu wasn’t that kind of opponent! She wasn’t even sure if 50 people would be enough to take Feng Wu down.","“I said 50, so 50 it is!” Wu Lingyue gritted her teeth.","Everybody who wasn’t a top ten student nodded because they were all shocked by Feng Wu’s capability.","They had never met a new student as good as she was.","However, the 6th to 10th were all proud students, so they all said no.","Wu Lingyue stomped her foot. “Why? That’s the best choice for us!”","He Yi, the 6th, said, “50 people is too many. It’s not fair to her.”","All the students of Class D and Class E heard him.","The students of Class D were so furious and didn’t think much of what He Yi said, but the students of Class E opened their eyes wide.","Was he too arrogant or hypocritical? If a 1v50 battle wasn’t fair, would five fewer people make a difference?","They protested, saying that Class D had crossed the line.","Wu Lingyue stared at He Yi. Feng Wu had agreed to a 1v50 battle; they should take advantage of it!","They would all have to pay 1,000 points if they lost. Class D would go bankrupt!","No matter what Wu Lingyue said, He Yi shook his head decisively. “If all 45 lose, we’ll get the points back for you.”","Wu Lingyue was furious, but Feng Wu only said, “Are we fighting or not? You can always surrender. That way, no one will get hurt.”","Those words set Wu Lingyue off.","She stomped her foot and glared at Feng Wu. “Of course we’re going to fight! You said you could fight 50 people at once! It’s not like we’re taking advantage of you!”","Feng Wu casually said, “I thought it would make things move faster.”","Wu Lingyue said, “I see how arrogant you are, Feng Wu. Let’s see how long you can keep it up! Get her!”","The 11th to the 55th, Wu Lingyue included, charged at Feng Wu together.","What would happen to Feng Wu?","The Class D students were excited.","They were sure that Feng Wu would lose this time.","They had no problem with having 45 students fight Feng Wu.","The Class E students disagreed.","They were anxious when they saw the 45 students running at Feng Wu.","The three groups still existed.","The number of Feng Wu’s fans had continued to grow all this time.","They switched from being anti-fans to the neutral camp before becoming Feng Wu’s fans.","There were fewer than 100 anti-fans left and over 1,000 fans.","Zhao Zhen felt overwhelmed.","Most of the Class E students were displeased.","“How can they do this?!”"]},{"number":2617,"title":"Chapter 2617 - Lost Again (2)","paragraphs":["“That’s ridiculous! 45 people?!”","“They’re ranked from 11th to 55th in Class D!”","“At that level, the 45 of them can probably defeat Mr. Luo of our class.”","“It isn’t a fair match even if they win!”","“Before, it was 50 of us who used to fight one student in Class D. Things have turned around!”","“But no matter how capable Feng Wu is, she’s not invincible. She’s only 14 years old. How is she going to fight all those older students?!”","“I protest this decision!”","...","Mu Qianqian looked at the players on the stage and asked nervously, “Boss Feng Wu is going to lose, isn’t she?”","Before she knew it, Feng Wu was her “boss.”","Sun Jingyu also thought that Feng Wu had almost reached her limit, but then she recalled how Feng Wu had struck Mr. Luo unconscious with a single blow, so she said, “I don’t know about that. Somehow, I feel that Feng Wu will show us a miracle again.”","Pei Si said, “No, there won’t be any miracles today.”","Everyone looked at her.","She said, “The 10th of Class D is a Level 4 Spiritual Lord who has reached perfection in their cultivation level, and the 55th is an intermediate Level 4 Spiritual Lord. There’s no way that Feng Wu can defeat all of them. It’s just not going to happen.”","Mu Qianqian said, “The Class D students are so capable!”","Zi Ling wrung her hands, feeling worried.","However, Chaoge smiled.","“They’re only Level 4 Spiritual Lords.”","The other students looked at her in resignation. Only Level 4 Spiritual Lords? She made it sound like that wasn’t difficult enough.","They were still discussing among themselves, when someone cried out.","“Look!”","The 45 students had formed a circle, trapping Feng Wu in the middle.","They slowly closed in.","“It’s a formation!” Sun Jingyu, who had been confident about Feng Wu until then, shouted in surprise. “It’s a battle formation used specifically by the military! This is bad!”","The others asked her about it.","Sun Jingyu said, “This is a powerful formation that can double the effectiveness of their attacks!”","“Isn’t there a way to break it?” Zi Ling asked anxiously.","Sun Jingyu said, “The 45 people must have a leader. Once that person is incapacitated, the formation will stop working. Otherwise, Feng Wu will...”","The Class E students grew nervous.","They hadn’t expected things to go this far.","Feng Wu was much more capable than they could ever imagine. She had defeated all her opponents so far, which only further raised their expectations. They were even considering the possibility that she could challenge the top student of Class D.","“We were asking too much of her.”","“Feng Wu has already done a great job. If she had fought them one at a time, she would have made it to the top three of Class D.”","“That’s right. We can’t ask for too much...”","While they were trying to lower their expectations of Feng Wu, Feng Wu made her move.","She looked up to find Wu Lingyue hiding from her.","Wu Lingyue tried to hide behind another student.","Really?","Feng Wu smiled.","The next second, she jumped into the air."]},{"number":2618,"title":"Chapter 2618 - Lost Again (3)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu moved swiftly toward Wu Lingyue. She grabbed the girl and threw her out of the circle.","Thump!","Wu Lingyue was 11th in her class.","She was the most capable student in the group.","There was nothing she could do when Feng Wu grabbed her, and by the time she realized what was going on, she was at the bottom of a crater. She was in so much pain that she didn’t have the strength to climb out.","He Yi rushed to her side and scooped her out of the crater. When he examined her, he found that three of her ribs were broken.","Everyone was looking at Wu Lingyue.","They were amazed by how efficient Feng Wu’s attack was.","Before long, more than half of the group had been thrown off the stage.","When the crowd finally moved their gaze from Wu Lingyue to the stage, they saw the students of Class D lying on the ground and crying out in pain. It was incredible!","“OMG!”","“What’s going on?”","“When did that happen?”","“I only looked away for a second...”","Everyone looked at Feng Wu in astonishment.","How amazing!","Wu Lingyue lay on the ground and stared at Feng Wu.","“Damn it! If I had been more careful, she would never have been able to...”","Her classmates gave her strange looks.","Wu Lingyue couldn’t finish her sentence.","Meanwhile, the students of Class E jumped to their feet and applauded.","They were so thrilled that they couldn’t stop shouting.","How uplifting!","The students of Class E were buoyed by Feng Wu’s achievements.","Class D used to pick on them and would scold and hit them for no reason. Class E was at the bottom of the food chain.","But now...","Every student of Class E was thrilled to the bone.","There were fewer than 100 anti-fans left, and after this battle, even more people switched sides.","Soon, there were fewer than 20 people left.","Lu Qi was cursing at the top of her lungs, but it was to no avail.","Even her closest friends were looking eagerly at Feng Wu’s fans.","On stage, Feng Wu was asking, “Are you ready to give in yet?”","Give in?","Wu Lingyue thought she would break down when over 40 of them couldn’t do anything to Feng Wu. Most of the Class D students felt the same way.","But she didn’t want to surrender.","Not yet!","Wu Lingyue gave He Yi a pleading look.","He Yi had been examining Wu Lingyue. Seeing that she wasn’t severely injured, he nodded and turned to Feng Wu. “I’ll fight you.”","Feng Wu frowned. “Just you?”","He Yi said, “Yes, just me.”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s your ranking?”","He Yi said, “I’m 6th.”","Feng Wu looked at the four students behind He Yi. “The five of you can form a team.”","He Yi shook his head. “That won’t be necessary. I’m more than enough to fight you.”"]},{"number":2619,"title":"Chapter 2619 - Lost Again (4)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu said impatiently, “I don’t have that much time to waste. Either you come in a group of five, or you surrender.”","That tone...","If Feng Wu had said such things before today, she would have drowned in the criticism.","All the students in both classes would have laughed at her for being so arrogant.","However, everybody felt that Feng Wu had every right to make such a claim.","He Yi was furious. He stared at Feng Wu and said, “How conceited you are!”","Feng Wu said, “It’ll only take one strike to defeat all of you.”","He Yi smirked. “If you think so, I’ll give you what you want. Guys, let’s do this!”","He Yi and the other four students charged at Feng Wu.","The 45-people circle was too crowded for everyone to fight Feng Wu simultaneously, but the five-member team was just the right size.","However, Feng Wu made her move before they were close enough.","It was just like she had predicted. She took care of all of them with one strike.","“Good fight,” Feng Wu said indifferently.","The crowd was speechless.","They thought they couldn’t be any more astonished, but as it turned out, after all this time, they could still be shocked once more.","“Feng Wu is incredible!”","“Those are the 6th to 10th of Class D!”","“And it still only took her one strike!”","“He Yi was bragging about how he alone would be enough to fight Feng Wu, but look what happened. All five of them weren’t enough!”","“What is Feng Wu’s level? Is she a Level 5 Spiritual Lord?”","“I think she’s higher than that...”","...","While Class E was discussing it avidly, the students of Class D looked defeated.","Wu Lingyue felt as if she had been struck by lightning.","It took her a while to digest the situation.","She was roused by Feng Wu’s voice. “Anyone else?”","Her eyes widened when she realized something.","She was right to do so because Feng Wu said something right after that.","“If there’s no one else, pay up.”","She was talking about the points.","Wu Lingyue wished that she had passed out.","Because she was the most popular girl of Class D, she had made a bet with Class E on behalf of Class D, thinking that it would give her a just cause to teach Feng Wu a lesson.","However, it had never occurred to her that Feng Wu would be so formidable!","She cursed under her breath.","Seeing that no one would speak, Feng Wu frowned at Wu Lingyue. “What? Are you going to go back on your word now?”","Hearing that, the students of Class E grew excited.","“That’s right! We’ve defeated all 1,000 students! They’ve lost!”","“Feng Wu defeated all of them; they couldn’t even make her act twice!”","“They didn’t even fight her one at a time! They came in groups! Groups of four, five, and even 45!”","“Since when are Class D students so weak?”","“It’s not that. Feng Wu is just so powerful!”","The students of Class E couldn’t stop singing Feng Wu’s praises.","Not only did Feng Wu make them proud, she also earned them so many points!","1,000 points each!"]},{"number":2620,"title":"Chapter 2620 - Unexpected Arrival (1)","paragraphs":["They hadn’t even needed to do anything.","Only 1,000 students of Class E had joined the battle, so about 500 to 600 students wouldn’t receive any points.","They had all once been Feng Wu’s anti-fans, but now, they hated Lu Qi.","Feng Wu asked Wu Lingyue for the points which Class D owed Class E.","Wu Lingyue wished she could pretend to pass out. She grew more and more anxious, when a realization hit her.","Wait!","He Yi wasn’t the strongest student of Class D. He was only 6th!","Five more students were more advanced than he was!","Those five were a team, and Huo Shan was their team leader.","Yes, they needed to find Huo Shan!","As soon as she realized that, she heard footsteps nearby.","Footsteps?","Everyone turned around to see a five-student team.","The leader was none other than Huo Shan himself.","Wu Lingyue was so excited that she was almost in tears.","Huo Shan!","“It’s Huo Shan!” Wu Lingyue struggled to her feet despite her broken ribs and ran toward him. “Huo Shan! They’ve humiliated our class! We’re counting on you now!”","She could finally think straight.","She knew that Huo Shan wasn’t interested in her.","She had both implicitly and explicitly expressed her feelings for Huo Shan several times, but Huo Shan had remained indifferent, which greatly frustrated her.","She knew that Huo Shan would probably ignore her if she asked him to get revenge for her, so she had to turn the issue into a matter of the entire class’s honor.","Everyone looked at Huo Shan. More precisely, they looked at his team.","They all had injuries on them. It was clear that they had gone through some brutal battle.","Huo Shan stood there empty-handed while the four people behind him carried game.","The students didn’t recognize what it was, but Mr. Zhu was surprised.","“It’s a Four-Horned Blood Lion!” he cried out.","The students asked, “What’s that? Is it tough to kill?”","Mr. Zhu took a deep breath and assumed an indifferent tone. “They’re Level 5 Spiritual Lords that have reached their peak.”","What?!!!","The students gasped.","Level 5 Spiritual Lord? Peak?","The beast was covered in blood and was obviously dead.","Hou Shan’s team had killed such a formidable beast!","Wu Lingyue was elated.","That proved how impressive Huo Shan was.","She thought, “If they can lend us a hand, we’ll win this battle, and we won’t need to pay the points!”","She grabbed Huo Shan’s arm and shouted, “Huo Shan, our class needs you now! Please help us!”","The other students weren’t deaf.","Wu Lingyue’s request was a hint.","They all chimed in, asking for Huo Shan’s help.","Huo Shan frowned. “What’s going on?”","Wu Lingyue quickly filled him in on today’s events and stressed, “Not only did Feng Wu kill Wang Junwen, she also humiliated our class! We can’t let her do that!”"]},{"number":2621,"title":"Chapter 2621 - Unexpected Arrival (2)","paragraphs":["Yu Hong and Lei Bao nodded in excitement.","They had been thrilled when Wu Lingyue said that she would avenge Wang Junwen, but what happened later only disappointed them.","Lei Bao had tried to tell himself that he hadn’t done his best today, but when he saw what Feng Wu was capable of, he didn’t dare utter a word.","The students of Class D put all their hopes on Huo Shan.","Huo Shan frowned and looked up at Feng Wu.","One glance, and he froze.","He recognized that face.","Why was she here?!","Wu Lingyue was still filling him in on what Feng Wu had done.","Huo Shan wasn’t listening.","He stared at Feng Wu without blinking.","Huo Shan was a member of the Martial Arts Society.","Chen Ziyun, the president of the society, had held a meeting with the core members before they went out on this mission.","He carefully told them that the War Academy would soon have a new member. She was going to be incredible, and her name was Feng Wu. Not Zuo Qingluan, but Feng Wu.","He said that someone higher up the food chain had ordered him to protect Feng Wu once she arrived. It had to be subtle so that no one would notice.","Miss Feng Wu was said to be excellent.","Huo Shan didn’t believe it at first. If the girl was so important, why would she go to Class E in the first place?","But when he saw Feng Wu and all the Class D students that were howling on the ground, he asked involuntarily, “Did you really defeat every single one of them?”","Feng Wu asked, “Do you want to join them?”","Huo Shan jumped in fright.","“Join what?”","Feng Wu said matter-of-factly, “Join Class D’s team, obviously.”","Huo Shan paled.","Class E started protesting.","“You can’t do this! Our deal was 1,000 vs 1,000! You can’t add five more people now!”","The students of Class D said, “Why can’t we? Huo Shan is a member of our class! If you find it unfair, you can always add five more people to your team!”","Class E students said, “Why do we need five more people? Feng Wu alone is more than enough!”","Students of Class D gloated. “If you think so highly of Feng Wu, let her fight. We’ll admit our defeat when she beats all the students in our class. We’ll then transfer you the points!”","...","The students of the two classes had a row.","Huo Shan’s face went pale.","Of course, he wouldn’t dare fight Feng Wu.","Chen Ziyun was his cousin, so when the others left, Huo Shan asked him in private who Feng Wu was and which prominent figure wanted to protect her.","Chen Ziyun gave him a mysterious smile and pointed upward.","Huo Shan was perplexed. “What do you mean?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Do you remember Young Lord Feng? He’s my boss.”","Huo Shan said, “Of course I do! He’s so famous here in the War Academy! Everybody knows who he is! Plus, he’s the crown prince’s childhood friend!”","Chen Ziyun chuckled. “He’s the one who asked me to protect Feng Wu.”","Huo Shan asked, “Are Feng Wu and the young lord an item?”"]},{"number":2622,"title":"Chapter 2622 - Unexpected Arrival (3)","paragraphs":["“Shut up!” Chen Ziyun threw him a dirty look. “Listen, it’s about His Royal Highness...”","He whispered something in Huo Shan’s ear before saying, “I’m only telling you this because you’re my cousin. Don’t tell another soul, or we’re both dead!”","Huo Shan scratched his ear. That last sentence had been so loud that he thought his eardrums would break.","His Royal Highness... Really?","“Huo Shan? Huo Shan!”","Seeing that Huo Shan was lost in thought, Wu Lingyue shouted his name.","How could his mind wander off now?","Huo Shan woke up from his reverie.","Wu Lingyue was saying something to him, trying to egg him on.","Huo Shan gave her an indifferent look before walking up to Feng Wu.","Wu Lingyue grew suspicious.","What was going on with Huo Shan? Why did it feel like he was being diffident? Wu Lingyue couldn’t believe her eyes.","Feng Wu also looked at Huo Shan suspiciously.","She asked, “Are you going to join the fight?”","Huo Shan was baffled.","Feng Wu asked, “Do you want to fight me?”","Huo Shan immediately shook his head. “Of course not!” He would never dare fight the future wife of the crown prince!","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure?”","Huo Shan nodded.","Feng Wu then asked, “So, what about the points you owe us?”","She didn’t care much about the points, but it would help her classmates greatly.","Huo Shan said, “Of course we’ll pay our debt! It’s the right thing to do!”","All the other students were amazed.","Students from both classes stared at him in bewilderment.","Wu Lingyue was more shocked than the others.","She never saw it coming.","“Huo Shan, you...” Not only wouldn’t he fight, he also agreed to give away the points. Had he forgotten that he was a member of Class D?","His classmates glared at him.","Huo Shan could single-handedly defeat all his classmates, and he wouldn’t let anyone challenge his authority.","When his classmates glared at him, he immediately glared back.","The look in his eyes intimidated the others, and they didn’t dare look up again.","Feng Wu smiled at Huo Shan. “Your name is Huo Shan, isn’t it?”","“Yes,” Huo Shan said respectfully.","The boss of his boss had given him the command. Of course he had to obey.","Feng Wu said, “In that case, can you collect the points for us?”","She was only probing, but Huo Shan immediately agreed. “With pleasure!”","Wu Lingyue said, “What pleasure? Huo Shan, why are you helping an outsider?”","She was furious not only because Huo Shan refused to help but also because of his attitude toward Feng Wu. Wu Lingyue had tried to suck up to Huo Shan before, but he only ignored her.","When Huo Shan walked past Wu Lingyue, he said coldly, “Such a loser.”","What?!","Wu Lingyue felt as if she had been slapped.","Huo Shan asked his classmates, “Are you angry at me for not fighting for you?”","Of course they were, but they didn’t dare say it."]},{"number":2623,"title":"Chapter 2623 - Unexpected Arrival (4)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu had given Huo Shan a signed agreement, and Huo Shan showed it to his classmates. “It’s written here that each class would come up with 1,000 students. You’ve all lost, right?","“If that’s the case, why are you asking me to fight? Can a signed agreement be changed so easily?","“Every student in Class D used to be in Class E before they passed the test, but now, 1,000 of you have all been defeated by one Class E student! Aren’t you ashamed of yourselves?”","The students of Class D were so embarrassed that they didn’t know what to say.","But Huo Shan was just getting started.","He shook the piece of paper and laughed at his classmates. “And that’s not all. You fought her in groups of three, five, ten, and even 45! Still, you weren’t her match! How can you bring yourself to say that it was unfair for you?!","“It was unfair for them! They’re a grade lower than you, and they put up with all your unreasonable requests, but you still lost so miserably! Do you have any shame at all? How could you make such requests?!”","“How were we supposed to know Feng Wu...” Wu Lingyue protested, thinking that she was important enough to speak.","But Huo Shan cut her off.","He glared at her.","“Wu Lingyue, you’re the ridiculous one!”Search . on google”? If you hadn’t thought so highly of yourself and made such a reckless move, all our classmates would never have gotten involved in this farce! You’re jealous of Feng Wu, and our class paid for your pride and narrow-mindedness!”","Wu Lingyue had never been so humiliated before and almost burst into tears.","“I, I just...” Wu Lingyue’s face was covered with tears. “Why should I be jealous of her? What has she got? I’m not jealous!”","She couldn’t understand why Huo Shan would take Feng Wu’s side.","Huo Shan smirked. “What has she got? She’s prettier and smarter than you! She’s also more talented and more capable! She’s better than you in every possible way! What? You don’t want to admit it? Then convince me otherwise!”","Wu Lingyue was so frustrated that she nearly fainted.","“You...” She couldn’t stop crying. Pointing at Huo Shan, she shouted like a mad person. “Why are you defending her? Are you in love with her?”","In love with Feng Wu?!","Huo Shan was scared out of his wits by that suggestion.","D*mn it!","Those words could get him killed! He knew he couldn’t be the only one here who knew about Feng Wu’s relationship with the crown prince, and if His Royal Highness heard such a rumor...","“I don’t want to die!”","Huo Shan glared at Wu Lingyue as though she was his archenemy.","Wu Lingyue couldn’t understand why Huo Shan was so angry and scared. Yes, he was genuinely frightened.","“I’m not in love with Feng Wu!” Huo Shan repeated, as if trying to convince someone else here. “I’m not! It’s true!”","Wu Lingyue smirked. “Then why are you so protective of her? Are you her errand boy?”","Errand boy? Huo Shan’s eyes lit up. “That’s right! I’m her errand boy! Do you have a problem with that?”"]},{"number":2624,"title":"Chapter 2624 - Winner (1)","paragraphs":["D*mn!!!","This time, everyone who heard Huo Shan was shocked.","The students of Class E were speechless.","So were the students of Class D.","They stood there as if they had been struck by lightning.","What a terrifying thing to say!","Had Huo Shan been drugged? Did he know what he was saying?","Even the teachers stared at Huo Shan as if they were seeing a ghost.","“Huo Shan, you...” Mr. Wang, who had been watching in silence, couldn’t help but speak up.","Huo Shan nodded at him. “It’s true. I admire Feng Wu for her talent and capability, and I would do anything for her, but it has nothing to do with affection!”","He knew he couldn’t be suspected of being in love with Feng Wu, not even slightly. According to Chen Ziyun, the crown prince almost beat Young Lord Feng to death because there was a rumor that the young lord had feelings for Feng Wu.","Everyone was speechless.","In the end, Huo Shan scolded his classmates for over an hour, and they each paid 1,000 points.","It wasn’t that they wanted to, but they had no choice.","Huo Shan said that anyone who refused to pay the points would be kicked out of Class D, which was an effective threat.","The students of Class E couldn’t believe their good luck.","They had earned 1,000 points just like that!","They still felt dizzy by the time the event ended.","“Did we just earn 1,000 points?”","“Why do I feel like I’m dreaming?”","“Pinch me! I need to know if I’m awake!”","...","Needless to say, not everyone was as happy as they were.","The excited students were all those who had joined the fight, and they were mainly the neutral camp and Feng Wu’s fans.","As for Feng Wu’s anti-fans, they naturally didn’t participate in the fight because they were so sure that Feng Wu would lose. As a result, they didn’t get to enjoy the reward.","Seeing the 1,000 points that each of their classmates received, they were so jealous that they thought they would lose their minds.","Many of them surrounded Lu Qi.","Lu Qi said, “What? Are you going to hit me now?”","One of them snarled, “We wouldn’t have refused to join the fight if it hadn’t been for you!”","Lu Qi was rendered speechless.","She had genuinely believed that they were going to lose, and anyone in their right mind would have stayed out of it. These people wouldn’t have joined the fight even if she hadn’t stopped them.","However, now that they didn’t get the points, they lashed out at her because they needed an outlet.","They surrounded Lu Qi and started beating her up.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was surrounded by many people.","Their expressions were earnest and excited. Right now, they would lay down their lives for Feng Wu if needed.","They followed Feng Wu and left.","Feng Wu went back to Room 2001.","Many students wanted to sneak in to get familiar with Feng Wu.","Chaoge stopped them all.","She knew that Feng Wu didn’t like unnecessary socializing, so she blocked the doorway. “Xiao Wu fought so many battles, and she needs to rest now. I’m sorry, but she’s not receiving guests at the moment.”","Chaoge and Zi Ling stood by the door and wouldn’t let anyone in.","Not even Sun Jingyu and Pei Si.","The other students understood that decision."]},{"number":2625,"title":"Chapter 2625 - Winner (2)","paragraphs":["Chaoge had a point. Feng Wu had fought 1,000 students of Class D. She had to be exhausted.","The crowd envied Zi Ling.","Chaoge came here with Feng Wu, and the two of them had always been close. However, why was Zi Ling the lucky girl? Why did she get to hang out with Feng Wu? The other students wished they could switch places with her.","They then recalled that Sun Jingyu and Pei Si had teamed up with Feng Wu before, so they had to know Feng Wu’s preferences.","Poor Sun Jingyu and Pei Si. They had never dreamed that they would be warmly welcomed one day because of Feng Wu.","Chaoge went to talk to Feng Wu after she dismissed the crowd.","“Xiao Wu, do you know Huo Shan?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “No, I don’t.”","Chaoge said, “That’s strange. It seemed that he was trying to please you. He wasn’t just being kind. He genuinely respects you, and you didn’t even fight him. Is he that weak?”","Zi Ling’s eyes lit up. “Huo Shan is competent!”","Chaoge looked at her.","Zi Ling clenched her fists. “Huo Shan is a Level 5 Spiritual Lord at his peak. He’s easily the best student of Class D. He’s good enough to go to Class C, but he chose to stay back. Plus, he’s so handsome. Over half of the girls in Class E have a crush on him. Wu Lingyue is in love with him, too!”","Zi Ling’s face glowed when she talked about Huo Shan.","Chaoge said, “Huo Shan is much better-looking than Lu Xiao. If you like, you can have a go with him...”","Zi Ling blushed profusely before Chaoge could finish. “Don’t say that! I’ll never be good enough for him! If you say something like that again, I won’t talk to you anymore!”","She ran off after that.","Chaoge was dumbfounded.","“Fine. I get that she doesn’t want me to say it, but she didn’t need to run away, did she?” Chaoge said impatiently. “I was only joking. She doesn’t have to like him.”","Feng Wu shook her head. It was pretty apparent that Zi Ling liked Huo Shan as well.","However, Feng Wu didn’t want to interfere with other people’s life decisions, so she didn’t say anything.","At the entrance of the dormitory.","Zi Ling was stopped before she could rush out.","“Zi Ling!” Lu Xiao greeted her excitedly and grabbed her hand. “I’ve been waiting for you!”","Zi Ling’s first reaction was to shake off his hand.","Lu Xiao couldn’t believe it.","Zi Ling had brushed him off!","“Zi Ling!” Lu Xiao couldn’t believe it. “I’m Lu Xiao. Why did you do that?”","Zi Ling stared at him and came back to her senses.","She looked from Lu Xiao to her hand and was amazed by her own involuntary move.","She had lost many nights of sleep over him, but now, she could push him away as quickly as that.","She put a hand over her heart. It had stopped hurting.","Seeing that Zi Ling had stopped talking, Lu Xiao thought she had changed her mind. So, he approached her with a smile on his face. “Zi Ling, I’m Lu Xiao. I’m the man you love!”"]},{"number":2626,"title":"Chapter 2626 - Winner (3)","paragraphs":["Out of the corner of her eye, Zi Ling saw Zhen Ya running toward them. The idea of getting revenge made her want to smile.","“Brother Xiao?” Zi Ling gave him a half-smile.","Lu Xiao nodded excitedly. “That’s right! I’m your Brother Xiao!”","Zi Ling said indifferently, “But aren’t you in love with Zhen Ya now?”","Lu Xiao sounded agitated. “I’m not in love with her! I never was!”","Zhen Ya was running toward them, and she was shocked when she heard that.","Zi Ling was satisfied when she saw Zhen Ya’s twisted expression.","She had been feeling depressed for a long time, and her mind was finally clearing up.","They were right outside the dormitory, and many students were passing by.","More people gathered around to enjoy the scene.","Zi Ling asked, “Did you say that you aren’t in love with Zhen Ya and have never been in love with her?”","Lu Xiao nodded without hesitation.","Zi Ling said, “If that’s the case, why did you sleep with her? I grew up with you! I was your fiancee!”","The other students’ eyes widened when they heard this.","What?","That was something they hadn’t heard before!","Zi Ling had never tried to hide her relationship with Lu Xiao, but she had been a nobody before today’s event, so no one paid any attention.","But things were different now.","Feng Wu made a name for herself after the battles. As her loyal friends, Chaoge and Zi Ling attracted much attention as well.","Because of that, what Zi Ling said soon spread.","It had never occurred to Lu Xiao that Zi Ling, who used to be a docile girl, could become so inflexible. However, he had his plan, so he had to put up with her attitude.","He would abandon Zi Ling once he used her to get close to Feng Wu.","Lu Xiao had never doubted his charm. After all, both Zhen Ya and Zi Ling were infatuated with him.","“Zi Ling, that was because Zhen Ya threw herself at me! I didn’t want to, but you know what men are like. She was so willing, and I thought I shouldn’t waste that opportunity. I didn’t know she could be so sinister! She let you know what was going to happen and made sure you caught us in the act! Ling, I’m sorry about everything. Can you forgive me? If you say yes, I’ll be your Brother Xiao forever!”","Zi Ling stared at him.","It was as if she had never known Lu Xiao before.","That was so...","She had never dreamed she would see such a shameless side to him.","“Zi Ling...” Seeing the astonished look on Zi Ling’s face, Lu Xiao suddenly had a bad feeling.","He was about to walk up to her, when someone jumped at him.","Smack!","Zhen Ya slapped him with the back of her hand.","Lu Xiao was dumbfounded. “Zhen Ya, you...”","Zhen Ya wanted to hit Zi Ling, but Lu Xiao stopped her.","“Lu Xiao, did you say I threw myself at you? That’s ridiculous!” Zhen Ya bellowed. “Yes, I got involved with you when you were still with Zi Ling, but you fell in love with me! You talked me into sleeping with you, but you’re saying that I’m the one who started everything? Lu Xiao, you’ve crossed the line!”","Lu Xiao didn’t expect that Zhen Ya would hear him, and he didn’t know what to do.","“I... I...”"]},{"number":2627,"title":"Chapter 2627 - Winner (4)","paragraphs":["Zi Ling smirked. “So, you’re trying to get back with me when you haven’t broken up with Zhen Ya. Lu Xiao, which one of us do you want to be with?”","Zhen Ya also smirked. “That’s right. Who is it gonna be?”","Lu Xiao didn’t know what to do.","Zhen Ya was connected to Mr. Zhu and Miss Zhen, which gave her a lot of influence in Class E. However, Feng Wu was the one he wanted, and Zi Ling could make the introduction. At that thought, Lu Xiao turned to Zhen Ya. “Zhen Ya, I’m really sorry...”","Zhen Ya stared at him in disbelief. “Why?! My dad is the tutor of Class E, and my mother runs the cultivation rooms! I’ve done you so many favors, but you’re abandoning me now!","“I see!” Zhen Ya pointed at Zi Ling. “You’re choosing her now because of Feng Wu, isn’t it?!”","Of course, Lu Xiao wasn’t going to expose his real intention just yet. He apologized to Zhen Ya and made it look like he was ready to accept any form of punishment.","Huo Shan and his friends were walking this way. They weren’t going to join the onlookers, but Huo Shan changed his mind when he spotted Zi Ling.","Meanwhile, Zhen Ya was glaring at Lu Xiao. “Why are you afraid of her? My father is the tutor! Yes, Feng Wu is very capable, but once she goes to Class D, she’ll forget about Zi Ling in no time!”","Lu Xiao gritted his teeth. Feng Wu wouldn’t stay in Class E for much longer, and he had to move faster.","With the shine of love gone, Zhen Ya immediately saw through Lu Xiao.","“You!” She stared at Lu Xiao in disbelief. “You’re going to use Zi Ling to get to Feng Wu, aren’t you?!”","Lu Xiao glared at Zhen Ya.","Zhen Ya knew Lu Xiao well. Seeing Lu Xiao’s reaction, she knew she was right.","She said, “Have you lost your mind? Do you seriously think Feng Wu will fall for you?”","As much as Zhen Ya disliked Feng Wu, she had to admit Feng Wu’s capability. Even Huo Shan wanted to follow her. Who did Lu Xiao think he was?","Lu Xiao shot her a warning look. “Shut up!”","A few steps away, Huo Shan was shocked by what he just heard.","Lu Xiao was trying to get to Feng Wu!","Had he lost his mind? Feng Wu was His Royal Highness’s girl!","Before Huo Shan could move closer, Zi Ling picked up a rock the size of a basin and smashed it down on Lu Xiao’s head.","Lu Xiao was caught off guard.","His head cracked open, and he passed out on the ground.","He didn’t even know why Zi Ling attacked him.","Zhen Ya stared at Zi Ling in disbelief. “How... How could you...”","Zi Ling threw away the rock and dusted off her hands. “Xiao Wu would never look at him! And you!”","Zi Ling stepped forward and slapped Zhen Ya in the face.","Smack!","She used so much force that Zhen Ya almost flew backward.","Zi Ling snorted. “That’s for everything you did to me. We’re even now!”","The middle-aged moderator had always been a snobbish woman. So far, she still hadn’t heard of Feng Wu’s battle, and she still considered Zi Ling to be some kind of inferior student.","Meanwhile —"]},{"number":2628,"title":"Chapter 2628 - Winner (5)","paragraphs":["Seeing that Lu Xiao and Zhen Ya had been attacked, the moderator stepped out and scolded Zi Ling. “No fighting in the living quarters! Get out now! You’re banned from the dormitory for a month!”","Zi Ling stared at her. She was reminded of what a sycophant the woman was and how she treated Feng Wu.","Zi Ling smirked. “I have no problem with you helping Zhen Ya, but do you know how Mr. Luo got injured?”","It was Feng Wu who had done it. Because of the injury, Mr. Luo was still bedridden.","The moderator stared at Zi Ling and wondered how she knew.","“It was Feng Wu’s doing!” Zhen Ya told the others.","Now that Feng Wu had made public her capability, Zi Ling didn’t mind Zhen Ya telling other people about it. She chimed in, “That’s right. Xiao Wu was the one who injured Mr. Luo!”","All the students were shocked.","Feng Wu had injured a teacher! They didn’t know she could do that!","However, they didn’t know what to say when they remembered Feng Wu’s performance during the battles. Maybe she really could defeat a teacher.","The moderator was taken aback. Feng Wu? As in the girl she had mistreated since the beginning?","Zi Ling smiled. “But what you don’t know is that Mr. Luo tried to kill Feng Wu first, and there’s no point denying it because there were plenty of witnesses. If anyone wants to defend Mr. Luo, they’ll lose.”","Zhen Ya suddenly had a bad feeling.","She was right to feel so. Zi Ling said, “Why did Mr. Luo want to kill Feng Wu? It was because he wanted to avenge a certain woman.”","Zi Ling grinned at the moderator. “Feng Wu taught that woman a lesson, and that woman complained to her husband, who wouldn’t do anything. Therefore, she went to see Mr. Luo. You’ve worked here for many years; I think you know what I’m talking about.”","After hanging out with Feng Wu for a while, Zi Ling had learned from the master; she was no longer a simple-minded girl.","While they were talking, the crowd around them grew larger.","The moderator’s face darkened.","So that was why her husband had been injured...","“That’s bullsh*t!” After calming down a little, she stared at Zi Ling and wouldn’t believe what she had been told.","“If you don’t believe me, ask Zhen Ya. She saw the whole thing.” Chaoge arrived at that moment and smiled at the moderator. “Sun Jingyu and Pei Si saw it, too. They’re right there. They can tell you what happened.”","Both Chaoge and Zi Ling remembered how snobbish the woman had been, and they wanted to “return the favor.” It just so happened that the woman had decided to take Zhen Ya’s side today.","Sun Jingyu and Pei Si smiled bitterly at each other.","They had already picked their side.","Sun Jingyu said, “They’re telling the truth.”","Pei Si said, “Yes, I can prove it.”","The moderator stared at Zhen Ya.","Zhen Ya’s heart raced.","“I...”","Before she could say another word, the moderator went back to her room, grabbed a cleaver, and stormed off.","Where was she going?"]},{"number":2629,"title":"Chapter 2629 - Genius Girl (1)","paragraphs":["Needless to say, she was going to cause some trouble for Miss Zhen.","Poor Miss Zhen. She had no idea that a war was coming her way.","Zhen Ya glared at Chaoge and Zi Ling, finding them extremely annoying.","Lu Xiao was alarmed because things weren’t turning out the way he had expected.","Where was the obedient Zi Ling he remembered?","“Zi Ling, are you really going to turn your back on Brother Xiao? You’re so heartless...”","Chaoge was amused.","She couldn’t understand why Zi Ling would fall for such a pretentious man in the first place. She would be really disappointed if Zi Ling forgave him.","Luckily, Zi Ling didn’t let her down.","She sneered at Lu Xiao. “You hooked up with Zhen Ya when you were still my boyfriend, and you’re accusing me of abandoning you now. I’ve never met anyone as shameless as you!”","Zi Ling’s words felt like a slap to Lu Xiao’s face. He was mortified.","Overwhelmed by frustration, Lu Xiao snapped at Zi Ling, “You were engaged to me once! If you don’t marry me, you won’t find a husband! You’ll be alone for the rest of your life!”","He was delighted with what he said.","He didn’t know that someone else was paying close attention to Zi Ling with sparkling eyes.","It was none other than Huo Shan himself.","He pushed through the crowd and went to Zi Ling’s side.","“Huo Shan? That’s Huo Shan, the top student of Class D!”","“I heard he’s good enough to go to Class C, but he chose to stay in Class D.”","“Huo Shan is so handsome!”","“He’s a wealthy heir! The Huo Family is a huge clan!”","...","Many girls were talking about Huo Shan in affectionate tones.","But Huo Shan only wanted Zi Ling. He looked into her eyes and asked, “Zi Ling, will you be my girlfriend?”","What?!","Those words shocked everyone.","Zi Ling couldn’t look Huo Shan in the eye. She remembered how aggressive she had been and felt too abashed to face him.","She was about to run off when he asked that question.","Hearing what he said, even her hands turned pink.","She felt so shy that she gave Huo Shan another look before dashing off.","Huo Shan was dumbfounded, and he asked Chaoge, “Was that a yes?”","Chaoge said, “Take a wild guess.”","Huo Shan didn’t think he should go see Feng Wu now, but he still asked Chaoge to give Feng Wu his best wishes.","Chaoge liked Huo Shan because he had shown Feng Wu respect.","“By the way,” Huo Shan added before he left, “the tutors are having a meeting to discuss if they should put Miss Feng Wu in Class D or Class C. If Miss Feng Wu has any preferences, please let me know in advance. I can pull some strings.”","Chaoge delivered the message to Feng Wu.","Meanwhile, a meeting was taking place, just like Huo Shan said.","The head of the academy was absent as usual, and the meeting was led by two deputies.","Zuo Qingluan had replaced Zixuan. Gongsun Mu had been told what was going on, and he took Feng Wu’s side.","The other participants of the meeting included Mr. Zhu of Class E, Mr. Wang of Class D, Mr. Yin of Class C, and the tutors of Classes A and B."]},{"number":2630,"title":"Chapter 2630 - Genius Girl (2)","paragraphs":["“Feng Wu is an interesting girl.” Mr. Yin of Class C smiled at Gongsun Mu. “I didn’t know she could do that, defeating all of Class D on her own.”","Mr. Wang of Class D didn’t like the sound of that. He rolled his eyes at Mr. Yin and said, “If you don’t know what to say, you can keep your mouth shut.”","Mr. Yin laughed. “Am I wrong? So many people saw it. You can’t deny what happened, Mr. Wang.”","Mr. Wang was furious.","As if being humiliated in front of the students wasn’t enough, he was being humiliated in front of the deputies as well. Of course Mr. Wang was angry.","“By the way, I heard that even Mr. Wang’s saber couldn’t stop Feng Wu,” Mr. Yin added.","He and Mr. Wang had always had grudges against each other, and he wouldn’t miss this opportunity.","Seeing that Mr. Wang was going to lose his temper, Gongsun Mu interjected, “In that case, where do you think Feng Wu should be? In Class E, Class D, or Class C?”","Mr. Yin said, “Judging by her capability, of course, Feng Wu should be in Class C with us. All the students in Class D put together couldn’t do anything.”","Needless to say, Mr. Wang didn’t want to lose Feng Wu.","He and Feng Wu were archenemies now. If Feng Wu went to Class C, she would be out of his reach forever.","Thus, he smirked. “That was because Huo Shan didn’t take part in the fight. Feng Wu wouldn’t have been his match.”","Mr. Yin laughed so hard that he was almost in tears. “Wang, you’re just fooling yourself. No one else will believe you. Didn’t you see Huo Shan’s attitude toward Feng Wu? He was so humble. Don’t you know why?”","Mr. Wang snorted. “Boys are always humble around pretty girls. What’s wrong with that? Yin, I bet you’re just as humble when you’re with your wife.”","Mr. Yin glanced at Mr. Wang. “Are you saying that Huo Shan showed Feng Wu respect because he has feelings for her?”","Mr. Wang asked, “Can there be another reason?”","Mr. Yin shook his head. “If you ask me, Feng Wu is too good for Huo Shan. Even if he’s fond of Feng Wu, his feelings would be wasted. He’s not good enough for her.”","Mr. Wang looked like he was going to explode. “You’re making things up now! That’s bullsh*t!”","Mr. Yin turned to Gongsun Mu. “Class C will take Feng Wu.”","Mr. Wang also turned to Gongsun Mu. “Feng Wu belongs in Class D!”","The two tutors were at a stalemate.","Zuo Qingluan frowned and seemed impatient.","“Miss Qingluan, what do you think?” Gongsun Mu tossed the question to Zuo Qingluan.","“What do I think?” Zuo Qingluan smirked inwardly. She thought Feng Wu was the biggest hypocrite!","Feng Wu wasn’t much inferior to her. She was at least a Level 6 or Level 7 Spiritual Lord, but she started in Class E.","It was such an easy start, so she managed to shock so many people with the insignificant achievement of defeating Class D.","Zuo Qingluan was even more furious about Feng Wu. “She’s a petty student from Class E. Do you seriously think she’s worth this meeting?”","Everyone was surprised.","A petty Class E student?","Mr. Yin said, “She might have been a petty student before, but not anymore.”"]},{"number":2631,"title":"Chapter 2631 - Genius Girl (3)","paragraphs":["“She’s going to be an important member of the War Academy. Miss Zuo, do you hold something against her? Why? Did Feng Wu offend you in some way?”","Zuo Qingluan almost choked on her own spit.","She could continue harping on that subject since Feng Wu had done countless things to offend her!","She glanced at Mr. Yin. “What do you think?”","Zuo Qingluan no longer tried to maintain the facade of a sacred lady. It was stopping her from doing many things she wanted to do.","Therefore, she was implicitly telling the tutors that she didn’t like Feng Wu, so they could torture her however they wanted.","Unfortunately, she had underestimated the tutors.","At first, people supported her because of the crown prince.","However, they changed their minds as time went by.","They learned what happened in the imperial capital.","The people there were still talking about the birthday fireworks.","Hence...","Zuo Qingluan shouldn’t have assumed that news of the imperial capital could be kept out of the academy.","The tutors weren’t stupid. Classes A and B hadn’t carried out an investigation because they weren’t involved.","However, Mr. Yin and Mr. Zhu had been outside recently.","They knew which girl the crown prince had set off the fireworks for.","Jun Linyuan the sovereign descends to the world, and Feng Wu the phoenix soars above the land.","What a magnificent statement!","When the crown prince was taken out of the equation, Zuo Qingluan wasn’t much different from everyone else.","Mr. Yin smiled when he saw that Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t back down. “I think Feng Wu is excellent.”","Zuo Qingluan’s face paled.","How foolish was Mr. Yin?","She gave so many hints, but he was still singing Feng Wu’s praises. Did he have a death wish?","She glared at him. “Mr. Yin, are you saying you find Feng Wu an excellent student?”","Mr. Yin smiled. “It’s like what Huo Shan said: ‘Xiao Wu is good-looking, talented, capable and kind. I can’t say a bad thing about her. I think she will be the most popular girl in the War Academy.'”","Zuo Qingluan was furious.","She clenched her fists and wanted to kill Mr. Yin when no one was looking. Just then, Gongsun Mu suggested, “In that case, why don’t we let Feng Wu choose? She’ll go to whichever class she wants to.”","Mr. Yin nodded with a smile. Mr. Wang didn’t like the idea, but he couldn’t think of an excuse to suggest otherwise.","Mr. Zhu smiled bitterly.","Feng Wu...","She had only just joined the War Academy, and she was already going to Class C.","But he knew perfectly well that with Feng Wu’s capability, Class C wouldn’t keep her for long either.","Soon, Feng Wu arrived.","She saw the seven people sitting behind a row of desks, as if they were going to interview her.","“Please take a seat.” Gongsun Mu had a good impression of Feng Wu and smiled at her.","A single chair was placed opposite the desks.","Feng Wu sensed hostility. When she followed the gaze, she saw that it was Zuo Qingluan.","She gave Zuo Qingluan a meaningful smile.","Zuo Qingluan remained unaffected, as if Feng Wu’s arrival didn’t change anything, when in fact..."]},{"number":2632,"title":"Chapter 2632 - Genius Girl (4)","paragraphs":["Every time Zuo Qingluan saw Feng Wu, she wanted to eat her alive.","Feng Wu sensed more hostility and found that Mr. Wang was also glaring at her.","She was amazed. “Mr. Wang, you’re here. I see you’re fine. I was worried.”","Mr. Wang asked angrily, “What can be wrong with me?”","Feng Wu said, “So many of your students lost the fight yesterday. I heard you vomited three liters of blood and would need months to recover. I didn’t expect to see you so soon.”","Mr. Wang was furious.","Yes, he had vomited blood the day before out of frustration, but it was only three mouthfuls! It was never that serious! He cursed Feng Wu under his breath.","However, he couldn’t tell the others that it was only three mouthfuls. If he admitted that he had vomited any blood, it would make him seem incredibly petty.","He took several deep breaths as he fought back his rage.","He then gave Feng Wu a warning look. “Enough with the banter. You’re here today because we want to hear your opinion.”","Feng Wu had given Mr. Wang a blow head-on at the very beginning, but Mr. Wang didn’t dare cross the line. Feng Wu had total control over the situation.","Mr. Yin was amazed.","What an outstanding girl!","They were the chief tutors of the War Academy. Any other student summoned here today would be so nervous about being in the same room with them.","However, Feng Wu didn’t seem nervous at all and even took the initiative to attack.","She also hit her target on her first try and successfully intimidated Mr. Wang. It was so interesting to watch!","He now understood why the crown prince cared so much for her.","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath and glanced at Mr. Wang. She found the man too stupid to be helpful.","Seeing that Mr. Yin was singing Feng Wu’s praises, she made a mental note that she would get her revenge one day.","Since Mr. Yin already knew what cards Zuo Qingluan had, he was no longer afraid of her.","Instead, he warmly welcomed Feng Wu and introduced her to all the tutors.","Feng Wu remembered all their names.","She smiled at Mr. Yin for his kindness.","Mr. Yin was thrilled. At such a young age, the girl was already familiar with the ways of the world. How wonderful!","He smiled at her. “Here’s the thing: Since you’ve defeated virtually every student in Class D, the tutors of the academy feel that it would be a waste of your talent to keep you in Class E.","“Mr. Wang doesn’t think you’re Huo Shan’s match, so he wants to keep you in Class D.","“However, I think you’ll be an outstanding student even in Class C, and I would like you to join us.","“What do you think?” Mr. Yin smiled at Feng Wu.","Skip a school year?","Feng Wu was very familiar with skipping grades. She had done it before.","Seeing the eager look in everyone’s eyes, Feng Wu asked, “Are those the only two options I have?”","What? Were these two options not enough?","Mr. Yin sounded sorry when he said, “Miss Feng Wu, you can stay in Class E if you insist...”"]},{"number":2633,"title":"Chapter 2633 - Skip Grades (1)","paragraphs":["What? Were these two options not enough?","Mr. Yin sounded sorry when he said, “Miss Feng Wu, you can stay in Class E if you insist...”","Feng Wu asked, “Can I graduate directly?”","“Pfft —”","Mr. Yin spat out the tea in his mouth.","Even Mr. Yang of Class B and Mr. Duan of Class A were shocked.","At first, they appreciated Feng Wu’s talent and wanted to observe her, but they didn’t think so highly of her when they saw how proud she was.","Zuo Qingluan was glad to see that Feng Wu didn’t make a good impression on the tutors.","“Graduate directly?” Gongsun Mu found the suggestion both annoying and hilarious.","His Majesty had given him instructions that he should take good care of Feng Wu so that no one would pick on her. Gongsun Mu also needed to ensure that no boys would approach Feng Wu. By the sound of it, the emperor considered Feng Wu his future daughter-in-law.","Old Mr. Gongsun smiled bitterly. “You can’t skip so many grades; not even His Majesty himself would make that request.”","Feng Wu was disappointed. “Is that so? I’ll go to Class A, then.”","Mr. Yin expected Feng Wu to aim for something lower, but he was shocked when he heard that the girl still wanted something that seemed beyond her reach.","“Feng Wu,” Mr. Yin said solemnly, “yes, you’re very talented, but the academy has rules. You can’t skip too many grades. Three at a time is the most you can do.”","Feng Wu asked, “So, are you saying that I can go to Class B?”","Mr. Yin nodded. “Yes, Class B.”","Feng Wu frowned a little. “That’s a bit slow for me, but I guess I can live with it. I’ll take Class B, then.”","Mr. Yin was speechless. What did she mean by “I can live with it”?","Mr. Yang of Class B opened his eyes wide.","“Class B?” he shook his head. “No, I won’t have her.”","Zuo Qingluan smirked.","She was the deputy head of this academy, but Feng Wu had been rejected by the tutor of Class B. Feng Wu would never be able to catch up with her.","She believed it was fate.","Feng Wu looked at Gongsun Mu. “Can he do that?”","Mr. Gongsun smiled wryly. “That depends on your own capability. If you can defeat a student from Class B, you’ll have a chance to enter the class.”","Feng Wu frowned a little. “What do you mean by ‘I’ll have a chance?”","Mr. Yang was rigorous in both his personality and his teaching. He didn’t like students skipping grades, especially when it was a genius.","He frowned at Feng Wu. “If you can defeat the weakest student of Class B, you’ll fulfill the minimum requirement for joining the class. When that happens, the tutors will have a vote to decide if you can enter Class B.”","Feng Wu nodded. “What if I can defeat the top student of Class B?”","Mr. Yang was once again surprised by Feng Wu.","He had taught many students, but he had never met anyone so shameless!","Almost all the tutors felt the same.","The girl was as pretty as she was shameless!"]},{"number":2634,"title":"Chapter 2634 - Skip Grades (2)","paragraphs":["“What did you say?” Mr. Yang stared at Feng Wu. He didn’t like opinionated students, even if they were geniuses.","“What if I can beat the top student of Class B?” Feng Wu didn’t care what other people thought of her.","She smiled the entire time. Her eyes were as bright as stars, and she was as pretty as a picture.","The other tutors thought, “What a shame. She’s so wonderful, but she’s too arrogant!”","Mr. Yang snorted. “You’ll be the top student of Class B if you can beat Shan Jingfei.”","Almost everyone in the academy knew who Shan Jingfei was. She was a student of Class B, but she was also the most popular girl in the War Academy. Wu Lingyue was nothing in comparison.","Feng Wu nodded. “I’ll fight her, then.”","Mr. Yin liked how forthright she was. She was a girl of action, but others might take it for arrogance.","He tried to persuade her otherwise. “Shan Jingfei is the top student of Class B. She’s even good enough to go to Class A.”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Mr. Yin said, “Why don’t we start from the last student on the billboard?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s alright. Shan Jingfei will do.”","Mr. Yin shrugged at Mr. Yang. He had tried, but she wouldn’t listen.","Mr. Yang was usually a mild-tempered man, but he was frustrated by Feng Wu’s statement. “Suit yourself, then! You’ll fight Shan Jingfei!”","Feng Wu was talented, but one needed time to train their skills. Her good looks could only get her so far! Mr. Yang smirked and gave the order.","The air felt stuffy as they waited for Shan Jingfei to arrive. No one dared to break the silence.","Mr. Zhu stared at his hands on the table and was filled with emotions.","Mr. Wang smirked. This presumptuous girl would be humiliated!","Mr. Yin was worried for Feng Wu but couldn’t do anything.","Mr. Yang seemed displeased.","Mr. Duan was from Class A. He decided that it was none of his business.","Mr. Gongsun shook his head, and Zuo Qingluan had a sarcastic look on her face.","...","Anyone else would be scared out of their wits under the pressure of all the attention, but Feng Wu only stood there with her hands behind her back. She was even smiling, as if nothing in the world could bother her.","Just then, they heard approaching footsteps.","The silence was broken.","Shan Jingfei walked in. When she saw all the tutors and school heads, she couldn’t help but feel nervous. Although she was used to being the center of attention, she still greeted all the teachers flusteredly.","The teachers smiled bitterly.","That was how a regular student should react. Feng Wu was too calm.","Mr. Yang asked, “Jingfei, I assume you’re currently the top student on the billboard. Is that correct?”","Under Zuo Qingluan’s gaze, Shan Jingfei found it hard to breathe. She said in a low voice, “Yes.”","Mr. Yang nodded. “You’ll fight Feng Wu today.”","Feng Wu? Shan Jingfei knew that name.","On her way here, she had heard other students say that once Feng Wu rose to Class B, she herself wouldn’t be the most popular girl anymore.","Shan Jingfei had always assumed an otherworldly manner, as if she didn’t care about fame. In fact, she cared very much."]},{"number":2635,"title":"Chapter 2635 - Skip Grades (3)","paragraphs":["Shan Jingfei smirked. She wanted to see how beautiful this Feng Wu could be. She couldn’t possibly be more beautiful than Miss Qingluan!","She turned around.","Her pupils contracted when she saw Feng Wu’s face. She was astonished.","What a beautiful girl!","Her red dress almost seemed like it was on fire.","Her bright and shiny eyes reminded one of a crisp autumn day.","She was slender, graceful and charming.","Her skin was unbelievably smooth, and she looked like someone who didn’t belong to this world.","...","Expressions to describe a beautiful woman popped into Shan Jingfei’s head. They were the words the boys used with her, but now...","She felt so common when she compared herself with Feng Wu.","Zuo Qingluan was beautiful, but Feng Wu easily outshone her.","That thought appeased Shan Jingfei a little.","If she had seen Feng Wu on the first day of school, she wouldn’t be so surprised today. However, she hadn’t looked back that day, so she had missed Feng Wu and hadn’t been amazed by her beauty, until now.","When Shan Jingfei finally woke up from her astonishment, there was jealousy in her eyes.","Mr. Yang said, “You can start now.”","Mr. Yin said, “Don’t go too far. Please don’t hurt Miss Feng Wu.”","Mr. Yang rolled his eyes at Mr. Yin. “We can’t promise that in a battle. You never know where they will get hit.”","Mr. Yin wanted to tell Mr. Yang that he was trying to help all of them. He had been told that Feng Wu was the crown prince’s favorite!","With that, Mr. Yin said, “Isn’t Shan Jingfei the top student of Class B? She must be so much more capable. I’m sure she has perfect control over the force she’ll use. Please don’t harm Feng Wu.”","Mr. Yang didn’t say anything else.","Shan Jingfei nodded, but she was smirking inwardly.","They should thank me for my kindness if I don’t kill her now. Not harm Feng Wu? Mr. Yin is as hypocritical as ever .","At that thought, she turned to Feng Wu and said sarcastically, “Feng Wu, to show Mr. Yin some respect, I’ll let you make the first move. I’ll start fighting after you make three moves.”","Feng Wu shook her head. “That won’t be necessary.”","Shan Jingfei smirked inwardly, but she still said, “Don’t blame me if I defeat you within three moves!”","She struck out immediately after that.","She didn’t spare any effort.","She knew that if Feng Wu managed to get in more than three strikes, there was a big chance of her getting into Class B.","If that happened, Shan Jingfei probably wouldn’t be the most popular girl in the War Academy anymore.","It was a formidable strike.","Shang Jingfei wasn’t going to give Feng Wu any chance.","The tutors saw through her plan right away and believed that Feng Wu was doomed.","“Feng Wu won’t withstand this strike,” Mr. Yang said calmly. “It’s an extraordinary move. Not only is Shan Jingfei exerting all her power, she’s also made some clever modifications. Even a Class A student would struggle to avoid it.”","Mr. Yin saw it too and looked worried.","However —","Shan Jingfei might have a good plan, but no one could guarantee that things would turn out the way she wanted.","She was aiming at Feng Wu’s heart.","The strike would crush Feng Wu’s heart and kill her instantly."]},{"number":2636,"title":"Chapter 2636 - Skip Grades (4)","paragraphs":["Mr. Yin cried out, “Stop!”","Mr. Gongsun was about to intervene, when Feng Wu dodged the attack.","She moved so fast that there was an afterimage in the air.","Shan Jingfei was furious after she missed.","How dare Feng Wu try to evade?","However, Feng Wu took out her weapon before Shan Jingfei could do anything.","No one knew how she made a move. However...","When they looked again, a sword was pressed to Shan Jingfei’s throat, and Feng Wu was asking, “Well?”","She was so calm.","It was as if this was the more regular thing.","She didn’t even flinch.","Shan Jingfei froze on the spot.","She tried to dodge, but the blade cut into her flesh at the slightest movement.","“Stop!” Shan Jingfei screamed when she felt the pain.","Her voice trembled.","Not all the tutors reacted the same way.","Mr. Zhu wasn’t shocked. Feng Wu could beat him; of course she could beat Shan Jingfei.","Mr. Wang was frowning and was obviously shocked.","Mr. Yin cried out. He didn’t expect Feng Wu to be so capable.","Mr. Yang was even more surprised when he saw Shan Jingfei defeated in the first strike.","Shan Jingfei was the most astonished of them all.","Feng Wu smiled at her without saying a word.","Shan Jingfei knew that Feng Wu was waiting for her to admit defeat.","But she couldn’t bear the thought!","It would be so humiliating!","She was the top student of Class B and the dream girl of many boys, but now, a new student was pointing a sword at her throat.","Shan Jingfei refused to give in.","Thinking that Feng Wu had let her guard down, Shan Jingfei took a dagger out of her sleeve.","What happened next was quicker than words could describe!","She aimed the dagger at Feng Wu’s heart.","She wanted everyone to see that she was the winner, not Feng Wu.","Would she succeed?","Many people held their breaths.","Even Gongsun Mu prepared to intervene if Feng Wu’s life was in danger. After all, His Majesty had left him with instructions.","Zuo Qingluan sneered inwardly. If Gongsun Mu dared to intervene, she would stop him.","The battle might as well happen among the tutors.","Luckily, Feng Wu didn’t need help.","She grabbed Shan Jingfei’s wrist when the latter came at her with a dagger, and she twisted it.","Crack!","It was the sound of bones breaking.","“Ahhh!!!”","Shan Jingfei’s scream was earsplitting.","The bones in her right wrist were broken, and her hand didn’t even look like a hand anymore.","It swelled up as she watched.","“Feng Wu, how dare you!” Shan Jingfei’s life had been smooth sailing ever since she was little, and she had never felt so much pain.","Feng Wu smiled as she pressed the Fallen Star Sword to Shan Jingfei’s throat. “Do you know where I’ll hurt you next?”","She stared at Shan Jingfei’s throat.","Shan Jingfei’s heart sank.","She had thought that it was sheer luck at first when Feng Wu was able to defeat her, but when Feng Wu broke her wrist, Shan Jingfei realized how formidable Feng Wu really was.","She didn’t hold many grudges against Feng Wu. Right now, she was overwhelmed by the energy Feng Wu was giving off."]},{"number":2637,"title":"Chapter 2637 - Feng Wu’s Reign (1)","paragraphs":["“I give up...” Filled with despair, Shan Jingfei admitted defeat.","Feng Wu withdrew her sword.","The teachers didn’t know what to say for a moment.","Mr. Yin said, “Feng Wu, you won! I can’t believe it!”","Feng Wu gave him a little nod.","Mr. Yin had been kind to her the whole time, so Feng Wu smiled at him.","She then turned to Mr. Yang of Class B.","He was the most astonished of them all.","Shan Jingfei was the top student of Class B, and Feng Wu had defeated her in two strikes. It was enough to prove her capability.","Mr. Yang didn’t hold any grudges against Feng Wu, so he wasn’t going to make trouble for her.","“You’ll be in Class B, then.” Mr. Yang gave the final verdict.","He only felt a little embarrassed.","Feng Wu wanted to graduate sooner, so she looked at Gongsun Mu.","Gongsun Mu smiled wryly. “Feng Wu, you can only skip so many grades at one time.”","Feng Wu finally gave up trying and sighed. “Fine.”","The teachers were still trying to digest the information when Feng Wu left.","Mr. Yin said to Mr. Wang, “Feng Wu has gone to Class B, just like that.”","Mr. Wang didn’t want to say anything.","Mr. Yin sighed. “We were discussing if she should go to Class C or Class D, but she went directly to Class B.”","Mr. Wang’s face turned even darker.","Mr. Yin shook his head. “A real genius will eventually be discovered.”","Mr. Wang’s expression was livid.","Shan Jingfei couldn’t stand all the discussion and was about to leave, when someone knocked on the door.","“Hello, I’m Huo Shan. May I challenge Miss Shan Jingfei?” Huo Shan asked with a smile.","Many eyes followed Feng Wu after she left the office.","“Which class do you think she’ll be in?”","“Didn’t Mr. Wang say that she’ll be in Class D?”","“But Mr. Yin said Class C would take her.”","“Look, she’s so calm. If it really is Class C, she should look thrilled.”","...","The rumor got around, and soon, every student in Class D and Class E thought that Feng Wu was going to Class D.","In Room 2001.","“Xiao Wu, are you going to Class D?” Zi Ling asked nervously.","Feng Wu shook her head.","Zi Ling was relieved. So, Xiao Wu would remain in Class E.","Class D.","“Is Feng Wu coming to our class?”","All of Class D was astonished by the news.","Feng Wu had defeated virtually all the students in Class D.","Moreover, she had done it all by herself. That was how terrifying Feng Wu was.","The fear of being dominated by Feng Wu filled their hearts.","“Damn it... Why is she coming to our class? Why can’t she stay in Class E?!” Wu Lingyue felt as if she would never see the sun again.","In Class C.","Many students were interested in the event and discussed it among themselves.","Meng Le, the top student of Class C, frowned when he heard the discussion. “She’s just some newbie in Class E. Why are all of you so concerned?”","“Meng Le, they said that Feng Wu might join our class.”","Meng Le smirked. “I’m sure she’s not good enough!”"]},{"number":2638,"title":"Chapter 2638 - Feng Wu’s Reign (2)","paragraphs":["Mr. Yin entered the classroom at that moment.","He gave Meng Le, the student he had once been proud of, a strange look.","He shook his head. The decision would soon be announced.","In Class B.","If no one in Class C believed that Feng Wu would be joining them, it was only natural that no one in Class B expected to see Feng Wu in their class.","They had little interest in what happened in Class E, which was so much more inferior to them.","However, Feng Wu was such a pretty girl that many people couldn’t help talking about her.","But they were using such condescending tones.","“I heard that Feng Wu is going to skip grades.”","“Even so, she’s only going to Class D, which is still far below us. It’s not our concern.”","“Come to think of it, Feng Wu is beautiful.”","“Being pretty won’t do her any good. A real goddess should have talent as well, like Shan Jingfei.”","Shan Jingfei didn’t know what to say.","The conversation gave her complicated feelings.","Feng Wu had defeated her in two strikes, and she had yet to recover from the fear.","As for good looks, Feng Wu was probably a hundred times prettier.","The thought made her want to cry.","“Feng Wu is very talented.” Ling Hao spoke up for Feng Wu. “She defeated the whole of Class D all by herself; that’s enough to get her into Class C. Could any of us do that when we were new students?”","Ling Hao had met Feng Wu once.","He had led Feng Wu to the registration office when she first came.","Ling Hao’s team had met her as well, and they all had a good impression of Feng Wu, with Ye Han being the only exception.","Ye Han gave Ling Hao a dirty look.","Ling Hao was confused. Had he said something wrong?","“Forget it. Why are we talking about a nobody?” Xin Zhixuan, Shan Jingfei’s friend, said arrogantly. “We should be paying attention to Class A and trying to get in there. That’s our top priority. Someone as petty as Feng Wu isn’t worth our attention.”","“That’s right,” said Mu Shuai, Shan Jingfei’s most loyal supporter. “It’ll take years for Feng Wu to come to Class B, and by then, we’ll probably have graduated already! Just ignore her!”","Ling Hao wanted to retort but was interrupted.","The broadcast system was making a buzzing noise. It had been a while since that happened.","Immediately, all eyes were on the device.","It was a chunk of black jade stone which the school used to broadcast all important announcements.","If anyone was looking at Shan Jingfei now, they would see that she was ghastly pale and had clenched her fists.","“Announcement. Announcement.","“Miss Feng Wu of Class E has demonstrated great talent and performed outstandingly. She has qualified to join Class B.","“The school has given her special permission to skip grades.","“End of announcement.”","...","Just like all other broadcasts, the announcement was only played once.","It had always been that way.","However —","It was such a shocking piece of news.","Class E fell silent.","It took them a long while to realize what they had just heard.","Sun Jingyu stared at Feng Wu.","So did all her classmates in Class E."]},{"number":2639,"title":"Chapter 2639 - Feng Wu’s Reign (3)","paragraphs":["“Class B?!”","“Xiao Wu, you’ve jumped to Class B!”","“I thought it was Class D!”","“Class B, oh my god!”","“You skipped two grades!”","“That’s incredible!”","Feng Wu’s fans couldn’t control their excitement.","Lu Qi was still the head of the anti-fans. By then, there were fewer than ten of them left. They all looked like they had been struck by lightning.","Feng Wu was going to be a Class B student.","Sun Jingyu and Pei Si took a deep breath and understood why that was. If she could defeat Mr. Luo with one strike, she naturally belonged to Class B.","Zi Ling did know if she should laugh or cry. Her idol was going to Class B.","But she soon clenched her fists and told herself that she had to work harder, or she would never be able to see Feng Wu again, let alone hang out with her.","Chaoge had always known Feng Wu’s capability, so she had been training hard since she joined the War Academy. She knew she would soon skip grades as well.","Class D.","Wu Lingyue was speechless.","So were all her classmates.","In Class C.","Meng Le was dumbfounded.","And his classmates were at a loss over what to say.","It took Meng Le a long while to recover from the shock.","When he did come back to his senses, he felt as if he had been slapped.","He had said some condescending things about Feng Wu, but Feng Wu had already risen above him.","In Class B.","Ye Han was speechless.","So was Ling Hao.","And Xin Zhixuan.","Mu Shuai was at a loss over what to say.","The entire class was shocked.","They all looked like they had been struck by lightning.","“What?!”","“Feng Wu?!”","“Class B?!”","“She’s coming to our class!”","“Didn’t Mu Shuai say that it would take her years to get to Class B?”","Mu Shuai was at a loss.","Everyone turned to Shan Jingfei.","Now that Feng Wu had entered Class B, with how pretty she was, Shan Jingfei would undoubtedly feel threatened!","Xin Zhixuan cleared her throat. “So what if Feng Wu comes to our class? She must be the weakest student here! She won’t be my match, let alone Jingfei’s!”","Shan Jingfei grew even paler.","Just then, they heard footsteps outside.","Everybody looked up.","Mr. Yang had arrived with Feng Wu.","They all saw Feng Wu.","When Zuo Qingluan picked on Feng Wu on the first day, Class B had been standing in the front, and the students had only vaguely seen Feng Wu’s face.","Now, she was standing right in front of them.","What a beautiful girl!","She wore a red dress. She had bright eyes, exquisite features and the smoothest skin. She was slender and graceful. One didn’t know where to begin to praise her.","How incredible!","She looked like she didn’t belong to this world!","“Is that Feng Wu?”","“Is that really her?”","“She... Oh my god!”","The female students grew pale when they saw how beautiful Feng Wu was."]},{"number":2640,"title":"Chapter 2640 - Feng Wu’s Reign (4)","paragraphs":["The boys were so stunned that they forgot to blink.","“Xiao Wu!” Ling Hao was thrilled to see Feng Wu, and waved at her.","Feng Wu smiled at Ling Hao when she recognized him.","The smile only accentuated her beautiful features.","The boys were dumbfounded.","Their new classmate was so stunning! They felt so blessed to have her!","Shan Jingfei grew even paler.","She stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu just happened to meet her gaze.","Feng Wu smiled slightly when their eyes met, but Shan Jingfei involuntarily looked away.","The fear she felt when Feng Wu defeated her grew even stronger.","Xin Zhixuan gritted her teeth.","She wanted to say something, but she was filled with jealousy when she saw how the boys goggled at Feng Wu. She didn’t know what to say.","Standing on the podium, Mr. Yang saw everyone’s reactions. He shook his head slightly when he saw Shan Jingfei.","She had lost this battle.","It wasn’t just because of her lack of capability. She had lost because she didn’t have courage.","He had yet to decide if Feng Wu’s arrival was good or bad news for Class B.","With that in mind, he said to all the students, “I think you’ve all heard the broadcast, so there’s no need for me to say more. Let me introduce your new classmate to you. This is Feng Wu.”","Ling Hao immediately started applauding.","His team members followed suit.","Xin Zhixuan and Shan Jingfei were displeased. They wanted these people to stop clapping.","However...","The two of them couldn’t control what the boys did. After Ling Hao started applauding, the other boys did the same.","There were only a few of them at first, but gradually, everybody was doing it.","“We have two other new members.”","Mr. Yang gestured at two people behind him.","One was Gu Xingyuan, and the other was Huo Shan.","“This is Gu Xingyuan. He’s from Class E.","“This is Huo Shan. He’s from Class D.","“Please find your seats. The class will start in a moment.”","The other students were dumbfounded.","All these three had skipped grades. Seriously?","However, Feng Wu seemed to be the center of all the attention.","The students weren’t as excited when the two other newcomers were introduced.","“Xiao Wu, Xiao Wu!” Ling Hao shouted excitedly. “Come here and sit with us!”","Ye Han’s face was livid.","As Ling Hao’s team member, she naturally sat with her team members.","As for Feng Wu...","Ye Han used to share the same dormitory with her.","However, she suffered an utter defeat on the day Feng Wu arrived and had never set foot in Room 2001 since. Now that Feng Wu had joined Class B, one could only imagine how furious Ye Han was.","To make it worse, Ling Hao was so enthusiastic about Feng Wu.","Ye Han turned around and glared at Ling Hao. “Ling Hao, I’m warning you. If you keep sucking up to her, I’ll leave this team!”","Ling Hao was speechless.","Ye Han looked away before he could say anything."]},{"number":2641,"title":"Chapter 2641 - Class B","paragraphs":["Ling Hao looked at Shao Xiao, his team leader.","Shao Xiao shrugged and refused to get involved.","Ling Hao whispered something in Shao Xiao’s ear, but Shao Xiao cleared his throat and said, “It’s up to you. I’m not saying anything.”","By then, Feng Wu was by Ling Hao’s side.","Ling Hao immediately stood up and pulled the chair out for her.","Feng Wu casually sat down.","Ye Han stiffened, and her face turned livid.","She had warned Ling Hao, but he still dared to act that way!","She turned around and glared at Ling Hao with eyes burning with fury.","Ling Hao shrugged in resignation.","Ye Han gave Feng Wu one last mean look before she smacked her book on the desk and stormed off.","Feng Wu was already the center of attention. When that happened, all eyes were on her.","Everybody discussed it in hushed voices.","“Why did Ye Han run off?”","“I heard them just then. Ye Han doesn’t like Feng Wu, but Ling Hao invited Feng Wu over, which upset Ye Han.”","“Ye Han is one of Ling Hao’s team members. I thought she was quite popular.”","“It seems that Feng Wu is going to be their new favorite.”","“She’s a piece of work. She’s only just gotten here, and she’s already driven Ye Han away. That’s just mean.”","“You don’t say! I heard Ye Han and Ling Hao are a couple, but Feng Wu just inserted herself in between them...”","Ling Hao was already angry, and he couldn’t hold back anymore. He shouted, “You can’t make things up! Since when am I a couple with Ye Han? If I have to like a girl, it would be Shan Jingfei! It definitely wouldn’t be Ye Han!”","The students nearby all cleared their throats.","Shan Jingfei didn’t know what to say.","She was secretly delighted, but she had to put on an annoyed look.","Xin Zhixuan gave her a nudge.","“What?” Shan Jingfei feigned an upset tone.","Xin Zhixuan smiled. She knew how to make trouble for Feng Wu, the person she hated the most!","After class.","Ling Hao showed Feng Wu around, introducing her to all the facilities and cultivation rooms.","The points worked in all five classes.","As one moved up the classes, they could earn more points.","For instance, one could only earn one or two hundred points in an event in Class E. According to Ling Hao, one could earn up to 10,000 points in an event in Class B.","“We earn more points, but we spend more as well,” Ling Hao told Feng Wu when they arrived at the cultivation rooms. “These rooms will cost you 500 points an hour. If we want to improve our cultivation level, we need to do everything we can to earn points.","“By the way,” Ling Hao asked solemnly, “how many points do you have?”","Feng Wu gave it some thought. “A thousand, I think?”","Ling Hao said, “Well... You’re broke, then. Here’s the plan. You’ll be joining my team for future tasks.”","Feng Wu asked, “I thought you already have five members.”","Ling Hao said, “There are three new students now, and you can’t have a three-member team. I think Mr. Yang would like you to join an existing team so that we can help you out. Six-member teams are allowed under special circumstances. What do you think? Are you in?”","Feng Wu didn’t say yes right away, so Ling Hao said, “Don’t worry. Ye Han is just being girly. She’s a nice person. You’ll see. Maybe you’ll even be friends in the future.”"]},{"number":2642,"title":"Chapter 2642 - Trophy","paragraphs":["Ye Han?","Friends?","Feng Wu didn’t think so.","However, she decided to let Ling Hao think that way if it made him happy. She just shrugged.","“The hunt will be in a few days. Xiao Wu, you better prepare some medicine for treating wounds,” Ling Hao said solemnly. “Hunts in Class B are very different from Class E’s. You may need some time to get used to it.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “How are they different?”","Ling Hao said, “The significant difference is that the school doesn’t tell us what to hunt. Once we team up and enter the hunting zone, anything can happen.","“Class E and Class D hunt in the outer ring of the forest, while we hunt in the middle ring.","“Tutors oversee your hunts, and you can ask them for help when things go wrong. We don’t have that privilege.","“The top team of Class E is rewarded with one or two hundred points, but ours can earn up to 10,000 points. And there’s more.”","Ling Hao switched to a mysterious tone. “You can choose whether or not you want to hand in the crystal cores you find.”","Feng Wu asked, “Can I keep them for myself? Is that allowed?”","Ling Hao said, “Of course. Do you know Shan Jingfei? She’s the most popular girl in the academy.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Not only that, Feng Wu had also defeated that girl in two strikes.","Ling Hao said, “Of course, now that you’re here, she’s hardly the prettiest girl. You shouldn’t be too proud since she’s much more capable than you.”","His tone was sincere. “Yes, pretty girls have a special advantage, but we’ll only respect a pretty girl when they have the capability to match. Feng Wu, you have to work harder to catch up to Shan Jingfei. Promise?”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","Ling Hao asked, “You didn’t even think about it.”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s wrong with that?”","Ling Hao said, “You sounded like you were being offhanded with me.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Ling Hao asked, “Do you know why I want you to beat Shan Jingfei?”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Ling Hao said, “Because she’s crossed the line! Do you know who Shao Xiao is? He’s our team leader.”","Feng Wu said, “I know.”","Ling Hao said, “He wrote Shan Jingfei a love letter the other day. She could have turned him down since she didn’t have feelings for him, but she didn’t do that. Instead, she’s been giving him false hope.","“Every time she sees Shao Xiao, she’s so shy and innocent, as if she’s interested in him, but she won’t go out with him.” Ling Hao clenched his fists. “When I asked the girls, I was told that Shan Jingfei and her roommates see Shao Xiao as a laughingstock! He’s just another trophy for her to collect!","“Do you know what the worst part is?”","“What is it?” Feng Wu casually asked.","Ling Hao snarled, “Shan Jingfei wrote the names of all the boys who have ever pursued her on the wall next to her bed! It’s become her collection!”","Feng Wu almost wanted to applaud the girl.","Ling Hao said, “Because Shao Xiao is the most earnest one, they’re saying the worst things about him.”","Feng Wu said, “You can tell Shao Xiao what’s going on.”"]},{"number":2643,"title":"Chapter 2643 - Me or Her","paragraphs":["Ling Hao shook his head. “I can’t. Shao Xiao will be devastated. I haven’t told anyone.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s Shao Xiao’s business. It doesn’t have anything to do with me, and I’m not obliged to get revenge for him.”","Ling Hao said, “You don’t have to do that! I just find Shan Jingfei so fake; she doesn’t deserve to be seen as a school goddess! I hope you can replace her!","“Don’t worry.” Ling Hao patted her on the shoulder. “I’ll give you a hand.”","Feng Wu said, “Thank you very much.”","Ling Hao didn’t notice the false modesty in her tone, and he smiled. “Don’t worry about it.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Soon, it was the day of the hunt.","Feng Wu still lived in Room 2001, and she didn’t know many people in Class B.","Most students stayed with their existing teams.","The group around Shan Jingfei was huge because everyone wanted to be on the same team as her.","Not only was she competent, she was also pretty. It would be such a sweet deal.","However, Shan Jingfei wouldn’t team up with just anyone. She had her own team.","But now, she walked up to Gu Xingyuan and smiled at him.","Huo Shan approached Feng Wu.","“Feng Wu, Feng Wu, let’s team up,” he said earnestly.","Feng Wu was the crown prince’s girl, and the crown prince was like the boss of his boss. Because of that, Huo Shan decided he should jump onto Feng Wu’s wagon while he had the chance.","“I’m sorry.” Ling Hao joined them at that moment and smiled at Huo Shan. “Feng Wu is on my team.”","“Then I’ll join you, too,” Huo Shan said without hesitation.","Ling Hao frowned. “We want to have you, but we already have six people. I’m sorry.”","Huo Shan looked from Ling Hao to the people behind him. “There are only five of you. Where’s the sixth one?”","Shao Xiao, Wang Zhi, Ling Hao, Cheng Fang, and Feng Wu. There were indeed only five people.","“Ye Han is with us, too.” Ling Hao turned around to look for her and saw her a few steps away, so he waved at her. “Ye Han, over here!”","Ye Han walked toward them, but her face darkened when she saw Feng Wu.","“What’s she doing here?” she pointed at Feng Wu and asked harshly.","Ling Hao wanted Ye Han to play nice, so he said, “Feng Wu is our newest team member...”","Ye Han angrily cut him off. “Ling Hao! Didn’t you hear what I said before?!”","Ling Hao was an outgoing guy, but that didn’t mean that he would let other people pick on him. He lost his temper as well.","His face darkened. “Ye Han, please don’t shout at me!”","Ye Han grew angrier.","She pointed at Ling Hao. “I made things very clear. You can only have one of us on the team. It’s either her or me!","“And you just ignored me! You dragged her into our team! Ling Hao, are you trying to get rid of me?!”","Ling Hao frowned. “Ye Han, you’re deliberately twisting my words!”","Ye Han said, “I’m twisting your words? Ling Hao, what’s that supposed to mean?!”","Ling Hao said, “We’re all classmates here...”","Ye Han smirked. “Really? Do you think so?!”"]},{"number":2644,"title":"Chapter 2644 - Fire Dragon Blood","paragraphs":["Ye Han turned to the others.","“Shao Xiao!” She stared at her team leader. “What do you say?!”","Shao Xiao said coldly, “Stop being a baby. Just join the team.”","“Being a baby? Is that what you think this is?!” Ye Han felt so wronged that she trembled from head to toe. She looked angrily at each of her teammates in turn.","Wang Zhi and Cheng Fang both remained indifferent.","“Fine, fine! You all think I’m a baby, right? I’ll give you what you want!” Ye Han smirked. “I’m leaving this team!”","She stormed off after that.","Ling Hao said, “Ye Han, no team will take you if you leave now! Just come back!”","Ye Han smirked. “I’m an expert in both wood and fire elements, and I’m a medicine refiner. I can cure people! More than enough teams will want me!”","She glanced at Feng Wu. “When you’re injured, she can treat you!”","She was right. Another team soon accepted her.","Ling Hao and his team members didn’t seem so happy.","Huo Shan smiled. “Can I join you now?”","Ling Hao looked at Shao Xiao.","Shao Xiao frowned and looked Huo Shan up and down. “What level are you?”","“I’m a Level 5 Spiritual Lord.”","“Nice!” Shao Xiao was impressed. That was almost as advanced as he was.","“Join us, then.” Shao Xiao nodded.","However, he didn’t believe that Huo Shan was better than he was.","“What about you?” he asked Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “I’m better than Huo Shan.”","“Pfft —”","Ling Hao burst out laughing.","Ling Hao patted her on the shoulder and whispered, “Feng Wu, can you keep your voice down when you brag? Other people can hear you!”","Feng Wu asked, “So what?”","Ling Hao said, “We all know you just left Class E. There’s a limit no matter how talented you are. You and Huo Shan are both too proud.”","Ling Hao shrugged at Cheng Fang. “New students nowadays are so arrogant. They’re not like us at all.”","Cheng Fang glanced at Feng Wu.","Ye Han had been their team member for a long time, but she stormed off as soon as Feng Wu arrived. Someone as upright as Cheng Fang couldn’t understand it.","He cast a stern look at Feng Wu and turned away.","Mr. Yang arrived at that moment to announce the task.","“You’re going into the middle ring this time, so all of you have to be careful. Your life can be in danger at any moment!","“Magical beasts in that area are intelligent. They’ll team up, and the smarter ones can attack in formations. They’ll be tough to handle!","“When you go in, don’t just focus on killing magical beasts, taking the crystal cores, and collecting materials. The most important thing is to protect yourselves.","“The first team will receive an unprecedented reward!”","Mr. Yang raised a pot of blood-red liquid in his hand.","“This is Fire Dragon Blood.”","The crowd erupted.","“Fire Dragon Blood! I can’t believe it!” Cheng Fang was the most excited one.","“What’s that?” Huo Shan was new here, so he didn’t know what it was."]},{"number":2645,"title":"Chapter 2645 - Seeded Team","paragraphs":["“It can double one’s physical strength!” Cheng Fang was thrilled. “Although it’s only a small pot, that’s a rare material!”","Feng Wu’s eyes flickered when she saw the Fire Dragon Blood.","She was about to refine some pills for both herself and her friends. The medicine could enhance one’s strength, and Fire Dragon Blood was one of the chief ingredients.","What a lucky coincidence. Feng Wu smiled.","“Only the team with the highest points can have it.” Mr. Yang was very straightforward. “And there’s more.”","More?!","“The individual student with the highest points will become a member of the seeded team in the Martial Arts Society!” Mr. Yang announced.","“Wow! Really?!”","“A member of the seeded team? I thought they recruited from Class A only. They’re considering Class B now?”","...","It was followed by an avid discussion, but Feng Wu was perplexed.","Huo Shan explained to her, “The Martial Arts Society is one of the societies in the War Academy, and the seeded team will have battles with other schools on behalf of the academy.”","Feng Wu asked, “Other schools?”","Huo Shan said, “That’s right. Things haven’t been quiet among different schools. The tutors can’t fight one another, so they let the teams fight instead.”","Feng Wu asked, “Isn’t Imperial College the best school?”","Huo Shan gave her a strange look.","Feng Wu asked, “Am I wrong?”","Huo Shan shook his head. “Five years ago, Imperial College was the best school, and no one would dare challenge us, but things are different now.”","Feng Wu asked, “How so?”","Before Huo Shan could say anything, Mr. Yang spoke again.","“The student with the highest score will have the rare chance to join the seeded team. As we all know, that team is the core of Imperial College. Once you join them, you’ll become the honor of this school.","“Once you get in, it’ll be much easier for you to receive resources from the school, and you’ll make rapid progress!”","The students listened with sparkling eyes.","All they could think of were the words “highest score” and “seeded team.”","Feng Wu would be lying if she didn’t admit that she was intrigued.","Her cultivation progress had been going slowly.","She needed a lot of crystal cores to provide her with enough spiritual essence. That was the only way she could become a Spiritual King as soon as possible.","Zuo Qingluan was a Level 1 Spiritual King, which was why she could flaunt her prowess in Imperial College.","Once Feng Wu became a Spiritual King, she could confront Zuo Qingluan.","The idea made Feng Wu want to join that team even more.","Feng Wu asked, “Isn’t Imperial College the best school?”","She asked Huo Shan again.","Huo Shan shook his head. “The Military Academy has been on the rise lately, and they’re catching up to us.","“I heard from my cousin that they’ve officially challenged us, and we’re not sure we can win.”","Feng Wu frowned. “Why is that?”"]},{"number":2646,"title":"Chapter 2646 - First?","paragraphs":["Huo Shan looked around. Seeing that no one was paying attention, he whispered something in Feng Wu’s ear.","Feng Wu looked at him in surprise.","Huo Shan nodded. “My cousin is the president of the Martial Arts Society. He’s a very reliable source.”","Feng Wu said, “If, I mean if the school loses that competition, what will happen?”","“First of all, Imperial College won’t be the top school anymore. Then, the empire will allocate more resources to the Military Academy, and as a result, younger students here will have a harder time making progress. Thirdly, it’ll also give the Military Academy a greater say in many things. And...”","Feng Wu waved him off. “What does that have to do with me?”","Huo Shan stared at Feng Wu. “Aren’t you a student of Imperial College? Don’t you love our school?”","Feng Wu tilted her head. She was a student of Imperial College, but she didn’t identify with this community.","Therefore, she shook her head. “Since the school hasn’t given me any special treatment, I have no obligation to give anything in return. Right?”","Huo Shan said, “But... but...” He didn’t know how to convince Feng Wu.","Feng Wu chuckled. “Why the rush? When I become first and join the seeded team, I’ll be using the school’s resources. After that, I’ll owe them something.”","“Wait. What did I just hear?”","Ling Hao and Cheng Fang came up to them when Feng Wu and Huo Shan were still talking.","They were here to tell them that the team was setting out, but they were shocked by what Feng Wu said.","“What was that?” Ling Hao looked at Feng Wu in disbelief. “You’ll be first, join the seeded team, and use the school’s resources...”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s wrong with that?”","Ling Hao said, “Are you seriously asking me that question?”","He was astonished.","He wasn’t alone. Cheng Fang was also shocked.","He couldn’t believe what he heard.","“Aren’t you ashamed?” Cheng Fang was amazed.","Feng Wu looked at them in bewilderment; she was telling the truth.","“Let’s get going before you surprise another person.”","Fearing that Feng Wu would say more astonishing things, Ling Hao dragged Feng Wu toward Thousand Night Forest.","However, enough people had heard her.","Xin Zhixuan was already keeping an eye on Feng Wu, and she soon told other people what Feng Wu had just said.","“First?”","“Join the seeded team?”","“Feng Wu?”","“ Ahem... ”","Shan Jingfei’s friends were shocked at first, but they soon grew excited.","“How stupid is that Feng Wu? She’s full of bullsh*t!”","“I guess she’s so pleased with herself about skipping grades.”","“No matter how self-satisfied she is, she needs to have a sense of shame. Everyone knows Shan Jingfei is first in our class.”","While everyone was discussing it, Shan Jingfei remained unaffected.","Xin Zhixuan realized something was wrong, so she asked, “Feifei, are you alright?”","Shan Jingfei nodded. “I’m fine. I’m just coming down with something. Don’t worry.”","Xin Zhixuan wanted to say something, but Shan Jingfei cut her off. “It’s that time of the month, you know.”","Xin Zhixuan knew what she meant, but she remembered Shan Jingfei’s period had come two weeks ago."]},{"number":2647,"title":"Chapter 2647 - Teach Her a Lesson","paragraphs":["Ye Han joined Duanmu Huo’s team.","Duanmu Huo had always had feelings for Ye Han. Now that she was in his team, he worshiped her and would give her everything she wanted.","“Where should we go?” Duanmu Huo asked for Ye Han’s opinion.","Seeing that Shan Jingfei and Feng Wu’s teams were headed in the same direction, Ye Han told Duanmu Huo, “We’ll follow Shan Jingfei. That way, she can give us a hand if we run into danger.”","Duanmu Huo liked the idea, so the team followed Shan Jingfei’s group at a distance.","Shao Xiao’s team led the way.","He named his team after him.","It was easy to remember, and everyone liked it.","“We’ll try to get second place!” said Shao Xiao. “I know where we can find a Class B magical beast. We’ll kill it and gain a lot of points!”","“A Class B magical beast?” Feng Wu looked at Ling Hao in bewilderment.","Ling Hao asked, “Have you never heard that term before?”","Feng Wu said, “No.”","“Right, I forgot you were in Class E. You only operated in the outer ring, and all the magical beasts there are called low-level magical beasts. There are no actual categories. That’s why you don’t know. They’re divided into categories once you’re in Class D and above. You didn’t go to Class D, so you don’t know.","“To have students fight magical beasts of their own level, the school divided Thousand Night into different zones.","“Class D students fight Class D magical beasts.","“Class C students fight Class C magical beasts.","“Class B students fight Class B magical beasts.”","...","“You’re in Class B now, so you’ll be fighting Class B magical beasts,” Ling Hao said solemnly. “Do you know Class B magical beasts consist of junior, intermediate, advanced, and peak-level magical beasts?”","Feng Wu shook her head again.","Ling Hao asked in resignation, “Then do you know how many points the magical beasts of each level will give you?”","Feng Wu shook her head again.","Ling Hao said, “You don’t know any of that, but you’re still trying to be first.”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t care about their levels. I can just kill them.”","Cheng Fang smirked. “You’re so confident, aren’t you?”","Ling Hao rolled his eyes at him. “Stop it. Xiao Wu is a member of our team now. Be nice.”","He then turned to Feng Wu. “Junior magical beasts will give you ten points.","“Intermediate magical beasts, 100 points.","“Advanced magical beasts, 1,000 points.","“Peak-level magical beasts, 10,000 points!”","Ling Hao grew excited as he spoke. “If we can kill Class B peak-level magical beasts, the points we get will be the same as the reward we’ll receive for becoming the top team!”","Feng Wu nodded. “We’ll be killing magical beasts of that level, then.”","Ling Hao looked at Feng Wu, then turned away.","He couldn’t understand it. She was such a pretty girl. Why was she so shameless?","Shao Xiao couldn’t take that level of confidence. As the team leader, he had to say something.","He cleared his throat. “Xiao Wu, let’s take baby steps, okay? One step at a time.”"]},{"number":2648,"title":"Chapter 2648 - Python","paragraphs":["“That’s right!” Cheng Fang smirked. “Even Shan Jingfei, the top student of our class, can’t kill such a beast. Why do you think you can? Don’t make me laugh!”","Feng Wu asked. “Has she hunted one before?”","Cheng Fang said, “Of course!”","Feng Wu said, “Then we’re fine.” That meant a magical beast at that level wasn’t all that capable.","Cheng Fang was speechless.","He almost choked on his own spit. He decided to stop talking and let the arrogant girl learn her lesson on her own.","The team remained silent after that.","Wang Zhi was the only person on this team who hadn’t said a word.","He was the most intelligent team member and would usually come up with all the strategies. As a result, he was quite an authoritative figure in the team.","Cheng Fang complained to Wang Zhi, “If it were up to me, I would have picked Ye Han. She’s a healer!”","Cheng Fang was often injured, and Ye Han had treated him a few times. He was grateful for it.","Wang Zhi glanced at Feng Wu and then smiled at Cheng Fang. “If I were you, I’d try to be nice to her.”","Cheng Fang was shocked. “Are you on her side now?”","Wang Zhi smiled. “If I’m correct, Feng Wu is going to surprise us.”","No matter how much Cheng Fang asked, Wang Zhi wouldn’t say another word.","Ling Hao walked by Feng Wu’s side. “Since we’re from Class B, we’re going into the middle ring. You should watch out and stay away from the inner circle. That’s Class A’s territory. If we go in there, the magical beasts will eat us alive.","“Pay attention to the yellow line on the ground. Our zone is on this side, and their zone is on the other side.","“We’re now going to kill a Class B magical beast.”","Ling Hao glanced at Feng Wu. Seeing how unaffected she was, Ling Hao said solemnly, “Feng Wu, what’s with that look on your face? Are you looking down on this beast?","“Listen to me! Magical beasts at this level are equivalent to Level 5 Spiritual Lords!","“Sure. We’re all Level 5 Spiritual Lords.","“However, humans will never be the match of magical beasts of the same level. Even if we’re a team, running into such a magical beast is still dangerous. You must be careful!”","“We’re here,” Shao Xiao warned them. “There’s a Lightning Python in a cave a short distance away. It’s an advanced Level B magical beast. Take cover, and be careful!”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Shao Xiao, Wang Zhi, Ling Hao, and Cheng Fang all took cover.","Ling Hao grabbed Feng Wu and Huo Shan so that they could stay with him.","Shao Xiao said, “I’ll lure out that snake. You guys attack it!”","His teammates nodded.","Shao Xiao turned to Feng Wu and Huo Shan. “You’ve just joined us and don’t know this area well. Guard the east and west exits. Don’t let the python get away!”","Feng Wu and Huo Shan nodded before guarding the exits.","Whoosh!","The next second, Shao Xiao rushed into the cave.","Before long, they heard angry roars coming out of the cave.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Shao Xiao was the first to rush out.","A giant black python over ten meters long chased him.","“Kill it!” Shao Xiao stopped running once the python was out of the cave. He turned around and struck the beast."]},{"number":2649,"title":"Chapter 2649 - Poisoned","paragraphs":["A Lightning Python was as fast as its name suggested. It immediately dodged the attack.","“Attack!”","Shao Xiao, Wang Zhi, Ling Hao, and Cheng Fang moved all at once.","They attacked at the same time.","Feng Wu crossed her arms and glanced at the python.","A Lightning Python at this level could fight off four humans of the same level after exchanging dozens of stances.","Magical beasts were naturally more powerful than humans.","However, it was going to lose after a few more rounds.","She was right!","Before long, Shao Xiao hit the python with a hard blow.","However, the python also bit Cheng Fang on the arm.","“Ah!” Cheng Fang screamed.","Shao Xiao and the others turned pale, because the blood oozing out was purple instead of red.","He had been poisoned!","While they were looking at Cheng Fang, the python turned to run.","It was much faster than other magical beasts.","Whoosh!","It ran in Huo Shan’s direction.","He had been waiting for the beast.","His teammates shouted, “Stop it! Huo Shan, stop it!”","Huo Shan wasn’t affected by all the shouting. He just stared at the python.","When it was close enough, he raised his sword and struck down.","There was a loud thump.","His blade hit the python in its weakest spot.","When the others realized what had happened, the python had been decapitated.","Its long body fell onto the ground in two halves, and blood gushed out.","Ling Hao was astonished.","He looked from Huo Shan, whose clothes were splattered with blood, to the dead beast on the ground.","“Huo Shan, did you do this?”","Huo Shan said, “Yup. I think I’m doing alright, right?”","Ling Hao said, “I didn’t know you could do that!”","Ling Hao patted Huo Shan on the shoulder and spoke to Shao Xiao with a smile. “Shao Xiao, we’ve found a treasure.”","Shao Xiao was equally pleased. “Huo Shan, that’s great. Keep up the good work.”","Huo Shan hadn’t done it for his teammates. He was only trying to prove to Feng Wu that he could be useful to her, so that she could take him under her wing.","However, he didn’t see Feng Wu when he looked up.","“Where’s Boss Feng Wu?” He panicked a little.","Boss Feng Wu? Ling Hao said grumpily, “I don’t know what’s gotten into your head. You’re so much better than Feng Wu. Why are you calling her your boss?”","Huo Shan said, “That’s not important!”","Ling Hao asked, “What’s important, then?”","Huo Shan couldn’t tell them that Feng Wu was the crown prince’s girl. It was the biggest secret!","He only waved at him. “You won’t understand.”","Meanwhile, the other team members stood around Cheng Fang.","Wang Zhi grabbed his arm and asked hastily, “Cheng Fang, how do you feel? Can you think straight? How many fingers am I holding up?’","Wang Zhi waved three fingers in front of Cheng Fang’s face.","The poison was so potent that Cheng Fang had turned a purplish-blue color in a matter of minutes!"]},{"number":2650,"title":"Chapter 2650 - Save Him","paragraphs":["Cheng Fang wanted to say something, but he couldn’t utter a word.","“How’s Cheng Fang doing? Is he alright?” Ling Hao arrived in a hurry and panicked when he saw Cheng Fang’s dilated pupils.","Wang Zhi checked Cheng Fang’s pulse, and his face darkened.","“How is he?” Shao Xiao and Ling Hao asked in unison.","Wang Zhi shook his head. “The python’s venom is too potent. It has spread to his brain.”","“How can it progress so rapidly?”","“Don’t we always bring antitoxin pills with us? Have you given him any?”","Shao Xiao and Ling Hao spoke in unison again.","Wang Zhi said, “I have, but the venom is too potent. There isn’t much we can do...”","Ling Hao stared at Wang Zhi. “Are you saying that...”","Wang Zhi nodded.","Cheng Fang lost hope.","Although the others didn’t say it out loud, he knew he was going to die. But he was so young! There were many goals he had yet to achieve. He wanted to live!","He swore to himself that he would be forever grateful to the person who could save his life.","“Help me!”","Everyone was filled with despair, when someone showed up next to them.","Feng Wu stuffed a red berry into Cheng Fang’s mouth. “Eat it.”","Cheng Fang swallowed it before he realized what was going on.","“What did you give him?!” Ling Hao stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu ignored him. Instead, she took a dagger out of her sleeve, disinfected it with a flame and told Huo Shan, “Hold out his right arm.”","“Sure!” Huo Shan followed Feng Wu’s order without hesitation.","“What on earth are you doing?!” Ling Hao stared at Feng Wu. “Don’t you know that Cheng Fang has been poisoned and is going to die? He...”","“Hold on,” Feng Wu told Huo Shan.","Huo Shan nodded and held Cheng Fang’s wrist tightly.","“I’m saving his life,” Feng Wu replied without looking up. She then carefully cleaned Cheng Fang’s wrist.","“Saving his life? What gave you that idea?” Ling Hao didn’t believe her. “You’re cutting his wrist. Do you think you can get the poisonous blood out of his system?","“Stay out of it,” Ling Hao told Feng Wu. He didn’t want her to take responsibility if something went wrong, so he said, “You’ll make it even worse! Back off!”","Shao Xiao and the others were overwhelmed with sorrow at the thought of losing Cheng Fang, and they shook their heads as well. “There’s no way you can get the blood out of his system just like that. There’s no other way...”","Feng Wu ignored them. With a flip of her hand, the dagger cut open Cheng Fang’s wrist.","“It won’t work. The venom has reached Cheng Fang’s brain,” Wang Zhi said in disappointment as he looked at the unconscious Cheng Fang.","He grabbed Cheng Fang’s other hand and made a solemn promise. “Cheng Fang, we know your elderly mother is sick at home. Don’t worry. We’ll take care of her after you’re gone. Rest in peace...”","Cheng Fang’s lips quivered, but he couldn’t speak a word.","His friends’ eyes filled with tears as they looked away.","Who would have thought when they set out this morning that they would lose a friend so soon?"]},{"number":2651,"title":"Chapter 2651 - Red Berry","paragraphs":["“Hm —”","Ling Hao burst into tears, and Wang Zhi sobbed.","“Who... Who says I’m dead?!”","All of a sudden!","They heard an angry roar.","What?!","They turned around and stared at Cheng Fang.","He wasn’t dead!","Yes, Cheng Fang was alive.","Next to him was a pool of purplish blood.","He was pale and weak, but his eyes were wide open as he beamed at his friends.","“Cheng Fang, you’re alive!” Ling Hao slapped Cheng Fang on the chest.","Cheng Fang coughed.","The venom hadn’t killed him, but Cheng Fang’s smack almost made him choke.","“Sorry, buddy. I didn’t mean to! I was just too excited!” Ling Hao scrambled to give Cheng Fang a hand. “How are you doing? Feeling better?”","Cheng Fang was finally breathing normally, and he shook his head at Ling Hao.’ Search () ‘? “You almost knocked the air out of me.”","Seeing that Cheng Fang was in better shape, Ling Hao held Cheng Fang’s other wrist that hadn’t been cut open and checked his pulse.","“Wait a minute!”","Wang Zhi cried out and stared at Feng Wu in amazement.","“The venom is leaving his system!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Huo Shan was still bleeding Cheng Fang while Feng Wu wiped her dagger.","Wang Zhi said, “The venom reached his brain, heart, and lungs, but it’s now gone!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Ling Hao and the others kept looking back and forth between Feng Wu and Wang Zhi.","What was going on?","Did Feng Wu really save Cheng Fang?","Ling Hao and Shao Xiao looked at each other in disbelief.","They were so excited that they covered their mouths.","If that was true, Ling Hao could have gotten Cheng Fang killed when he stopped Feng Wu from treating him.","Ling Hao stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded at Cheng Fang. “The venom is almost out of your system. Don’t worry. You’ll live.”","Cheng Fang wanted to cry. “Really? I will?!”","He was going to live!","He was going to see tomorrow’s sun!","Cheng Fang didn’t know how to express his gratitude toward Feng Wu.","The others felt the same.","Shao Xiao said excitedly, “Thank you, Feng Wu! We wouldn’t know what to do without you.”","Feng Wu casually said, “Don’t worry about it.”","Wang Zhi asked curiously, “Can bleeding him flush out the venom?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I fed him that red berry before I bled him.”","Wang Zhi asked, “What’s that red berry?”","Feng Wu pointed at a tree a few steps away.","Small red berries were dangling on the branches.","Wang Zhi asked, “How did you know they could treat the venom?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Do you see any plants in a 1km radius?”","Wang Zhi shook his head.","Feng Wu said, “Nothing else has survived around the python’s cave. However, this tree is flourishing. Don’t you think that’s strange?”","Wang Zhi’s eyes lit up."]},{"number":2652,"title":"Chapter 2652 - Savior","paragraphs":["Feng Wu added, “In the wild, many living creatures mutually reinforce or neutralize each other. This tree has the python’s energy on it and is the only living tree in the area. The tree and the python likely reinforce each other.”","Wang Zhi nodded. “How could you be sure?”","Feng Wu said, “I would know once he ate the berry.”","She had noticed that someone was watching them from behind some trees in the distance, and she could feel the person’s gaze follow her around. She decided not to reveal all her secrets.","She simply made up an answer to give to Wang Zhi.","Wang Zhi asked, “What if you guessed wrong?”","Feng Wu said, “It was better than nothing.”","Shao Xiao cleared his throat. “Luckily, we saved Cheng Fang. That’s the best news!”","Everyone nodded.","Ling Hao patted Cheng Fang on the shoulder and chuckled. “It’s your lucky day! Feng Wu just happened to spot that tree!”","Cheng Fang laughed.","Ye Han suddenly showed up. When she saw Cheng Fang on the ground, she asked hastily, “Cheng Fang, are you alright?”","Shan Jingfei’s team had arrived before hers did, and they were the ones who had been observing Feng Wu.","Ye Han’s team arrived a little later, and she thought she had a chance when Cheng Fang collapsed. However, she had shown up just a little too late...","“I was almost killed by that venom, but I’m fine now.” Cheng Fang beamed at Ye Han.","Ye Han patted her chest. “I was so scared. By the way, here are some potions I prepared. It can neutralize a lot of toxins. Don’t lose them!”","She acted like Cheng Fang’s best friend.","Cheng Fang said, “Ye Han, you’re so thoughtful. I would feel so much safer if we had you with us.”","Huo Shan was annoyed.","“Cheng Fang, have you forgotten who just saved your life?!”","Cheng Fang glanced at Feng Wu but didn’t say anything.","Yes, Feng Wu had saved him, but he considered it dumb luck and believed Ye Han was the actual physician.","He didn’t retort, because it would make him sound ungrateful, but he still asked Shao Xiao, “Captain, can we have Ye Han back on the team?”","Shao Xiao’s smile froze a little, and he was involuntarily against the idea. “She’s with another team already. How can she join us now? We don’t have such a rule. Plus, she wouldn’t want to either.”","Ye Han smirked inwardly.","Her aim here wasn’t to kill magical beasts and earn points. Instead, she was here to see Feng Wu meet her doom. She wanted to see everyone despise the girl.","Hence, she looked at Shao Xiao and the other team members in concern. “I can’t join you, but after what happened to Cheng Fang, I can’t leave you here all by yourselves either. Duanmu, do you think our teams can stay together?”","Shao Xiao looked from Ye Han to her team leader Duanmu Huo and asked, “Shall we?”","Ye Han whispered something in Duanmu Huo’s ear. He nodded and walked up to Shao Xiao.","Ye Han then smiled at Shao Xiao. “We’ve agreed to stay with your team for the rest of this hunt. Don’t worry. We won’t try to take away your magical beasts.”","Shao Xiao hesitated and looked at his teammates.","The others were still shocked by the poisonous python, so they agreed to let Ye Han’s team tag along."]},{"number":2653,"title":"Chapter 2653 - Master Level Medical Refiner","paragraphs":["“How about we stay with them as well?” Hiding behind the trees, Xin Zhixuan happily made the suggestion to Shan Jingfei.","Shan Jingfei stared at her.","Xin Zhixuan didn’t see the strange look in Shan Jingfei’s eyes because she was immersed in her own delusion.","“I never liked that Feng Wu, right from the moment I saw her!”","After a pause, Xin Zhixuan said, “That look in her eyes... It’s so condescending and arrogant, as if we’re ants and she’s this fairy that’s too good for us!","“She’s the one who came from a lower class. She should be trying to please us, not the other way round! There’s just so much pride! Many boys who used to be into you are chasing her now!","“Jingfei, you have to stop trying to avoid her! We need to confront her!” Xin Zhixuan clenched her fists and urged Shan Jingfei. “She’s just a new student! We need to show her who we are!”","“Who we are?” Shan Jingfei recalled her battle with Feng Wu and felt as if her heart was caught in a tight grip. She frowned.","“Let’s go.” She led the team away.","Xin Zhixuan stared at her in disbelief.","Wasn’t their original plan to stay with Feng Wu? Why did their team leader just choose a completely different direction? Xin Zhixuan was perplexed.","“Jingfei? Jingfei?”","Her team followed her in confusion.","Meanwhile, Shan Jingfei was grinding her teeth.","Feng Wu...","Not only was she stunning, she was so capable. Shan Jingfei couldn’t stand it.","To make it worse, Feng Wu had concealed her real capability so that other people would see her as a weakling. Shan Jingfei saw it as utter humiliation.","She knew perfectly well that once Feng Wu showed her natural ability, no one in Class B would notice her anymore.","Why did Feng Wu have to exist in the first place?!","“I saw Shan Jingfei just then. Her team has headed in another direction.” Ye Han stayed close to Shao Xiao’s team deliberately, just to elbow out Feng Wu.","The idea had just occurred to Ye Han.","She realized that she had approached things in the wrong way.","Feng Wu was in the team because she had backed out. If she hadn’t arrived in time, Feng Wu would have won Cheng Fang over!","Therefore, she decided to change her approach. She needed to let Shao Xiao and the others know that the team couldn’t survive without her!","Therefore, Ye Han changed her attitude. She became more outgoing and showed more interest in her teammates.","She even walked up to Ling Hao and apologized for being rude to him before.","Ling Hao had been walking alongside Feng Wu, but after Ye Han arrived, Feng Wu was gradually pushed to the rear of the team. Ling Hao and Ye Han walked in the front.","Ling Hao laughed.","It was because of something Ye Han said.","Ling Hao looked over his shoulder and told Feng Wu, “Ye Han said she’s become a Master Level medical refiner! That’s great news! Our trip this time will be much safer!”","Ye Han gave Feng Wu a taunting look. In fact, she hadn’t become one, but she was getting there."]},{"number":2654,"title":"Chapter 2654 - Charity","paragraphs":["Huo Shan was speechless when he saw the arrogant look on Ye Han’s face.","Master Level medical refiner? Big deal! If they knew Feng Wu’s connections, they would be scared out of their wits!","However... Huo Shan glanced at Feng Wu and decided that she would have to go through a lot from now on because she didn’t have better medical skills.","He decided that he would defend Feng Wu’s dignity.","Everyone became much quieter after that. It was somewhat awkward.","As the team leader, Shao Xiao knew what this was about.","He and Wang Zhi looked at each other in resignation. Who would have thought that Ye Han and Feng Wu would dislike each other so much?","“Ahem — ”","As the team leader, Shao Xiao tried to break the ice.","“Our second target is 3 km ahead of us.","“It’s a Magic Vine Beast,” Shao Xiao said solemnly.","“A Magic Vine Beast?” Ye Han was confused. “Is that a plant or an animal?”","“Good question! Right to the point!” Shao Xiao gave Ye Han an approving look.","Ye Han was glad to hear it, especially when she was being compared with Feng Wu.","She gave Feng Wu an arrogant glance.","However, Feng Wu was checking the perimeter and didn’t notice her.","Ye Han rolled her eyes and decided to make Feng Wu suffer.","Huo Shan stuck out his tongue at her.","Ye Han glared at Huo Shan. “You sycophant!”","Huo Shan grinned. “So what? You can’t be one even if you want to!”","Ye Han was furious and found Huo Shan an idiot. “You’re such a clown!”","Huo Shan retorted, “You’re worse than a clown.”","Ye Han was so angry that she wouldn’t say another word.","Huo Shan felt both excited and lonely about being the only one to know the secret.","Shao Xiao was speechless when he heard the bickering.","He decided that he would take neither Huo Shan nor Feng Wu with them next time.","He didn’t have much hope for this hunt.","Killing the second target was probably as far as they could go this time.","“Technically, Magic Vine Beasts are magical beasts.","“However, vines grow on their backs, and they’re very good at hiding themselves. When they crouch down and stay still, they look just like actual vines. You must be careful from now on!","“They’re poisonous, too,” Shao Xiao warned the others.","“I’ve prepared some antidotes for you.” Ye Han knew it was time for her to impress the others. She took out a bottle and gave the others some pills.","“These are Master-level pills. I’m sure they can neutralize the vines’ toxin. Take it in advance, and you won’t have to worry about Magic Vine Beasts anymore!” Ye Han then distributed the pills.","She gave some to Shao Xiao, Wang Zhi, Cheng Fang, Ling Hao, and the members of the other team.","Finally, she came to Feng Wu’s side.","She looked down her nose at Feng Wu and said condescendingly, “Although I don’t like you, Ling Hao brought you into this team, so I can’t do anything about it. Take this pill as charity!”"]},{"number":2655,"title":"Chapter 2655 - Magic Vine Beast","paragraphs":["Charity?","Feng Wu glanced at her.","“Hold out your hand!” Ye Han gloated.","Feng Wu didn’t want to speak to her and waved her off.","“Don’t you want it?” Ye Han stared at her in disbelief.","She thought Feng Wu had lost her mind.","Thinking that Feng Wu was acting out, Ling Hao stepped out and told Ye Han, “I’ll keep it for her.”","He then held out his hand.","“That won’t do.” Ye Han frowned. “I’m giving it to her. It’s none of your business, Ling Hao! Otherwise, you can give back your pill, too!”","Ling Hao gave Feng Wu an apologetic look.","Ye Han smirked. “Are you sure? It’s a Master-level pill. Don’t blame me for not helping you if the poison kills you later!”","Feng Wu glanced at her and nodded.","Ye Han didn’t expect Feng Wu to be so stubborn, so she put away the pill and snorted. “I guess good intentions aren’t always appreciated.”","Feng Wu suddenly asked, “Have you recovered from your injury yet?”","Ye Han stiffened.","She had forgotten something.","On her first day of school, Feng Wu practically crippled Ye Han in Room 2001.","“Mind your own business!” Ye Han feigned a harsh tone, threw a dirty look at Feng Wu, and walked away.","Feng Wu smiled.","Fearing that the two girls would cause a scene, Shao Xiao intervened. “We’re very close to the Magic Vine Beast now. Stay hidden while we move forward!”","Feng Wu suddenly asked, “How many beasts are we talking about?”","Ye Han smirked. “Stop pretending. Magic Vine Beasts are Level 5 Spiritual Lords! One beast is all that we can handle. How many do you want? You’re so greedy!”","“Ye Han!” Shao Xiao scolded Ye Han before he smiled at Feng Wu. “Just one, but it’s very well-hidden and will be very hard to find.”","One? Feng Wu looked at the leaves on a branch a few steps away and didn’t say a word.","“Why is there water? The dew should have dried up by now.” Ling Hao wiped his face when he felt some water dripping on his face.","“I feel it, too.” Cheng Fang nodded. “Ling Hao, why is your face green?”","Green?!","Instantly, all eyes were on Ling Hao.","Ling Hao asked, “What’s wrong? It’s quite cool and comfortable...”","Shao Xiao cried out, “Ling Hao, the green liquid is from the Magic Vine Beast! It’s above you!”","Shao Xiao then threw out the weapon he was holding.","Whoosh!","The Magic Vine Beast evaded the weapon.","Not only did it evade the attack, it disappeared almost immediately.","“Where did it go?!” Cheng Fang’s eyes widened. However, they looked everywhere and couldn’t find the beast.","Shao Xiao had a solemn look on his face.","“Magic Vine Beasts have the abilities of both plants and animals. They can hide themselves as magical plants, and we won’t see them even if they’re right next to us.","“Moreover...” Shao Xiao’s face darkened. “Somehow, I feel that this beast is much faster than the one I encountered last time!”"]},{"number":2656,"title":"Chapter 2656 - Level 6 Spiritual Lord","paragraphs":["“Shao Xiao, are you saying...” Cheng Fang stared at Shao Xiao.","Shao Xiao said solemnly, “If I’m guessing correctly, the beast is much stronger than before!”","Cheng Fang asked, “What do you mean by stronger...”","Shao Xiao said, “It’s probably a Level 6 Spiritual Lord...”","“Oh my god!” Ling Hao cried out. “If that’s the case, we have no hope at all!”","“That’s right. Without Shan Jingfei’s help, we’ll...”","“Now what?” Everyone looked at Shao Xiao.","Shao Xiao looked at Ling Hao with a severe expression on his face.","“Why are you looking at me?” Ling Hao was confused.","Shao Xiao said, “You’ve already been poisoned.”","Ling Hao patted his chest. “Don’t worry. We have Ye Han, don’t we? She gave us the antidote earlier. What can possibly happen?”","There was an indescribable look in Shao Xiao’s eyes.","Ye Han was equally confident. “Don’t worry. My pills are Master-level ones. If the Magic Vine Beast really is a Level 6 Spiritual Lord, we must leave now!”","She then turned to leave.","Shao Xiao asked Ling Hao, “Are you sure you’re okay?”","Ling Hao nodded. “I feel fine. It’s quite cool. It’s as refreshing as wearing mint leaves on my face.”","Shao Xiao said, “If that’s the case, let’s get out of here now. We can’t fight a Level 6 Spiritual Lord magical beast.”","The others nodded as well.","Feng Wu suddenly spoke just as the others were about to leave.","“Ling Hao, if you don’t want to die, stay where you are.”","Everyone looked at her.","Ye Han snapped at her, “Feng Wu, what’s that supposed to mean? Are you saying that my antidote doesn’t work on Ling Hao?!”","Feng Wu turned her cold gaze on Ye Han.","Because no one’s life had been in danger before, Feng Wu couldn’t be bothered to talk to her and had let Ye Han play her petty tricks.","However, she was serious now.","Her glare made Ye Han jump.","“Feng Wu, what are you talking about?” Feng Wu’s stare made Ling Hao uneasy.","Feng Wu said coldly, “The toxin has reached your heart! You say you haven’t been poisoned? Don’t be stupid!”","“What? How’s that possible? Didn’t Ye Han say... Ouch! My chest hurts!” Ling Hao pressed his hands to his chest, crouched down and curled up on the ground.","Shao Xiao glared at Ye Han. “Didn’t you say the toxin has been neutralized?”","Ye Han trembled. “I already did it...”","Shao Xiao said, “Does he look like he’s alright?”","Ye Han panicked. “I...”","Shao Xiao said, “Help him!”","Ye Han said, “Of course!”","Just then, a greenish creature jumped into sight.","“It’s the Magic Vine Beast! Watch out! Wang Zhi, attack!”","Shao Xiao charged at the beast.","Cheng Fang hadn’t recovered from his previous injury, and Ling Hao was poisoned. Shao Xiao believed that he and Wang Zhi were the only two people who could fight the beast.","However, things went from bad to worse.","Shao Xiao realized something in despair.","“The Magic Vine Beast has evolved! It’s a Level 6 Spiritual Lord now!”"]},{"number":2657,"title":"Chapter 2657 - Who’s Your Boss?","paragraphs":["The others all went pale when they heard that.","“How can it be a Level 6 Spiritual Lord? That’s a Class A beast! We’re not Class A students! How are we supposed to fight it?”","“Run!” Ye Han was the first to try and run.","They heard some whooshing sounds.","More Magic Vine Beasts appeared, surrounding the team.","One, two, three, four...","They no longer bothered to disguise themselves with their green vines and leaves. Instead, they stood up and faced all the students.","“Holy crap...”","Everyone cried out.","There were more of them...","In the end, they were surrounded by a dozen Magic Vine Beasts!","Ye Han almost fainted.","As if one Magic Vine Beast wasn’t enough to make them despair, there were twelve of them!","They had never felt so full of despair before.","“What should we do now?” Ye Han was so scared that she hid behind Shao Xiao.","Shao Xiao was ghastly pale as well.","However, he was the team leader, and everyone was counting on him. If he panicked, the others would fall apart as well.","“Don’t panic! There must be a way out of here!” Shao Xiao’s voice trembled as he tried to calm the others. “Stay calm! They won’t eat us!”","However, they saw that the beasts were slowly approaching them with hungry looks in their eyes.","They were closing in.","The vines on the beasts’ backs turned toward the students and kept spitting out the green liquid.","The venom was so potent that everyone turned pale.","“I don’t want to die...” Ye Han broke down. She was the first to break. “I don’t want to die. Help us!”","However, the beasts wouldn’t let them go just because of her tears.","On the contrary, they turned toward Ye Han and spat more liquid on her.","Ye Han was covered with it.","She screamed in fear.","The others weren’t doing much better. They had all turned a dark green shade.","Shao Xiao ground his teeth. “If we’re going to die anyway, let’s kill as many of them as possible before we’re gone! Attack!”","He struck first.","Huo Shan stopped Feng Wu.","In fact, he had been shielding Feng Wu this whole time and even took off his robe for her.","“Feng Wu, you go first!” Huo Shan said affirmatively. “I’ll hold them off for you! Run!”","Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder. “Move aside. I know what to do.”","But Huo Shan didn’t believe her.","He believed that Feng Wu was far weaker than he was and needed his protection.","“No, I won’t!” Huo Shan insisted. “I told you to leave, so just leave!”","Feng Wu asked, “Why won’t you leave?”","Huo Shan was on the brink of tears. “What good will it do if I get out alive? My boss’s boss will eat me alive! Compared with that, I’d rather die here!”","Feng Wu said, “Who’s that?”"]},{"number":2658,"title":"Chapter 2658 - Feng Wu, You...","paragraphs":["Feng Wu said, “Who’s that?”","Huo Shan said, “You know who I’m talking about!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She honestly didn’t know who it was, but there was no time for chit-chat.","Everything happened in a split second. She grabbed Huo Shan by the back of his collar and yanked him backward.","The others weren’t as lucky and were under attack by the Magic Vine Beasts.","The beasts sprayed the venom at the humans at first, but when they saw how weak their targets were, they turned the vines into sharp weapons.","Whoosh!","Each beast chose a human target.","The vines reached out and immediately wrapped around the students.","“Ah!” Ye Han screamed.","The vine wrapped her up from her neck to her ankles.","Before long, she would be strangled.","“Help me! I don’t want to die!”","The realization made Ye Han turn ghastly pale.","Shao Xiao and the others weren’t doing any better.","There was little they could do when facing Class A Magic Vine Beasts.","It seemed that they were about to be annihilated.","Feng Wu made a move.","No one saw what she did, but when they realized what had happened, she had ripped off the vine wrapped around Huo Shan with her bare hands.","That was right!","She didn’t use any weapons.","She just tugged, and the vine fell apart.","Feng Wu then went to Ling Hao and pulled the vine off him before doing the same to the rest of the team.","She didn’t use a knife or fire. She simply pulled the vines.","She didn’t try to untie the vines. Instead, she just quickly flitted around, as if she were dancing.","The others didn’t know what she was doing.","By the time they realized it, they were free from the vines.","That wasn’t all.","Feng Wu was still holding all the vines, and Ling Hao counted. There were twelve in her hands.","That was to say...","She was holding onto all the Magic Vine Beasts.","His gaze followed the vines back to the beasts.","It was incredible!","The rampaging beasts all looked defeated. They crouched on the ground and didn’t dare move.","The vines were now wrapped around their necks.","It seemed that Feng Wu would tug the vines and strangle all of them if they didn’t behave.","Ling Hao couldn’t believe his eyes.","He looked from the beasts to Feng Wu.","“Feng Wu, you...”","The others saw it as well.","Shao Xiao was equally excited. “Feng Wu?”","These were Class-A Magic Vine Beasts, and Feng Wu was controlling all twelve of them.","Shao Xiao never knew such a thing was possible.","Feng Wu nodded at her teammates before ordering the twelve Magic Vine Beasts, “Move closer.”","One of the beasts tried to fight back.","Feng Wu tugged at it, and the vine tightened around the beast’s neck.","Thena€”","The beast squeaked."]},{"number":2659,"title":"Chapter 2659 - My Face Hurts...","paragraphs":["One beast squeaked.","The other Magic Vine Beasts glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu raised her hands, threatening to do the same to the others.","Magic Vine Beasts were intelligent beasts, and they immediately lowered their heads when Feng Wu threatened them.","The team members didn’t know what to say.","Why did these Magic Vine Beasts remind them of monkeys in a circus?","After being disciplined, the beasts obediently walked up to Feng Wu and crouched down in a circle around her.","Feng Wu handed the vines to Shao Xiao. “They’re all yours.”","Shao Xiao’s eyes lit up.","However, the vines snapped as soon as he held them in his hands.","The beasts severed the vines from their bodies and bolted.","They had abandoned the vines.","They had to leave the vines behind to stay alive.","Shao Xiao was astonished.","The others were equally shocked and shouted, “Watch out! Get them!”","However —","They were once more amazed by Feng Wu.","“Ground Control!”","Feng Wu activated that stance.","All the beasts were frozen on the spot. They weren’t going anywhere.","“Die!”","Seeing this, Shao Xiao gave the command.","The others knew that this was going to be their only chance.","Shao Xiao, Ling Hao, and even Ye Han started attacking the beasts.","The Class A Magic Vine Beasts had much thicker skin that was hard to cut through. The students had no choice but to keep chopping.","Luckily, Feng Wu had trapped these beasts in place. Otherwise, they would never be able to break through their defense.","“Phew —”","By the time they cut through the skin, five minutes had passed.","They dug out the crystal cores of all twelve beasts.","Shao Xiao let out a breath of relief and told Feng Wu, “Thank you, Feng Wu! You’re the hero of the day!”","Ye Han was so jealous that she thought she was going to lose her mind. “Big deal. It’s just Ground Control.”","“Ye Han!” Wang Zhi scolded her.","Big deal?","Other people might not have seen what happened, but Wang Zhi had seen everything.","Feng Wu had controlled a dozen Magic Vine Beasts on her own, which was even more difficult to do than killing them! It was impossible to know how capable she was!","The only thing Wang Zhi knew for sure was that Feng Wu was good enough to go to Class A.","He wouldn’t let Ye Han disrespect such a genius.","Ye Han was furious when she saw that Wang Zhi was also siding with Feng Wu. However, she didn’t dare say another word.","“My face hurts so much...”","Ling Hao was thrilled after killing two beasts. He was about to show off to Feng Wu, when he felt the pain on his face.","It wasn’t just his face...","“My chest hurts a lot, too!”","His words seemed contagious.","The others put their hands on their chests and cried out in pain as well.","“My chest hurts, too! What’s going on?”","“It’s the Magic Vine Beasts! Have you forgotten? Their juice is poisonous!”","“It’s so itchy, too!”","“Stop it! You’re only making it worse!”","“Help! Help!”","Everyone rolled around on the ground from the pain and the itchiness.","“Ye Han! Ye Han!”","Finally, they recalled that Ye Han was with them.","She was a physician!"]},{"number":2660,"title":"Chapter 2660 - Why Are You Alright?","paragraphs":["She was a physician!","She was supposed to be a Master Level medicine refiner!","“Ye Han, help us!”","“Ye Han, aren’t you a Master Level medicine refiner?”","“Ye Han, didn’t you say that you can help us?”","...","Ye Han’s stomach lurched.","Yes, she was a Master Level medicine refiner. No... She hadn’t become one yet.","She was far from being capable enough to handle such venom!","She was also poisoned and rolling around on the ground.","“Stop shouting. Can’t you hear that Ye Han is the loudest? Given her condition, she can’t possibly help us,” said Cheng Fang.","Ling Hao said, “Didn’t she brag about how her pills can neutralize any toxin?!”","Ye Han was in such agony that her face was scarlet red. She muttered, “Cheng Fang’s right! Those are Class A Magic Vine Beasts! I’m only a Master! How am I supposed to do anything about their venom?!”","She said righteously, “You can’t count on me for everything! Even Shan Jingfei wouldn’t be able to do anything about this!”","Everyone went silent.","What Ye Han said made them lose all hope.","“Are you saying that we’ll stay poisoned like this?”","“We can’t even walk...”","“We can’t go back to campus when we’re like this!”","“We don’t have anything we can use to send a signal...”","“Are we all going to die here?!”","“We’re all poisoned! We can’t even stand up!” Ling Hao’s voice was filled with pain.","Suddenly...","They noticed the shadows of two people on the ground.","They belonged to Feng Wu and Huo Shan.","“Feng Wu is still standing!”","“She’s not poisoned!”","Everyone looked at Feng Wu in amazement. “You’re not poisoned!”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right.”","Ling Hao then looked at Huo Shan and was even more shocked.","“Huo Shan should have been poisoned! I saw it! He was splattered with the venom! Look! His robe is still green!” Ling Hao pointed at Huo Shan. “Why is he still standing? Is he alright?”","Whoosh —","Practically all eyes were on Huo Shan.","“Huo Shan, do you feel alright?”","“Yup,” said Huo Shan.","“Aren’t you in pain?”","Huo Shan shook his head.","“Any itchiness?”","“Nope,” said Huo Shan.","Ling Hao was baffled. “But why? You should have been poisoned!”","Huo Shan was equally confused. “I have no idea.”","He then popped something into his mouth.","“What are you eating?!”","“It’s candy. Boss Feng Wu gave it to me,” Huo Shan said proudly.","“Show me.” Ling Hao struggled to sit up and took the so-called candy. He was surprised by what he saw. “Do you call this candy?”","Feng Wu frowned a little because she heard the sounds of fighting a short distance away.","“I’ll be right back!” With that, she dashed off.","However, the others only cared about Huo Shan’s “candy” right now.","Ling Hao sniffed the “candy” and noticed something.","“Why does it smell like a pill?” He was perplexed.","Shao Xiao took it in his hand. “Candy? That’s obviously a pill! And it’s a Grandmaster-level one!","“It’s an antidote especially for magical plants!”"]},{"number":2661,"title":"Chapter 2661 - Enraged","paragraphs":["Shao Xiao finally recognized the pill. “It’s an antidote that can neutralize the toxins of all kinds of magical plants, and it smells so much more potent than what you can buy from the academy. Why do you call it candy?”","Huo Shan said, “It’s candy because Boss Feng Wu told me so.”","Grandmaster-level antidotes were crazy expensive, and the price of a panacea would be exorbitant. As a result, no one could bring themselves to buy such a pill for an event like this.","However, Huo Shan was eating these pills as if they were candy.","“Do you have more? Give me some!”","Everyone asked Huo Shan for the pills.","Soon, they ate up what was left in Huo Shan’s hands.","Even Ye Han jumped at the opportunity, and she was much fiercer than the others. She even scratched Huo Shan’s face in the process.","After taking the antidote, they soon realized that the itchiness was going away and they weren’t in so much pain anymore.","“To carry so many pills on her, Feng Wu must be wealthy,” Ling Hao glanced at Ye Han as he spoke.","The so-called Master medicine refiner’s pills were nowhere near as effective as Feng Wu’s antidote.","Ye Han wouldn’t accept it. “I’m a Master medicine refiner; she just bought the pills! She can’t possibly be at my level!”","Huo Shan glanced at Ye Han and snorted. “Boss Feng Wu said she made the pills herself.”","“Pfft —”","Ye Han snorted. “And you believe her? These are Grandmaster-level pills. Do you think she’s a Grandmaster medicine refiner? You must be dreaming!”","Huo Shan glanced at Ye Han. “Why is it so unbelievable? If you ask me, Boss Feng Wu can be a Supreme medicine refiner.”","Ye Han laughed so hard that she almost coughed blood. “A Supreme medicine refiner? Don’t make me laugh! That’s ridiculous!”","“Ye Han!” Shao Xiao gave her a stern look.","Although he didn’t believe that Feng Wu was a Grandmaster either, her pills had saved them all, and he had to be grateful.","Ye Han smirked.","“For someone who acts so arrogantly, you sure grabbed the pill quick enough.” Huo Shan glared at Ye Han. “If you say one more bad thing about Boss Feng Wu, I’ll have you spit out the pill!”","Ye Han was shocked.","She stared at Huo Shan and couldn’t believe how stubborn the man was.","“I’ll repay you with my points when we get back!” Ye Han snorted.","Huo Shan said, “You would be dead by now if you could only buy the antidote after you got back to campus.”","Ye Han said, “What on earth do you want?”","Huo Shan said, “You’ll need to pay back at least ten times what you owe!”","Ye Han trembled with anger. “Huo Shan, you’re going too far!”","Huo Shan said, “You deserve it! That’s what you get for saying bad things about Boss Feng Wu!”","The squabbling was giving Shao Xiao a headache. “Stop right there. We’ll talk about compensation after we get back. The hunt is the most important thing right now.”","The twelve crystal cores were on the ground.","Shao Xiao opened his mouth.","No one could deny the fact that Feng Wu was the only reason that they were able to obtain them.","Without her, not only would they have lost the crystal cores, they would also have been eradicated.","“I’ll keep those!” Ye Han wanted to grab the crystal cores.","“Wait.” Huo Shan was displeased. “Are you our team member? Didn’t you see who obtained them for us? You were saying bad things about my boss only a minute ago, and now, you’re trying to steal her achievements? You’re so shameless!”","Ye Han was so angry that her face twisted."]},{"number":2662,"title":"Chapter 2662 - Team Xuecheng","paragraphs":["Feng Wu rushed toward the noise.","Soon, she saw that a team was being chased by a magical beast.","She searched her memory and recalled that she had seen one in the illustrated handbook which the school gave to students.","It was a Fire Snow Lion.","It was a giant beast that was the size of a small house when it stood on its hind legs. How intimidating!","It left deep footprints in the ground.","Thump!","Five people were running away from it.","They were of average height, but the lion was so huge that they looked like ants in comparison.","“Hongxue, run!”","Four teenage boys ran in the front, and a girl was at the back.","It seemed that the lion was going to trample Hongxue, and everyone panicked. The teenagers panicked and shouted at her, trying to urge her on.","However, Hongxue was exhausted, and she said, “You guys go ahead! I’ll cover you!”","Since she couldn’t get away, she would die bravely and give her teammates a chance to live.","Hongxue drew out her sword and turned to face the lion.","Feng Wu admired her courage.","However, Hongxue wasn’t competent enough to be the lion’s match.","She had just become a Level 6 Spiritual Lord, but the lion was a Level 6 Spiritual Lord already.","That made the lion equivalent to a human Level 7 Spiritual Lord at their peak.","Hongxue was doomed.","“Ye Hongxue!”","The second-last boy cried out and made a choice which surprised Feng Wu.","He doubled back to help Ye Hongxue fight the lion.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","She recalled an old joke about two people running into a bear. One said to the other, “I don’t need to outrun the bear. I just need to outrun you.”","She saw real friendship in this team.","Feng Wu wanted to intervene, but at that moment, the other three teenagers turned around and joined their teammates.","Ye Hongxue cried out, “Juncheng, why did you come back? Run!”","Lin Juncheng was covered with blood and he was heavily injured in the stomach, but he gritted his teeth, “We can’t leave you behind! We’ll live and die together!”","The other three chimed in, “We’re not going anywhere!”","Ye Hongxue had tears in her eyes. “Don’t be stupid! You need to get away while there’s still a chance!”","Lin Juncheng smiled, “Peace Grassland was so dangerous, and our team survived it. We won’t abandon you now! Let’s just kill this lion!”","“Juncheng is right! We’ll stick together no matter what! We’ll leave no one behind!” Xue Hao nodded.","The other two nodded as well and joined the battle without another word.","Seeing how united they were, Feng Wu hid behind a tree and didn’t interfere immediately.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","The five teenagers fought the giant lion together.","Feng Wu noticed the letter A on their armbands. It seemed that this team called Xuecheng belonged to Class A."]},{"number":2663,"title":"Chapter 2663 - The Girl Who Came Out of Nowhere","paragraphs":["Feng Wu had heard that even the weakest students in Class A were Level 6 Spiritual Lords.","However...","The lion was so ferocious that the five people couldn’t hold it back.","Ye Hongxue was smart. She winked at her teammates, and they soon created a formation in the shape of a star.","Feng Wu nodded. That formation could amplify a cultivator’s capability by 50% and was very helpful with killing moves.","The lion was powerful, but with the amplification, the team could take it down.","It was incredible!","Together, the five members soon suppressed the lion.","Everyone thought they would soon kill the beast, but it suddenly went berserk.","It was like a wildfire.","Surging flames almost touched the sky.","The lion roared.","The soundwave and the flames threw all five team members off balance.","They lost all hope.","At such a critical moment, the lion had gone berserk.","“Run!” Xue Hao, the team leader, shouted at the top of his lungs.","But where to?","Everywhere they turned, there were flames and heavy smoke.","The lion’s energy had them trapped as if they were in a cage.","They froze on the spot and couldn’t move a muscle.","The lion was furious.","The team had blinded it in the right eye with the formation, and countless tiny bloody cuts covered its body.","However, the lion was enormous, and the wounds couldn’t affect it in the slightest when it was in this berserk state.","The lion was an intelligent beast.","The Magic Vine Beasts were only Class B, but they were already so intelligent, let alone a Class A lion.","There was a malicious look in its eyes as it stomped on the ground. Flames filled the pit, and there were sparks everywhere.","Ye Hongxue was the closest to the lion.","“Hongxue, run!” her teammates shouted.","Ye Hongxue tried to run away, but she couldn’t move a finger, let alone rise to her feet.","The lion was already in front of her.","It raised its giant paw.","“No!!!”","The team members screamed.","“We survived Peace Grassland – are we going to be killed by a beast now?!”","“So many of our friends died, and we only killed a few Dongsang soldiers!”","“I don’t want to die now! I want to kill more enemies!”","...","No matter what they thought, the lion wouldn’t spare their lives now.","The lion roared and charged at the team.","It was going to trample Ye Hongxue.","It was going to trample all five humans.","Feng Wu made her move when the five people lost all hope.","No one saw how she did it.","The giant lion simply fell to the ground.","The impact sent sparks and ash flying.","The air was filled with dust.","Ye Hongxue stared at their savior in disbelief.","The girl wore a red dress and was more beautiful than anyone she had ever met."]},{"number":2664,"title":"Chapter 2664 - Incredible Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Feng Wu pressed the lion to the ground as soon as she joined the battle.","The others looked at her in amazement.","What just happened?","Ye Hongxue was the closest, so she was the most astonished.","She watched as Feng Wu jumped into the circle and kicked the lion to the ground.","“Are you alright?” Feng Wu asked Ye Hongxue.","Ye Hongxue shook her head.","Feng Wu then turned to the lion, which had scrambled to its feet.","It glared at Feng Wu and bared its teeth.","It raised its head, growled and charged at Feng Wu.","“Watch out!”","The members of Xuecheng Team cried out in unison.","However, Feng Wu kicked the lion again before it could touch her.","Thump!","The lion flew backward again.","This time, the lion made a perfect arch in the air before it hit the ground.","Its body continued skidding over the ground after it landed, stirring up dust.","Sparks flew everywhere.","Finally, things quieted down.","The dust cleared.","The sparks died down.","The team saw what had become of the lion.","It had been so proud and fierce before, but it was in such a messy state now.","Its giant body sprawled over the ground, and its limbs were too weak to support its massive body.","Blood oozed out from countless holes in its body.","Smoke rose from its charred skin.","It could barely keep its eyes open. Although its eyes were filled with hatred, the lion couldn’t stand up no matter how hard it tried.","Everybody could see that the life was swiftly leaving its body.","In the end, it closed its eyes and never opened them again.","Xue Hao cautiously approached the lion to ensure that it was really dead.","He turned around and looked at Feng Wu in amazement.","Xuecheng Team also stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","That was incredible!","One kick!","She had just kicked the lion, and it fell down and died.","Who was this girl in red?","“You...” Xue Hao wanted to ask her who she was.","However, Feng Wu only glanced at them. Seeing that Ye Hongxue was severely injured, she crouched down next to the girl, and her fingertips glowed with green light.","The green light fell on Ye Hongxue, and she was healed as everyone watched.","Feng Wu rose to her feet, nodded to Ye Hongxue, and walked away.","“Miss!”","Xue Hao called after Feng Wu.","But Feng Wu didn’t look back and soon disappeared into the woods.","The team was speechless.","It took Xue Hao forever to realize what had happened. “Was she even human?”","“Of course she was! What do you think she was? A ghost?”","“No, I mean, she was like a goddess!” Xue Hao said excitedly. “What should I do? I think I’m in love!”","Ye Hongxue rolled her eyes at him. “I think you should ask for permission first.”","“Ye Hongxue, you can stand up!”"]},{"number":2665,"title":"Chapter 2665 - Telling the Truth","paragraphs":["“Ye Hongxue, you’re on your feet!” Xue Hao stared at his friend in disbelief.","The lion had wounded Ye Hongxue so badly that she had been lying on the ground and bleeding out before Feng Wu came.","“Your wounds are no longer bleeding!” the other team members observed.","Ye Hongxue nodded. “It’s not just that. My wounds have almost healed.”","“How... Oh my god! That girl is a Supreme-level medicine refiner!”","Only a Supreme-level medicine refiner could emit the green light.","Medicine refiners below that level could only make pills to treat patients.","“If I’m guessing correctly, she’s a medicine refiner who is at least at the Supreme level,” Ye Hongxue said in admiration.","Xue Hao said, “Not only that, she also kicked away the lion!”","The others nodded.","Xue Hao said, “What do you think her level is?”","Lin Juncheng said, “She has to be a Level 7 Spiritual Lord at least.”","Ye Hongxue shook her head. “I’ve fought Level 7 Spiritual Lords before, and she feels more powerful than that..”","Her teammates fell quiet.","“If that’s the case, how powerful must she be?”","The others shook their heads in amazement.","“She saved our lives, and we should be forever grateful for it,” Ye Hongxue said earnestly. “With her capability and medical skills, she’ll definitely stand out in the academy. We’ll find out who she is as soon as we ask around.”","“We left the academy for just six months, and such an amazing student showed up. How odd...”","Feng Wu went back to her team after helping Xuecheng Team.","After all, she was going to help her team become first.","She needed the reward.","When she got back, Ye Han shouted at her. “Feng Wu, what’s wrong with you?! Why did you leave us at the most dangerous moment?!”","Huo Shan shouted back at Ye Han before Feng Wu could say anything.","Huo Shan said, “Just because you’re a woman doesn’t mean I won’t hit you! Say one more bad thing about Xiao Wu, and I won’t be so nice!”","Ye Han said, “What did I do? Was I wrong?”","Huo Shan said, “First of all, Xiao Wu left only after she killed a dozen Magic Vine Beasts all by herself. She also left us the antidote beforehand, and all of you took some!”","“You!”","“Don’t you know the saying that a guest shouldn’t speak ill of their host? After everything she’s done for you, you’ve shown her no gratitude at all!”","“You!”","“Is Xiao Wu your nanny? She has no obligation to protect you!”","“You!”","“Who the hell do you think you are? How dare you talk to Boss Xiao Wu like that?!”","“You!”","“Stop with the ‘you’ already! Spit out the antidote! You ungrateful b*stard!”","Ye Han was so angry that she almost fainted.","She stared at Shao Xiao. “Aren’t you going to say something?”","What could Shao Xiao say? Huo Shan’s words were harsh, but he was telling the truth.","Shao Xiao said in resignation, “Ye Han, if you’re uncomfortable staying with us, why don’t you...”"]},{"number":2666,"title":"Chapter 2666 - Why Are You on Feng Wu’s Side?","paragraphs":["Was he telling her to leave?","Ye Han stared at Shao Xiao in disbelief. “Shao Xiao, what’s that supposed to mean?!”","Shao Xiao looked her in the eye.","Ye Han said, “Fine, none of you like me! I’ll go! Happy?!”","She started walking away.","Duanmu Huo looked from Ye Han to Shao Xiao, but he didn’t say anything in the end and only followed Ye Han.","His teammates weren’t pleased.","A girl named Xu Siyu frowned and muttered, “Why is she so willful?”","However, they were still on the same team, so the other team members had no choice but to follow their leader.","They didn’t try to hide their reluctance.","No one spoke for a while after Ye Han was gone, and everyone felt somewhat embarrassed.","Cheng Fang wanted to say something to Feng Wu, but kept his silence in the end.","Ye Han was his friend, but Feng Wu had saved him twice. He would have to be an utterly ungrateful person to turn against Feng Wu now.","“Are we going to let Ye Han go just like that?” Cheng Fang asked Shao Xiao.","Shao Xiao said coldly, “Ye Han was a proud person before, but she was at least reasonable. You’ve seen what she’s like with Xiao Wu. We can’t reason with her anymore.”","Ling Hao nodded. “We didn’t drive her away. She left voluntarily. It’s not like we could have begged her to stay, right?”","Wang Zhi nodded. “She’s not even on the same team with us anymore.”","Cheng Fang stared at his teammates in disbelief. “Why are you all on Feng Wu’s side?”","He glanced at Feng Wu as he spoke.","Because Feng Wu had saved his life, he couldn’t openly oppose her, which frustrated him.","“At least Ye Han is a Master-level medicine refiner,” Cheng Fang mumbled. “We would be much safer with her on our side.”","“Forget it! A Master-level medicine refiner? She was just bragging! What did she do when we were attacked by the Magic Vine Beasts? We’d all be dead if it hadn’t been for Xiao Wu! Cheng Fang, use your brain!” Ling Hao glowered at Cheng Fang.","Cheng Fang said, “But... but Ye Han is an actual physician, and Feng Wu was just lucky... She just happened to have the right medicine on her.”","Ling Hao didn’t want to waste his breath on Cheng Fang. “I see Xiao Wu saved you for nothing!”","Cheng Fang said, “I’m only telling the truth. Plus, I’m only concerned about the safety of our team.”","“That’s enough. Stop fighting!” Shao Xiao intervened. “We have a choice to make. Be quiet and listen to me!”","The others all looked at him.","Shao Xiao said, “We now have the crystal core of an advanced Class B magical beast and a dozen crystal cores of peak-level Class B magical beasts. Our team should be in second or third place.","“But the hunt will only end in three days, so we have a choice to make. Should we be content with what we already have and go back to school, or should we keep hunting?”","The question got the others thinking.","Wang Zhi said, “We’ve already obtained the biggest achievement we’ve ever made. Our team has never been in the top three before. We’ll receive satisfactory rewards if we go back now.”","Ling Hao said, “That’s right. Normally, we should be happy with making it into the top three. However, why are we here? Are we really going to stop now?”"]},{"number":2667,"title":"Chapter 2667 - To Tell You the Truth","paragraphs":["Ling Hao said, “Do you think the school sent us here just to hunt magical beasts? I think they want us to train in actual battle. Once we join Class A, we’ll see a real battlefield!”","Wang Zhi nodded. “The dangers we’ve seen here in Thousand Nights Forest are nothing compared with the battlefield. No one can get out unscratched.”","Ling Hao said, “If we’re lucky, maybe we can get first place!”","“In your dreams.” Shao Xiao was in disbelief. “Top three is already a miracle for us. First? Who are you kidding?”","Everyone else nodded.","Cheng Fang said, “So, does everyone agree that we’ll keep fighting?”","Shao Xiao hesitated for a while before he looked at Feng Wu.","“Feng Wu, what do you think?”","Immediately, all eyes were on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu had already made up her mind.","She didn’t care what place the team got, but she needed to be the best student.","She said, “I suggest you guys go back first.”","Ling Hao spoke before Shao Xiao could say anything. “Feng Wu, are you afraid? Do you want to retreat?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “No, I don’t.”","“Then what do you mean?”","Feng Wu met his eyes. “Do you want the truth?”","Ling Hao said, “Spare me the crap! I don’t have time for this! Tell me the truth!”","Feng Wu said, “The truth can be harsh.”","Ling Hao patted his chest and said proudly, “I’m a tough man. I can take it!”","Feng Wu nodded, looked around, and casually said, “You’re too weak.”","Ling Hao coughed.","That was some harsh truth.","Not only Ling Hao, but Shao Xiao and the others also flushed in embarrassment.","Feeling resentful, Cheng Fang snapped at Feng Wu, “Just because you saved us doesn’t give you the right to say such arrogant things!”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I’m only stating a fact.”","Cheng Fang was mortified by that statement. Taking a deep breath, he said, “Are you saying you’re so much better than us? What level are you, then?”","The others looked at Feng Wu, also curious about her cultivation level.","Feng Wu smiled. “I could fight a dozen Magic Vine Beasts with my bare hands.”","The harsh truth once more.","“And I was far from reaching my limit,” Feng Wu added.","That was brutal.","Cheng Fang wanted to retort, but he couldn’t deny that Feng Wu was telling the truth.","He hated to admit it, but Feng Wu had indeed had twelve Magic Vine Beasts under her control. That was far more impressive than killing them.","“You...”","Wang Zhi calmed down and asked Feng Wu, “What’s your plan?”","Feng Wu looked back at him. “What do you think my plan is?”","Being the most intelligent team member, Wang Zhi realized something. “Do you want to get first place? You want the top prize, don’t you?”","“You must be out of your mind!”","Cheng Fang shouted at Feng Wu before she could say anything. “There’s no way you can get that prize! It’s been determined beforehand!”","Whoosh!","All eyes were on Cheng Fang. What was that supposed to mean?"]},{"number":2668,"title":"Chapter 2668 - Dynasty Team","paragraphs":["Realizing that he had said the wrong thing, Cheng Fang looked away and pretended that he didn’t know anything.","“Cheng Fang, do you know something we don’t?” Shao Xiao stared at him.","Cheng Fang wouldn’t answer the question.","Wang Zhi frowned a little. “I recall that your brother is in Class A, and he’s a member of the seeded team.”","Cheng Fang shook his head. “I don’t know anything about that. Please stop asking me. I can’t tell you anything.”","It only confirmed that what he had said was true. His teammates didn’t like the sound of that at all.","Shao Xiao frowned. “As far as I know, the leader of the seeded team is Chen Ziyun, the president of the Martial Arts Society. Has he already chosen a candidate?”","“Is it Shan Jingfei?” Wang Zhi looked at Cheng Fang.","Cheng Fang said coldly, “Don’t ask me. I can’t tell you anything.”","The others took his answer for a “yes.”","“Is Chen Ziyun in love with Shan Jingfei?” Ling Hao asked curiously.","Wang Zhi shook his head. “Chen Ziyun isn’t that type of person. Qiu Zeyu is more likely to do something like that.”","Ling Hao asked, “Qiu Zeyu? As in the second-best student in the seeded team?”","Wang Zhi said, “I saw Qiu Zeyu taking walks with Shan Jingfei before.”","Shao Xiao glanced at Wang Zhi.","Wang Zhi was a discreet person. He wouldn’t have said something like that if those two people had really just been walking together. He must have seen something else.","Wang Zhi nodded when he saw the look in Shao Xiao’s eyes.","Shao Xiao shrugged. He had probably guessed correctly.","“Forget about first place, then,” Shao Xiao told Feng Wu. “Let’s go back.”","Feng Wu said, “You guys go ahead.”","Shao Xiao said sincerely, “Feng Wu, you have to accept the fact that we can’t get first place.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Shao Xiao lowered his voice. “That spot has probably been determined in advance. You can’t win, no matter how hard you try.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Is it because of that Qiu Zeyu you mentioned just then?”","There was silence.","Feng Wu was still smiling. “He won’t be a problem.”","Huo Shan agreed.","Qiu Zeyu was nothing! Feng Wu’s backer was a much more influential person!","However, Shao Xiao and the others didn’t know what Huo Shan knew, so they only found Feng Wu stubborn.","“Feng Wu, you probably don’t know what it means to be a member of the seeded team.” Shao Xiao tried to explain to her. “We’re only in Class B, so the team is normally beyond our reach. You’ve only just joined us. Understandably, you don’t know what an intricate matter this is.","“Here’s the thing: Members of the seeded team are the most capable students in the entire academy.","“‘Seeded team’ isn’t its official name.","“It’s called ‘Dynasty Team’.”","Feng Wu was surprised. “Dynasty Team? Are they actually allowed to use that name?”","Shao Xiao smiled bitterly. “If you know who the team’s founder is, you’ll understand where that name came from.","“The person who founded the first Dynasty Team was His Royal Highness,” said Shao Xiao. “I think you know who that is.”","Many years had passed since the engagement between Feng Wu and the crown prince was said to have been annulled. Most people had forgotten about it."]},{"number":2669,"title":"Chapter 2669 - Never Give Up","paragraphs":["However, Zuo Qingluan had deliberately brought it up again, and many people remembered the incident once more.","Shao Xiao and the others gave Feng Wu sympathetic looks.","Huo Shan was so angry that he wanted to jump to his feet.","What the hell?!","Feng Wu was still engaged to the crown prince, and the crown prince had ordered Chen Ziyun to keep her safe! Shao Xiao and his teammates knew nothing!","Shao Xiao didn’t notice Huo Shan’s frustration, and he went on with his explanation.","“Dynasty Team consists of ten members, five of whom are official members and five who are back-up members.","“The last Dynasty Team was incredible. Because both His Royal Highness and Young Lord Feng were members of the team, no one else dared to put up a fight. As a result, Imperial College became the best school in the empire.","“However, the team’s strength has been on the decline ever since the old members graduated.","“Of course, that’s only in comparison with its heyday. Imperial College is still better than other schools.","“A member of the team was severely wounded in Peace Grassland and almost died. Because of that, there’s currently an open slot in the team. To ensure that the right person is chosen for the team, the school is recruiting two students.","“Although the candidates will become back-up members, many people of Class A are competing for that opportunity.","“Class B ordinarily wouldn’t have the opportunity. If I’m guessing correctly, Qiu Zeyu must have requested that quota for Shan Jingfei. He must have pulled a lot of strings.”","He looked Feng Wu in the eye. “Why don’t we give up on that quota?”","The other team members looked at Feng Wu as well.","It was supposed to be Shan Jingfei’s big moment, and Feng Wu should know when to quit.","However —","Feng Wu smiled. “Giving up has never been an option for me.”","“What? Are you going to stay in the game?!” Ling Hao couldn’t believe his ears.","She might look like a fragile and tender girl, but she was more formidable than anyone could imagine.","She was almost glowing when she said she refused to give up. It was unbelievably attractive.","She told the others, “You guys can go back first. Just don’t hand in the task yet.”","She walked away after that.","Meanwhile —","Ye Han thought Shao Xiao would stop her when she walked away.","After all, she used to be the center of the team, and the members doted on her.","However!","No one said anything even after she dawdled and walked as slowly as she could.","She was furious.","She resented Shao Xiao and the others for not helping her, but most of her hatred was directed toward Feng Wu.","It was all because of Feng Wu!","Feng Wu had replaced her!","Feng Wu had stolen the spotlight!","Feng Wu had taken everything!","She hated Feng Wu so much!","“Ye Han?” Seeing that Ye Han was in a bad mood, Duanmu Huo tried to comfort her.","“Don’t talk to me!” Ye Han gave him a dirty look before walking away.","“Ye Han, where are you going?” Duanmu Huo called after her.","Ye Han shouted, “Leave me alone!”","She quickly marched away.","Her actions hurt Duanmu Huo’s feelings."]},{"number":2670,"title":"Chapter 2670 - Shan Jingfei’s Team","paragraphs":["“Duanmu!” Xu Siyu, one of the team members, stomped her foot. “She doesn’t even like you! All she does is order you around, and you’re still all over her!”","Grinding his teeth, Duanmu Huo still wanted to chase after Ye Han.","Xu Siyu said, “She’s obviously using you to make Shao Xiao’s team jealous. When she couldn’t do that, she found you a burden and abandoned you. Yet here you are, still trying to get her back.”","“Shut up!” Duanmu Huo bellowed at Xu Siyu.","Xu Siyu lost her temper. “I know you’re angry, but I’m still going to say it!","“As outsiders, we can see that Feng Wu is the reasonable one, while Ye Han keeps making outrageous requests! She’s not trustworthy!”","Duanmu Huo looked like someone had stepped on his foot. “Shut up!”","Xu Siyu smirked. “Shut up? Why do you think you can talk to me in that way? Because you’re our team leader?","“Duanmu Huo, you’re the team leader, but you don’t own the position!","“You don’t get to order us around! We’re not courting your crush for you!","“You’re only a team leader when we think you’re a good fit for the job. Otherwise, you’re nothing!”","Duanmu Huo said, “You!”","Xu Siyu stared at Duanmu Huo and wouldn’t be intimidated.","She used to be an obedient team member and had never opposed him like this before.","Duanmu Huo looked at the two other team members for recognition.","However, they were also looking at him in anger and disappointment.","Anger and disappointment...","Duanmu Huo went pale as if he had been struck by lightning. He thought, “What am I doing? These are my closest friends!”","Meanwhile!","Ye Han was sure that Duanmu Huo would try to persuade her to go back.","However...","After a while, she realized that Duanmu Huo wasn’t coming after her.","Ye Han thought she was going to lose her mind.","What was the matter with this world?","Had she been abandoned by everyone?","Feng Wu!!!","Ye Han blamed Feng Wu for everything that had happened to her.","She believed that if it hadn’t been for Feng Wu, she would never have ended up like this. She wanted revenge.","But how? Could any student in Class B defeat Feng Wu?","Ye Han calmed down and started thinking.","Driven by her hatred for Feng Wu, Ye Han actually came up with a feasible plan.","Shan Jingfei!","Ye Han smacked a tree.","Shan Jingfei was the top student of Class B. Ye Han was confident that Shan Jingfei disliked Feng Wu.","Her eyes glinted.","She remembered the direction Shan Jingfei had left in, so she quickened her pace.","It seemed luck was on her side. She actually ran into Shan Jingfei’s team.","Gu Xingyuan, Xin Zhixuan and two other members were on Shan Jingfei’s team.","When she saw Shan Jingfei, Ye Han feigned an exhausted state and wailed.","She fell to the ground and started rolling down the slope.","Shan Jingfei’s team soon spotted her.","Their team was called Jingjing Team.","“Jingfei, I think I heard something.” Xin Zhixuan stuck out her head and saw a person rolling down the slope."]},{"number":2671,"title":"Chapter 2671 - Enemy’s Enemy","paragraphs":["“Don’t be distracted. Focus. We need to kill this magical beast first,” Shan Jingfei said coldly.","Other people saw Shan Jingfei as some innocent and kind girl, but Xin Zhixuan knew better. Shan Jingfei was anything but that. She was cold and unsympathetic.","“It sounds like Ye Han, doesn’t it?” Xin Zhixuan was going to ignore the noise until she saw who the person was.","Just like Ye Han, Xin Zhixuan didn’t like Feng Wu either.","She spotted an opportunity when Ye Han showed up.","“I’ll be right back!”","Xin Zhixuan dashed off before Shan Jingfei could say anything.","She came back with Ye Han a few minutes later.","“Ye Han?” By then, Shan Jingfei had killed the magical beast and was collecting the crystal core. Her first thought when she saw Ye Han was how sorry the latter looked.","Ye Han’s hair was unkempt and her disheveled clothes were covered with grass and dirt. She looked more wretched than a beggar.","Was that really Ye Han?","Because Ye Han used to be the only girl on her team, Shao Xiao and the others had protected her well.","Being the second most popular girl in class, Ye Han had always been proud of herself. She looked nothing like her old self now.","“Ye Han, what happened? Where’s your team? Why aren’t Shao Xiao and the others with you?” Xin Zhixuan asked, feigning a concerned tone.","The old Ye Han would never have shown her weak side to Shan Jingfei, but now, she couldn’t care about anything else.","She burst into tears when she heard the question.","“Are you badly hurt? Where are your teammates?” Xin Zhixuan pretended to actually care about Ye Han.","Ye Han cried even harder. “They don’t care about me anymore... Feng Wu is their new pet, and they’ll do whatever she says. I don’t have a place in that team anymore!”","Feng Wu?!","Xin Zhixuan and Shan Jingfei didn’t pay much attention to Ye Han until she mentioned that name.","Gu Xingyuan also observed Ye Han.","Shan Jingfei gave Xin Zhixuan a warning look, and the latter nodded.","Xin Zhixuan asked Ye Han as she treated her wounds, “Did Feng Wu chase you away? She seems nice. I can’t believe she would do such a thing!”","Ye Han thought, “What a lousy actor.”","She could tell that both Xin Zhixuan and Shan Jingfei disliked Feng Wu. With that in mind, she thought she could work with these people.","Ye Han was also pretending. “Feng Wu is just so pretty, of course all the boys like her! Shao Xiao used to be in love with Shan Jingfei, but he likes Feng Wu now!”","Shan Jingfei’s face darkened.","She didn’t have feelings for Shao Xiao, but the change in his attitude was a blow to her personal pride!","Seeing Shan Jingfei’s livid face, Ye Han was secretly delighted, but she still had to keep up her aggrieved expression, and she went on complaining.","“It’s not just Shao Xiao! Ling Hao, Wang Zhi and Cheng Fang are all the same! They’re all over Feng Wu as if she’s some kind of princess!”"]},{"number":2672,"title":"Chapter 2672 - Reputation","paragraphs":["Ye Han said, “Guess what? Feng Wu accepted all their kindness toward her! She’s so... so...”","Xin Zhixuan said, “So promiscuous?”","“Yes!” Ye Han started trashing Feng Wu’s reputation.","She knew how vital reputation was to a young woman. Once that was destroyed, the woman would have nothing left.","Other people would have scolded Ye Han for what she was doing.","However, nearly everyone here was Feng Wu’s enemy and couldn’t wait to see her in distress. As a result, no one spoke up for Feng Wu, and they all gloated at her predicament.","Seeing that no one objected, Ye Han went on.","After saying a few more bad things about Feng Wu, she felt it was time to move on to the next subject. “It’s not that I don’t want to fight her, but she’s too powerful.”","“How’s that possible?” Xin Zhixuan asked incredulously. “She’s a new student, and you’ve been in Class B for a while. How can she be more capable?”","Ye Han smiled bitterly. “Feng Wu took out twelve magical beasts all at once.”","Xin Zhixuan said indifferently, “All the students in our class can handle twelve junior Class B magical beasts at the same time.”","“No, they weren’t junior ones,” Ye Han said bitterly. “They were all advanced magical beasts.”","“No way!” Xin Zhixuan couldn’t believe her ears.","Ye Han wasn’t telling the truth – they were actually peak-level Class B magical beasts.","She feared that if she told the truth, Shan Jingfei wouldn’t dare fight Feng Wu anymore.","Ye Han nodded. “They’ve collected at least a dozen crystal cores from advanced Class B magical beasts. How many do you have?”","“Is that true?!” Xin Zhixuan stared at her.","Ye Han smirked. “I was with them just then and saw it with my own eyes.","“Ask Duanmu Huo if you don’t believe me. They saw it, too.”","Shan Jingfei’s face darkened.","Xin Zhixuan also gave Shan Jingfei a knowing look because she was aware of the inside information.","It had been determined in advance that Shan Jingfei would come out first in this hunt.","Qiu Zeyu had said so himself.","If Feng Wu came in first, Qiu Zeyu’s effort would be wasted.","“I don’t believe you.” Xin Zhixuan glanced at Ye Han. “I’ll ask the others.”","She then walked off.","She came back an hour later.","Shan Jingfei gave her a searching look.","Xin Zhixuan nodded solemnly.","Shan Jingfei’s face went livid.","So, Ye Han was telling the truth.","Shan Jingfei felt conflicted.","She should have anticipated it because Feng Wu had defeated her in front of all the tutors.","After that, she knew she wasn’t Feng Wu’s match, but she had been trying to keep that information from everyone else.","Xin Zhixuan said tentatively, “I think Feng Wu does have some talent. We may not be her match if we’re on our own...”","Shan Jingfei nodded. “I see.”","She walked into the woods after that.","Xin Zhixuan grew suspicious.","That wasn’t right.","Shan Jingfei was too calm.","She should have been astonished when she learned how capable Feng Wu really was."]},{"number":2673,"title":"Chapter 2673 - Deception","paragraphs":["However, Shan Jingfei had calmly accepted the truth and walked away.","That could only mean one thing.","She already knew that Feng Wu was better than she was!","But when?","When had she started acting strange?","When Xin Zhixuan searched her memory, she realized in surprise that Shan Jingfei’s behavior changed after Mr. Yang summoned her the day before Feng Wu came to Class B.","How did Feng Wu get into Class B? She had to have defeated some existing members of the class...","OMG!","Xin Zhixuan suddenly had a shocking realization","Could that person have been Shan Jingfei?","It was hard to believe, but it was also the only possibility!","Xin Zhixuan almost couldn’t contain her excitement in the short period that Shan Jingfei was away.","If that was the case...","She pretended she knew nothing when I mocked Feng Wu. She made me look like a clown!","Xin Zhixuan was furious.","But she soon fought back her rage and looked as calm as she could manage.","Shan Jingfei came back a few minutes later.","She was smiling, light on her feet, and in a good mood.","Xin Zhixuan asked, “Feifei, do you think it’s possible that Feng Wu is more capable than you are?”","Shan Jingfei smiled. “So what if she is? I’m not afraid of her.”","Was she admitting that Feng Wu was better than she was?","Xin Zhixuan didn’t want to give up yet. “Feifei, did Feng Wu get into Class B after she challenged you?”","She was trembling inwardly when she asked that question.","Shan Jingfei’s face darkened, and she scolded Xin Zhixuan. “Don’t ask about things you don’t understand!”","Xin Zhixuan was disappointed.","She knew Shan Jingfei well enough to see that the girl would have denied it already if it wasn’t true.","Xin Zhixuan was angry from the embarrassment.","She felt like a clown and flushed.","Being as self-centered as always, Shan Jingfei didn’t detect the change in her friend’s mood.","She was still immersed in complacency. “Don’t worry. I’ll definitely be first this time.”","Ye Han’s eyes lit up. “Can you change the data in the system?”","Shan Jingfei rolled her eyes at Ye Han. “If I could do that, do you think I would still be here?”","Of course, she wouldn’t. Ye Han was disappointed.","Shan Jingfei smirked. “Qiu Zeyu will give me a hand.”","“Is he coming here to help us?” Xin Zhixuan knew that Shan Jingfei talked to Qiu Zeyu via a communication device.","The range of that device was limited to school grounds.","Thousand Nights Forest was within that range.","“He’s too busy to come out here, but he’ll send someone.” Shan Jingfei added, “They’re students of Class A.”","Ye Han looked at her in amazement. “Students? More than one?”","“Of course!” Shan Jingfei said proudly. “A Class A team is on a mission nearby, so Zeyu asked them to give me a hand.”","“Qiu Zeyu cares so much about you!” Ye Han said."]},{"number":2674,"title":"Chapter 2674 - Old Acquaintance","paragraphs":["“Qiu Zeyu cares so much about you!” Ye Han said.","Shan Jingfei smiled and took it for granted.","However, she didn’t see the look on Xin Zhixuan’s face.","Xin Zhixuan lowered her head to hide the complicated feelings in her eyes.","Soon, a five-member team showed up.","“Hello, I’m Xue Hao, the team leader of Xuecheng Team.” Xue Hao greeted Shan Jingfei with a smile.","They would have gone back to school after they ran into the berserk lion, but thanks to Feng Wu’s excellent medical skills, they were all in good shape now.","Therefore, they accepted Qiu Zeyu’s request when he gave them the mission via the communication device.","Helping Shan Jingfei kill some magical beasts would be a piece of cake for the Class A students.","Shan Jingfei was pleased to see them, and gave Ye Han an arrogant look.","Ye Han had to stay humble around Shan Jingfei, so she fawned on the girl and showered her with praise.","Shan Jingfei was delighted, but she tried to look modest.","She then struck up a conversation with Xue Hao.","The task for Xuecheng Team was straightforward. They were to help Shan Jingfei kill 24 peak-level Class B magical beasts.","All Class A students could do that easily enough.","“I know a place where we can find peak-level Class B magical beasts, and there’s a whole pack of them,” Shan Jingfei told Xue Hao. “They’re Purple Rats. They’re small but fast, and they can move underground. They’ll be hard to catch.”","Xue Hao wanted to finish this mission as soon as possible and go back to look for the girl in the red dress, so he nodded without hesitation.","“Purple Rats are junior Class A magical beasts. We hunt them all the time. Let’s go.” Xue Hao led his team in the direction of the rats.","At that exact moment —","Feng Wu was talking to her teammates.","“You guys can go back now. I’ll hunt some more magical beasts here and get back before the hunt ends. We’ll submit the task together.”","She knew she had to get first place.","Shao Xiao gave her a sympathetic look and was amazed by how stubborn she was.","“Let’s vote, then,” said Shao Xiao. “Put up your hand if you want to stay here with Feng Wu.”","Whoosh!","Huo Shan was the first to raise his hand.","The second was Ling Hao.","“Ling Hao, are you sure?” Cheng Fang stared at him. “Do you know where you’re going? You may be headed for the advanced Class B region or even the Class A zone. Are you sure you can do it?”","Ling Hao chuckled. “If it wasn’t for Feng Wu, I would already be dead. I owe her my life.”","Ling Hao asked Cheng Fang, “What about you?”","Cheng Fang frowned. “I’m in bad shape. I need to go back and take some time to recover.”","Ling Hao understood.","Cheng Fang had always liked Ye Han, but Ye Han had been forced to leave this team. It was understandable that he felt conflicted about Feng Wu.","In the end, Wang Zhi and Shao Xiao decided to leave.","The six members were divided into two groups.","They went their separate ways after they bid each other farewell, unaware of what was going to happen next."]},{"number":2675,"title":"Chapter 2675 - Encounter","paragraphs":["To their surprise, the ground started shaking when they were about to leave.","They all lost their footing.","What was going on? Everyone was shocked.","The ground cracked open before they realized it.","“Fall back!”","Shao Xiao shouted.","He quickly jumped to one side.","The others followed suit.","However, the ground was opening up too fast.","The cracks were opening up in all directions.","“Run! Now!” Everyone panicked and shouted.","But they weren’t quick enough.","Human strength seemed so petty in comparison to the force of Nature.","“Ah!”","Cheng Fang screamed.","He had been poisoned twice, so he was the weakest and slowest member of the team.","As a result, he was the first to fall into the crevice when the ground opened up.","“Cheng Fang!”","The other members of the team went pale and tried to grab him.","But they were too late.","They could hear Cheng Fang’s scream as he fell.","They didn’t have time to weep because they weren’t out of danger either.","Not even close.","More and more cracks were opening up.","They weren’t fast enough to outrun them all.","Before long, another disaster took place.","“Help me!” Ling Hao shouted.","A vine appeared in Feng Wu’s hand when Ling Hao fell.","It immediately stretched out, wrapped around Ling Hao’s wrist, and pulled him back up in a whoosh.","Ling Hao was ghastly pale.","Still in shock, he said to Feng Wu, “Feng Wu, thank you...”","However, he heard another scream before he could finish.","Turning around, he saw Wang Zhi.","He panicked.","Wang Zhi was falling!","In a split second, another vine wrapped around Wang Zhi’s waist.","Ling Hao let out a breath of relief.","But he wasn’t relieved for too long because it was Shao Xiao’s turn.","He began to fall.","Ling Hao thought he was going to lose his mind.","Feng Wu wasn’t a Spiritual King. She was already helping two people. There was no way that she could help a third one.","He was sure that his team leader was going to die.","Wang Zhi felt the same.","To their surprise, Feng Wu produced a third vine.","It wrapped around Shao Xiao’s right ankle and pulled him back.","The three boys let out breaths of relief and stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","How capable was she that she could stop all three of them from falling at the same time in a critical moment like this?","They had always assumed that Feng Wu was only slightly better than they were. It was only now that they realized the disparity in their capabilities.","“Feng Wu...” Shao Xiao tried to say something.","Feng Wu finally brought the three of them to a safer zone, where they stood on solid ground once more.","However..."]},{"number":2676,"title":"Chapter 2676 - Falling","paragraphs":["Just then.","The cracks had stopped expanding earlier, but the ground started to crack again!","This time, they were expanding faster than before.","Everyone was falling before they knew it.","“Ah!!!”","They all screamed.","Feng Wu and her teammates were all falling.","Feng Wu could hear the wind whooshing in her ears.","Ling Hao and the others panicked, but Feng Wu was as calm as ever.","She had always been this way. The greater the danger, the more composed she was.","She narrowed her eyes when they were about to hit the bottom.","She knew that the final part was the most important.","All their lives were on the line.","“We’re going to die!”","Ling Hao shouted.","The fear of death had overwhelmed them.","Feng Wu was the youngest, but she was incredibly calm.","She shouted, “Shut up, all of you!”","Shut up?","How?","It was human instinct to scream when they were scared.","Feng Wu had never sounded so severe. “Everyone, get ready to land!”","Land?","Where?","How were they supposed to get ready for that?","Each person was as baffled as the next.","They involuntarily tried to believe her and do as she said, but they didn’t know how to get ready.","Feng Wu stared at them. “Bring your knees up, curl your arms around them, and bury your head in your lap. The fetus position.”","Obviously, the others didn’t know what the fetus position was.","But they understood the first part.","They held their knees together and ducked their heads before they realized what they were doing.","Feng Wu shouted, “I’m going to count down from three. At one, I want everyone to roll forward!","“Listen carefully! If you don’t follow instructions and make the wrong move, you’ll get everyone killed!”","The others gritted their teeth nervously. None of them wanted to become a burden.","“3!","“2!","“1! Roll!”","At one, Feng Wu focused all her energy on the vines.","She whipped the vines in the air, counteracting the momentum of the fall.","Thump!?","All four people landed.","Just as Feng Wu had instructed, they quickly rolled forward when they touched the ground.","They kept rolling until they no longer felt the momentum.","Shao Xiao was the first to stop.","He smacked into a rock, which made him see stars, and it felt like his bones had shattered.","It was so painful that he was almost in tears.","Luckily, his head had been protected. Despite the loud noise, all his wounds were superficial.","Luckily, he stopped rolling.","He lay flat on his back and heaved a sigh of relief.","He survived.","His teammates were luckier than he was because they slowly rolled to a stop.","Ling Hao was panting as his heart pounded.","That had been a terrifying fall.","“We must have fallen at least 1,000 meters!” Ling Hao stuttered."]},{"number":2677,"title":"Chapter 2677 - Incident","paragraphs":["“1,000 meters? It felt like tens of thousands of meters, at least.”","Shao Xiao scrambled toward his friends when he finally could breathe again.","“Is everyone alright? Anyone hurt?” Shao Xiao was worried.","Ling Hao said, “I’m still alive.”","Wang Zhi said, “I hurt my leg, but I’ll live.”","“Feng Wu, where’s Feng Wu?” Shao Xiao shouted.","Everyone started looking around nervously.","Feng Wu was the only reason they were still alive, and they hoped nothing had happened to her.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. I’m fine.”","She then looked up.","They had fallen thousands of meters into this place.","They were at the bottom of a deep pit, and the nearest ledge was a few hundred meters above them. They didn’t know what was happening on the surface.","“Can you walk?” Feng Wu glanced at them.","Ling Hao pointed at his belly in frustration.","A branch had pierced his abdomen when he fell.","Shao Xiao walked over and cried out when he saw Ling Hao’s injury.","“Ling Hao! How do you feel? You’re so badly wounded! Why didn’t you say anything earlier?!”","Ling Hao smiled bitterly. “I already consider myself lucky to have survived that fall. This wound is nothing.”","Shao Xiao said, “Your belly has been pierced! You’ll die without proper treatment!”","Ling Hao struggled, trying to stand up. “It’s not that serious. Ye Han is our only physician, but she’s not here. No one can treat me now. Let’s find a way out of here first. I can tolerate the pain.”","Feng Wu crouched down and studied the wound before he could stand up.","“Shao Xiao is right. Your wound is very severe. If we don’t remove that branch, you’ll die from an infection, if the blood loss doesn’t kill you first.”","Ling Hao was usually a dauntless man, but what Feng Wu said made him break into a cold sweat.","“But we don’t have a medicine refiner here. What am I going to do? I’m going to die, aren’t I?” Ling Hao’s voice trembled.","Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder, before she told Shao Xiao, “Hold him down. Don’t let him move around.”","Shao Xiao didn’t know what Feng Wu wanted to do, but she had saved them a few times already, so he saw her as their last hope.","He would do whatever Feng Wu told him to do.","He quickly walked up to Ling Hao’s side and held him down.","“What are you doing?” Ling Hao stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Feng Wu grabbed the branch with her right hand.","Ling Hao panicked. “Feng Wu, you’re not a medicine refiner. What are you doing? Are you going to pull the branch out?”","Feng Wu measured the branch and did some calculations in her head.","She didn’t look at Ling Hao when she said, “You’re right, but you don’t get a prize.”","“Oh my god!” Ling Hao and Shao Xiao both stared at Feng Wu.","“You’re not a medicine refiner!”"]},{"number":2678,"title":"Chapter 2678 - I’m a Medicine Refiner","paragraphs":["Feng Wu stared at the two boys in resignation.","“If I’m not one, who do you think is?” she asked impatiently.","Ling Hao said, “How can you be a medicine refiner?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. “Why can’t I be one? Haven’t I saved you many times already?”","Shao Xiao said, “Yes, but with pills. You can buy those from the shops.”","Feng Wu said, “I’ve never bought any medicine in my life.”","While Feng Wu distracted Ling Hao with the small talk, she grabbed the branch and pulled.","Whoosh!","The branch was pulled out, and blood gushed out.","“Ah!” Ling Hao screamed. “I’m going to die! I’m going to die...”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him, and dots of green light flew out of her fingertips.","The green dots were natural essence.","It was well-known that someone had to be at least a Supreme-level medicine refiner to activate such essence. It could treat any disease and injury.","Everyone was astonished when they saw the natural essence dancing in the air.","“Oh my god. Feng Wu, you...”","Shao Xiao was so astonished that he forgot to blink.","It was astonishing. He couldn’t believe what he was seeing.","The green light flew into Ling Hao’s wound.","The wound started healing.","Shao Xiao didn’t want to believe it at first, but he had no other choice.","There wasn’t anything wrong with his eyes. This was happening.","Feng Wu really was...","“A Supreme-level medicine refiner? Feng Wu, don’t tell me you’re a Supreme-level medicine refiner!”","Even Ling Hao found it hard to believe.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at Shao Xiao. “Don’t make a fuss about it. I’m just a Supreme-level medicine refiner.”","They made it sound like it was such an incredible thing!","Shao Xiao didn’t know what to say.","Supreme-level medicine refiners were supposed to be so rare and so precious in the empire!","Why did Feng Wu make it sound so ordinary?","Ling Hao’s wound healed quickly after Feng Wu used the natural essence on him, and a scab had formed on his abdomen already.","“Alright. You can get up now.” Feng Wu patted Ling Hao on the shoulder.","Ling Hao stared at her. “Alright? I’m alright? You’ve got to be kidding me!”","Feng Wu shrugged. “Can’t you tell if you’re alright or not? Just walk around.”","That was right. Ling Hao smacked his forehead and rose to his feet with Shao Xiao’s help.","His eyes lit up when he took the first step.","His belly didn’t hurt anymore.","He could walk!","Looking down, he saw that not only had the wound scabbed over, even the scab was beginning to fall off.","Holy crap...","Ling Hao had never been treated by a Supreme-level medicine refiner before, and it felt incredible.","“Feng Wu, you really are a Supreme-level medicine refiner!” It finally hit Ling Hao.","Feng Wu shrugged. “I guess.”","In fact, Feng Wu was better than that, and Ling Hao could have made an even bolder guess."]},{"number":2679,"title":"Chapter 2679 - Save Him","paragraphs":["Feng Wu turned to Wang Zhi after saving Ling Hao.","Wang Zhi was lying still on the ground, and she hurried to his side.","His right leg was covered in blood, and a bone was sticking out.","“Oh my god!” Ling Hao cried out. “Wang Zhi, you’ve endured so much pain! This is so bad, but you didn’t make a sound.”","Wang Zhi smiled bitterly. “It’s not like it would have made any difference.”","Feng Wu examined Wang Zhi as Ling Hao spoke to him.","The injury was a tricky one. It was his knee.","However, it wasn’t too tricky for a Supreme-level medicine refiner.","Feng Wu soon cured Wang Zhi.","Wang Zhi looked at the scab on his knee before he stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","He had been lying some distance away from the others and could only listen when they had shouted in surprise.","He had thought that Feng Wu couldn’t possibly be a Supreme-level medicine refiner.","However, he realized how terrifyingly capable Feng Wu was when she cured his leg.","Was she even human?","Feng Wu looked at them and asked, “Is everyone alright?”","“Yes!”","“We’re all fine!”","Everyone looked at Feng Wu in admiration.","All the doubts they had about her had disappeared.","They admired and even worshiped her from the bottom of their hearts.","“We’re still short one person!”","Shao Xiao finally remembered who was missing. “Cheng Fang! He was the first to fall! Where is he?”","Cheng Fang...","Everyone went silent for a split second.","Yes, Cheng Fang had been the first to fall. Because of that, Feng Wu hadn’t had time to protect him.","“He was close to us when he fell. Let’s look for him...”","Shao Xiao didn’t lose hope.","They climbed out and looked in all directions.","Soon, they heard Ling Hao shouting.","“Come here! It’s Cheng Fang!”","Everyone ran in his direction.","They spotted Cheng Fang when they were close enough.","Ling Hao was flustered. “I don’t think I can move him... Feng Wu, help him!”","Ling Hao looked around and gave Feng Wu a pleading look.","The other two boys were looking at her the same way.","Feng Wu had saved Cheng Fang twice today, but he was still on Ye Han’s side.","Ling Hao said, “Feng Wu, if you save him, I promise...”","Feng Wu waved him off.","She didn’t care about how Cheng Fang felt about her.","She would save whomever she wanted to save.","No one could persuade her otherwise if she didn’t want to do anything.","It was all up to her.","She then examined Cheng Fang.","He was severely injured.","He had fallen right into a crack.","However, he was fortunate. He had fallen onto a tree first, which significantly reduced the speed of his fall."]},{"number":2680,"title":"Chapter 2680 - Save Him Again","paragraphs":["If it wasn’t for his luck, Cheng Fang would have been turned into a pulp by the fall.","Feng Wu was surprised after she examined Cheng Fang.","“He’s not dead,” Feng Wu said coolly.","“He’s not? You can save him, can’t you? Please help him! Please!”","Ling Hao and the other two boys begged Feng Wu.","Ling Hao said, “We know Cheng Fang hasn’t been the most polite person, but that’s because he has a crush on Ye Han. I think he’ll come around after this.”","Feng Wu smiled wryly.","She had never cared about what Cheng Fang thought of her. Her only concern was that she was running out of natural essence.","She had used it twice, and it would take her some time to recharge once she used it up.","She said, “I can help him, but I may not have enough natural essence.","“Yes, I have enough to save him, but if any of you get injured before I can replenish it, I won’t be able to help you.”","Shao Xiao nodded solemnly. “I choose to save him.”","His teammates made the same choice.","Feng Wu glanced at Huo Shan.","Huo Shan said impatiently, “I don’t like him because he was mean to Boss Wu. However... Forget it. I won’t protest!”","Ling Hao patted his shoulder. “That’s my man!”","Feng Wu shrugged.","Since they had all chosen to save Cheng Fang over themselves, Feng Wu wouldn’t stop them.","She was a little touched by their friendship.","Cheng Fang was severely injured, but Feng Wu’s natural essence could work miracles.","The time she spent on Cheng Fang was longer than what she had spent on Ling Hao and Wang Zhi together. It took her a whole 15 minutes.","“Done.” She looked slightly pale when she rose to her feet again.","Wang Zhi felt a little guilty and asked Feng Wu, “Are you alright?”","Feng Wu waved at him. “I feel drained. You’re pretty much on your own for the next 24 hours.”","The others all nodded, feeling guilty for what had happened.","Cheng Fang suddenly opened his eyes.","Everything was blurry at first, but his vision soon recovered.","He saw Shao Xiao, Wang Zhi and Feng Wu.","“Cheng Fang is awake!” Ling Hao cried out, ran to Cheng Fang’s side and helped him sit up.","Cheng Fang breathed in, but the chest pain he anticipated never came.","He was perplexed. “Is this hell? Are we all dead?”","“Oh, shut up!” Ling Hao smacked his head. “No one’s dead! We’re all alive!”","“That hurts!” Cheng Fang shouted in pain.","That also woke him up.","He looked at his teammates and then at himself.","“Holy crap!” he shouted.","He vividly remembered the fall. He had fallen on a tree halfway down, and then went on falling...","He also remembered how severe his injuries were.","He had been covered in wounds and couldn’t even move a finger.","But now..."]},{"number":2681,"title":"Chapter 2681 - You Should Thank Feng Wu","paragraphs":["He felt utterly healthy now.","Although he still had wounds, they were nothing compared with his original state.","“What happened? Am I dreaming?” Cheng Fang stared at his friends in disbelief.","Ling Hao patted him on the shoulder. “You should thank Feng Wu.”","Cheng Fang still had complicated feelings about Feng Wu, so he frowned and asked reluctantly, “What are you talking about?”","Ling Hao smacked him on the head. “Do you know how severe your injuries were?! You were lying there and covered in blood! Your breathing was so weak that we thought you could die at any moment.”","Cheng Fang said, “I know that. I hit a lot of things when I was falling. I thought I was already dead...”","Ling Hao said, “You would have been, if Feng Wu hadn’t treated you.”","Seeing that Cheng Fang wasn’t convinced, Shao Xiao chimed in.","“Ling Hao is right. You were barely breathing when we found you, and we could have lost you.” He then pointed at Feng Wu, who was cultivating on the other side.","“Thanks to Feng Wu, who didn’t mind your attitude toward her, she exhausted herself trying to save you. You owe her your life.”","Feng Wu had saved Cheng Fang three times already in total.","Cheng Fang was dumbfounded.","“She was exhausted? But how? She just needed to feed me some pills...”","“Oh, shut up!” Ling Hao smacked him on the head again. “You’re an idiot!”","Cheng Fang was confused. Why did Ling Hao say that? He had seen it with his own eyes...","Shao Xiao snapped at Cheng Fang, “Your information needs to be updated. Do you really think Feng Wu only hands out pills?”","Cheng Fang asked, “Isn’t that the case? Ye Han is the...”","Shao Xiao and the others looked at one another in frustration.","“Ye Han is what?” Ling Hao said sarcastically. “Are you trying to say that Ye Han is the Master-level medicine refiner?”","Cheng Fang stared at the others.","Wasn’t that obvious? Why did they have strange looks on their faces?","Ling Hao shook his head. “Yes, Ye Han is a Master-level medicine refiner, but you shouldn’t brag about her in front of a Supreme-level medicine refiner. It only makes you sound foolish.”","Cheng Fang was dumbfounded. “A Supreme-level medicine refiner? Do we have one here?”","Ling Hao crossed his hands behind his back and raised his chin. “Of course we do.”","Cheng Fang laughed. “You’re not talking about yourself, are you?”","Ling Hao glanced at him.","Cheng Fang stopped laughing. “There really is one?”","Ling Hao said, “Would you be alive otherwise?”","Cheng Fang’s stomach lurched.","Although he hated to admit it, something seemed to have happened to him.","He asked tentatively, “Surely you don’t mean Feng Wu...”","Ling Hao grinned.","Cheng Fang looked over his shoulder at Feng Wu and was astonished."]},{"number":2682,"title":"Chapter 2682 - Secret Essence Mine","paragraphs":["“No, I don’t believe you! I won’t!” Cheng Fang shook his head in disbelief.","All his teammates gave him indescribable looks.","Cheng Fang was astonished. “You...”","“Man, just accept it.” Ling Hao smiled bitterly. “We’ve all been there. Feng Wu saved Wang Zhi and me as well. We all owe her our lives.”","Cheng Fang said, “So, it’s true...”","He was still in a state of shock.","Ling Hao said, “We all saw it with our own eyes. Do you think we’re all lying?”","Cheng Fang didn’t know what to say.","He blushed and glanced at Feng Wu.","A Supreme-level medicine refiner... She was so young but she was already a Supreme-level medicine refiner.","“She’s just a new student and only joined us a few days ago!” Cheng Fang sighed as he looked at Feng Wu, who was cultivating with her eyes closed.","His friends felt the same way.","She was so young but had already achieved so much. It was as if they didn’t belong to the same world.","“But I guess God is fair. Since she’s a genius medicine refiner, she can’t be an advanced cultivator at the same time,” said Cheng Fang.","Otherwise, no one else would have a chance.","Ling Hao asked, “Are you sure about that?”","Cheng Fang looked at him in confusion. What was he missing?","Ling Hao patted Cheng Fang on the shoulder. “I wouldn’t be so sure.”","Of course Feng Wu was a talented cultivator.","It had only been days since she joined the War Academy, but she had risen directly from Class E to Class B. As for her ranking...","Other things aside, if she could save all three of them with the vines at a critical moment, it was clear enough that she was more capable than Shan Jingfei.","She was definitely the best student in Class B now.","“Why are you all looking at me like that?” Cheng Fang was dumbfounded.","He felt that he had missed so many things.","Ling Hao patted him on the head. “Observe, and stop talking. You’ll see.”","Cheng Fang didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu opened her eyes at that moment.","Shao Xiao asked excitedly, “Feng Wu, have you recovered? Are you alright? Do you need a few more minutes?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I’m fine. Let’s go.”","Thanks to her treatment, everyone was in reasonably good shape. Without her, they would be too wounded or crippled to walk.","Before long, they reached a giant building.","In fact, it was more like an underground cave.","It was an enormous, magnificent cave.","To be more precise, they were in the belly of a mountain that had been cut open.","“Look, there’s something written on the wall!” Ling Hao shouted.","The others moved closer and saw something at the entrance of the cave. It read: “Secret Essence Mine.”","“Oh my god, it’s the legendary Secret Essence Mine!” Shao Xiao cried out.","Everyone turned to him in unison. “Do you know about it?”","Shao Xiao nodded."]},{"number":2683,"title":"Chapter 2683 - A Swordsman in White","paragraphs":["He knew?","“What is this place?” Ling Hao asked the question everyone wanted to ask.","Shao Xiao hesitated.","Ling Hao said, “Captain, we don’t have any other choice. If we want to get out, we’ll have to go into this mountain. If you know something, and if you’re at liberty to reveal it, could you please tell us?”","Shao Xiao nodded. “It’s not a secret. I read about this mine in a school magazine. It’s supposed to have existed for as long as the school has.","“Lu Mingzong, the founder and first principal of Imperial College, mined spiritual stones here and used them to set up the college.","“But because of geological changes and some other reasons, the Secret Essence Mine was buried underground, never to be found again.","“Who would have thought we would run into that mine here today?”","“Is it the Secret Essence Mine which shocked the entire continent?” Ling Hao asked curiously.","Shao Xiao nodded. “Yes, it shocked a lot of people. 100,000 tunnels were built to harvest the stones, and at least a million miners were buried in these mountains.”","He looked at his teammates. “The exit out of the mine is inside the mountain.”","That was to say, they could never get out if they didn’t go inside.","What a bummer.","“Do you feel cold?” someone asked.","It was Cheng Fang, the weakest of them all.","“Cold? How can it be cold? We’re students of Class B; we should be used to the cold weather... Achoo!” Ling Hao sneezed before he could finish.","His cheeks flushed from the cold, and he couldn’t stop sneezing.","“What’s happening? Why is it so cold all of a sudden?!”","Someone shouted at that moment.","“Look!”","Everyone looked up at the sky.","They saw two people in the air.","One was a woman in a purple dress.","Her hair was so long that it touched the ground. She had a flawless complexion, but her lips were bright red, and her eyebrows were tiny dots.","Feng Wu saw her face in the distance.","Something about that woman’s appearance made her uneasy.","The other one was a swordsman in a white robe.","He was in his early twenties and carried a long sword on his back. His robe flapped in the wind, giving him an ethereal look.","Neither of them spoke, but Feng Wu could feel their terrifying energy.","It was so intimidating!","What were their cultivation levels?","They were at least Spiritual Kings!","The swordsman drew out his sword.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","Shit!","She felt that her life was under threat.","Feng Wu had always had good instincts.","Therefore!","“Run! Get into the mine! Now!”","She had never urged anyone like this before.","It was obvious that Feng Wu was now the leader of this team, so everyone rushed into the cave as soon as she gave the command.","The next second!"]},{"number":2684,"title":"Chapter 2684 - Who Is He? (1)","paragraphs":["The swordsman drew out his sword.","No one could describe that move.","They thought their eardrums were going to split open. They swayed and spat out mouthfuls of blood.","The ground opened up again.","This time, the cracks were even wider.","OMG!","Seeing this, they all realized what had happened earlier.","The ground hadn’t opened up for no reason.","There was a rumbling noise when they ran into the cave.","The swordsman struck.","It was such terrifying power!","No one could describe such power.","Everyone was injured.","They all spat out blood, Feng Wu included.","Countless big rocks fell down from above like a downpour.","“Go inside!”","Feng Wu activated her Magic Soul Vines.","The vines wrapped around the others and threw them into the mine.","The mine was protected by a formation, which had probably been set up by Lu Mingzong. It was able to stop all the falling rocks.","It made sense. Since the cave hadn’t collapsed after so many years, the formation was definitely working.","“How are you doing?” Feng Wu tugged at Huo Shan when she saw him lying motionlessly on the ground.","“Cough, cough —”","Huo Shan spat out the mud in his mouth and woke up.","The others all had scratches of varying degrees, but none of them were severely injured.","Cheng Fang was shaking.","He had seen how the vine wrapped around his waist and threw him into the mine. Only then did he realize how capable Feng Wu really was.","“Shao Xiao, check on everyone,” Feng Wu told Shao Xiao.","Shao Xiao now understood Feng Wu’s real power, so he did as he was told. “Sure!”","Feng Wu looked outside the cave while Shao Xiao was examining the others.","The two people had landed outside the cave.","The woman in the purple dress had been sliced in half, and the swordsman stood there with blood dripping down his sword.","Finally, Feng Wu could see the woman’s face clearly.","She was right. The woman had little dots for eyebrows and red lips, and was wearing wooden sandals. She didn’t look like a native of the Junwu Empire.","Suddenly, the swordsman turned around and glanced at Feng Wu.","It was so cold that it seemed to curdle Feng Wu’s blood.","Huo Shan and the others felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave, and they had difficulty breathing.","His eyes were so frightening.","What a terrifying aura!","Time seemed to stop.","Huo Shan and the others turned around and didn’t dare give him another look.","They all trembled for fear that the man would want to kill them next.","“Are we going to die?” They looked at one another and all went pale.","Were they going to be killed?","Were they going to die here?","They all wondered the same thing.","“Why are you guys here?” someone behind them asked.","Feng Wu and the others turned around and saw another team come out from deeper inside the cave. Shan Jingfei led the team, and she was followed by Ye Han.","Shan Jingfei threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and told the others, “Be quiet!”","Cheng Fang was excited to see Ye Han. “Ye Han, there you are!”"]},{"number":2685,"title":"Chapter 2685 - Who Is He? (2)","paragraphs":["Ye Han angrily cut Cheng Fang off. “We were hiding safely in this mine, but you just had to barge in! If that swordsman kills us for what we saw, it’s your fault!”","Cheng Fang immediately stopped talking.","Shan Jingfei also glared at Feng Wu’s team and wanted to kill them all.","Feng Wu suddenly rose to her feet.","She moved toward the entrance of the cave.","Was she going out there?","“What are you doing?!” everyone shouted in unison.","Even Shao Xiao and his teammates were shocked.","They all wanted to huddle together, and hoped that the swordsman wouldn’t notice them. Why would Feng Wu want to go out of the cave now?","Feng Wu found the man familiar and felt that she had seen him somewhere before.","She rushed toward the entrance without hesitation.","“Stop her!” Shan Jingfei shouted angrily.","But Feng Wu was already outside.","Shan Jingfei gritted her teeth and ran after Feng Wu.","With a wave of her hand, rocks fell, blocking the entrance. They could only look out of the cave through a narrow gap.","Feng Wu was outside while everyone else was inside.","“What are you doing?!” Shao Xiao and his teammates glared at Shan Jingfei.","Huo Shan was furious. “How can you do that to Feng Wu?! Have you lost your mind?”","Ling Hao pushed Shan Jingfei. “Move! Out of my way!”","Shan Jingfei only stood there and smirked. “She ran to her own death, and none of us could stop her. If you want to die with her, move the rocks yourself. It’s none of my business!”","She thought that her words would intimidate Shao Xiao and his friends.","After all, she was the class president, and believed that every boy in the class was in love with her.","To her surprise, these boys had stopped worshiping her.","Shao Xiao was the first to work on the rocks.","Wang Zhi, Ling Hao, Huo Shan and even Cheng Fang joined him, moving the rocks away from the opening.","“You!” Shan Jingfei was furious.","Xuecheng Team also realized what was going on.","They had been astonished when they saw Feng Wu just then.","How was that possible?","They had been saved by a Class B student!","How?!","That student was from Class B!","Xue Hao decided that now wasn’t the right time to figure out who the girl was. They had to save her first!","They joined Shao Xiao’s team and started working.","Shan Jingfei was fuming.","“Xue Hao, Ye Hongxue, what are you doing?! Why are you helping Feng Wu? Stop!” Shan Jingfei was so furious that her face twisted.","Ye Hongxue looked at Shan Jingfei and asked coldly, “Are you giving us orders now?”","That chilled Shan Jingfei to the bone.","Ye Hongxue was right.","Xuecheng Team was here to help her kill magical beasts, and Shan Jingfei had no right to give them orders. However, they shouldn’t be assisting Feng Wu either! Shan Jingfei decided to complain to Qiu Zeyu after she went back."]},{"number":2686,"title":"Chapter 2686 - Spiritual Saint","paragraphs":["While Shan Jingfei was having a row with Xuecheng Team, Feng Wu was observing the swordsman outside the cave.","The man didn’t expect to see anyone come out after he demonstrated his full strength, let alone a slender young girl.","He wasn’t interested in a girl like Feng Wu, and he was ready to leave after killing the woman.","He didn’t even bother to look at Feng Wu and had no idea what she looked like.","However, Feng Wu ran toward the man.","The man ran too fast.","He was soon out of sight.","“Hey! Stop!” Feng Wu shouted after him.","However, the man ran off without so much as turning his head.","Feng Wu stomped her foot.","She had seen that man somewhere before, but where? She couldn’t put her finger on it.","She then looked at the foreign woman.","The dead body had already started decaying from the head downward.","She was as dead as could be.","Yes, she wasn’t from the Junwu Empire.","The Magic Soul Vines stirred violently in Feng Wu’s sleeves.","Feng Wu opened her palm, and the vines quickly stretched out.","Soon, the vines wrapped themselves around the dead body.","Feng Wu saw the vines quickly absorb whatever was left of the woman’s spiritual essence.","However, she was decaying too fast.","The vines were only halfway done before the body broke down completely.","The vines reluctantly retreated and became tiny dots on Feng Wu’s wrists.","Meanwhile, a storage necklace fell into her hand.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","The woman was powerful enough to fight against the swordsman. Her necklace had to be worth a fortune!","However, Feng Wu didn’t remember seeing it around the woman’s neck.","She had probably hidden it somewhere.","Feng Wu wouldn’t have found it if she didn’t have the vines. How lucky.","She was going to examine the necklace she had obtained by accident, when people started coming out of the cave.","Huo Shan was in the lead, followed by Ling Hao.","“Feng Wu! Feng Wu! Are you alright?”","Huo Shan’s hands were blistered from carrying all the rocks. He was so worried.","Feng Wu wasn’t just anyone. She was the crown prince’s favorite girl. Huo Shan knew he was dead if Feng Wu was abducted or killed.","She slipped the necklace into her chest pocket and nodded. “I’m alright.”","“Where’s the swordsman?” Ling Hao asked curiously.","Feng Wu said, “He’s gone.”","Ling Hao asked, “Just like that?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes. Did you expect him to stick around to buy you lunch?”","Ling Hao said, “Feng Wu, you know that’s not what I meant. It’s good that he’s gone. He’s just too scary. He’s scarier than our principal. Who is he?”","Shao Xiao said, “I don’t know who he is, but he’s definitely a Spiritual Saint or higher.”","A Spiritual Saint?!"]},{"number":2687,"title":"Chapter 2687 - Our Great Junior-level Medicine Refiner","paragraphs":["Ling Hao couldn’t believe his ears. “He can’t be! The Junwu Empire doesn’t have more than a handful of Spiritual Saints!”","Shao Xiao said, “I think he’s even more capable than that.”","Ling Hao said, “Shao Xiao, now you’re just exaggerating.”","Shao Xiao said, “I’m not.”","Shan Jingfei and Ye Han charged out of the cave.","Shan Jingfei glared at Feng Wu.","She glanced at Xin Zhixuan since it was about time that Xin Zhixuan scolded Feng Wu on her behalf.","However, she didn’t know that Xin Zhixuan resented her for her deception and had decided not to speak up for her.","Seeing this, Ye Han felt that it was an opportunity to curry favor with Shan Jingfei.","“Feng Wu, what’s the matter with you?!” Ye Han pointed at Feng Wu. “You could have gotten all of us killed!","“If you want to die, feel free to do so, but don’t drag us down with you!","“You could have upset the swordsman. What if he had gotten angry and killed all of us?","“You saw how terrifying he is! He created this big valley with one slash of his sword! Killing us would be easier than breathing for him!”","Ye Han lashed out at Feng Wu.","Cheng Fang frowned. He had thought Ye Han to be a kind and cool-headed person, but why did she appear as mean as Xin Zhixuan now?","“I think that’s enough...” Cheng Fang tried to hint to Ye Han when he saw that all his teammates were frowning.","However, Ye Han was annoyed.","She felt that even Cheng Fang had switched sides.","“You’re all fooled by her good looks! All of you are taking her side! One day, she’ll get you killed! She’s a burden!” Ye Han shouted at them.","Ling Hao smirked. “We’re the ones who are a burden. As for getting us killed... Feng Wu saved all our lives.”","Ye Han didn’t know what to say. “Now you’re making up stories. With her capability, how can she do that? Cheng Fang, answer me! How did she save you?”","Cheng Fang said, “She cured me...”","Ye Han laughed. “She cured you. With what? Pills? She sure carries a lot of pills on her. Other than that, what does she have? Is she a medicine refiner now? Can she make potions?”","To her surprise, Shao Xiao’s team all stared at her in a strange way, including Cheng Fang.","Ye Han wondered why that was.","The look on Ling Hao’s face was full of mocking.","Cheng Fang felt sorry for Ye Han, so he told her, “Feng Wu is a medicine refiner.”","A medicine refiner?","Enraged by Ling Hao’s smirk, Ye Han said, “I see. She’s the greatest Junior-level medicine refiner, is she?”","Shan Jingfei laughed.","But she immediately realized that as the class goddess, she shouldn’t gloat. She cleared her throat and said, “Excuse me.”","She then watched as Ye Han made a fool of herself."]},{"number":2688,"title":"Chapter 2688 - Supreme-level Medicine Refiner","paragraphs":["Shan Jingfei loved nothing more than seeing Feng Wu get humiliated.","However, Shao Xiao and the others gave Shan Jingfei inscrutable looks.","They had seen her as an impeccable goddess, but her reaction so far disappointed them.","Shan Jingfei couldn’t care less.","She had never cared about small people like Shao Xiao. She only wanted to do what made her happy.","Hence, she gave Ye Han an encouraging look.","Ye Han became more confident.","She sneered at Cheng Fang. “Tell me. Is Feng Wu, the girl you can’t stop singing praises about, a great Junior-level medicine refiner?”","Cheng Fang hadn’t been able to bring himself to disagree with Ye Han before, but he finally saw that Ye Han had never been the helpless girl he had assumed her to be. Instead, she had always been a bully.","Feng Wu had saved her life, but when Ye Han got the chance, she immediately turned on Feng Wu. Cheng Fang then thought about what he had done.","Feng Wu had saved him several times, but each time, he had chosen Ye Han’s side. He realized he had also behaved like an ungrateful person, just like Ye Han.","Cheng Fang flushed at the realization.","Seeing that Cheng Fang had fallen silent, Ye Han thought he couldn’t keep up the lie; she became even more aggressive. “What? Are you too scared to continue? Keep bragging! Please!”","Cheng Fang was furious.","“Feng Wu is a Supreme-level medicine refiner!”","Everyone fell silent when he shouted those words.","Ye Han was astonished.","So was Shan Jingfei and her teammates.","Time seemed to freeze for a few seconds.","“Hahahahaha —”","Shan Jingfei and her teammates burst out laughing.","Ye Han was the loudest one.","She held her stomach with one hand and supported herself against a tree trunk with the other, laughing so hard that she couldn’t stand straight. Tears flowed down her cheeks.","“Gosh! I thought I was going to laugh to death! Is that what you’re trying to do? Kill me with laughter?” When Ye Han finally stopped laughing, she pointed at Cheng Fang and said, “I would have believed you if you called her an Intermediate- or even Senior-level medicine refiner. You got ahead of yourself when you called her a Supreme-level medicine refiner. Do you even know how rare it is to find one?”","Cheng Fang rolled his eyes.","He knew Ye Han wouldn’t believe him.","He wouldn’t believe it either if he hadn’t seen Feng Wu’s outstanding medical skills with his own eyes. However, that was the fact.","His teammates had all seen it!","Cheng Fang looked back at Shao Xiao and the others.","Shao Xiao and his friends had bitter smiles on their faces as well.","Cheng Fang was at a loss over what to say.","Ye Hongxue wanted to step out.","She wanted to say that Feng Wu was indeed a Supreme-level medicine refiner.","Feng Wu had saved her and her teammates with the green natural essence.","However, Shan Jingfei intervened. “Supreme-level medicine refiner or not, it doesn’t mean anything now.”","Ye Hongxue was speechless.","Shan Jingfei walked up to Feng Wu and suddenly raised a hand. There was a mysterious smile on her face."]},{"number":2689,"title":"Chapter 2689 - The Truth Revealed","paragraphs":["“Feng Wu, why don’t we explore this Secret Essence Mine together?” Shan Jingfei made the invitation in a condescending tone.","Shao Xiao and his friends frowned.","Before, they would have thought that Shan Jingfei was trying to be friendly.","However, after they learned what a capable cultivator and medicine refiner Feng Wu was, they were embarrassed by Shan Jingfei’s attitude.","If Shan Jingfei knew Feng Wu’s true capability, she would probably be mortified by what she was doing today.","Shan Jingfei looked into Feng Wu’s eyes with a perfect smile on her face.","Despite the smile, she came off as someone who was extremely arrogant.","Feng Wu shook her head without hesitation. “I don’t like working with you.”","Shao Xiao and his friends smiled at one another.","That was indeed something Feng Wu would say. How incredible!","Not anticipating such a reply, Shan Jingfei felt humiliated.","She stared at Feng Wu. “Are you turning down my invitation, then?”","Feng Wu almost felt sorry for the girl. “What makes you think you’re qualified to make that invitation?”","That was direct...","Shan Jingfei couldn’t keep up the facade anymore.","She glared at Feng Wu. “What’s that supposed to mean?”","Feng Wu had never thought much of Shan Jingfei. If Shan Jingfei hadn’t assumed that air, Feng Wu would have ignored her.","Feng Wu didn’t mind slapping someone else’s face when presented with the chance.","“You’re too young to experience memory loss,” Feng Wu said casually. “Have you forgotten how I got into Class B?”","Shan Jingfei went ghastly pale.","Feng Wu’s words felt like a slap to her face.","She glared at Feng Wu. “You!”","Feng Wu gave her a sympathetic look. “I was going to let it drop. After that test, everyone should know who the top student of Class B is, but you just have to challenge me. Fine. Let’s get things straight.”","“Get what straight? Are you saying you’re better than Feifei?” Xin Zhixuan snapped. “Who the hell do you think you are? Do you think you can do better than her in this hunt?”","Xin Zhixuan tried to provoke Feng Wu.","Shan Jingfei threw a dirty look at her.","Feng Wu smiled at Shan Jingfei. “So, Shan Jingfei, who’s going to tell them? Me or you?”","“I don’t know what you’re talking about!” Shan Jingfei wanted to walk away.","Feng Wu casually said, “All the tutors were there that day. So was the deputy principal. Do you deny that I defeated you?”","WHAT?!","Everyone looked from Feng Wu to Shan Jingfei.","Shao Xiao and the others had only suspected that Feng Wu might be better than Shan Jingfei, but they couldn’t be sure without seeing them in a match. However, Feng Wu had just made it official.","The two girls had fought each other before!","Shan Jingfei flushed with fury.","She clenched her fists.","Her face twisted.","She hated Feng Wu so much!","Why did she say it out loud in front of everyone? Was she showing off?!"]},{"number":2690,"title":"Chapter 2690 - How Exciting","paragraphs":["Life had always been smooth sailing for Shan Jingfei, and everyone looked up to her. Such humiliation was unheard of.","She spun around and glared at Feng Wu.","Shan Jingfei was the dream girl of many boys; anyone else would feel uneasy when she stared at them.","But Feng Wu wasn’t just anyone.","She was very calm and continued smiling at Shan Jingfei.","All eyes were on the two girls.","How exciting!","Xin Zhixuan stared at Shan Jingfei, at least feeling avenged.","The satisfied look disappeared almost instantly. No one caught that look except for Feng Wu.","“Feng Wu! I’ll remember this!”","Shan Jingfei quickly recovered from her initial frustration. She readjusted her mood and directed all her hatred toward Feng Wu.","“Fine! You did defeat me in that test!”","Wow!","Everyone sucked in their breaths.","She said it!","Shan Jingfei said it herself!","She admitted she had lost to Feng Wu!","Everyone else couldn’t help but recall some of the rumors they had been hearing.","Rumor was that Feng Wu was a student without talent and was one of the worst in her class. However, Shan Jingfei should have known better!","She used to be the top student in Class B, but she chose to go with the flow after losing to Feng Wu. She just let the rumor spread. Why did she let that happen?","That made the entire class look bad!","A class president shouldn’t do such a thing!","Once everyone realized that, they began to look at Shan Jingfei in a different light.","She used to be the goddess of Class B and even the entire War Academy. However, that reputation seemed to be fading.","Shan Jingfei realized it as well and became even more frustrated.","Shan Jingfei glared at Feng Wu with eyes filled with fury. “I only lost once! Why are you being so smug?!”","Feng Wu glanced at her. “What? Would you prefer to lose more than once?”","Pffft!","Ling Hao burst into laughter.","Everyone looked at him.","Ling Hao said, “I’m sorry! I didn’t mean it! Please continue.”","Shan Jingfei ground her teeth, whereas Feng Wu remained perfectly unperturbed.","Shan Jingfei was so angry that she laughed. “Feng Wu, I’ve met a lot of students from Class A, but none of them are as arrogant as you are! Do you think you’re such a big deal? Fight someone from Class A. I dare you!”","Feng Wu gave no reply.","Shan Jingfei then presented some shiny crystal cores.","“Do you know what these are?” She smirked.","Feng Wu glanced at her, still looking unaffected.","However, Ling Hao and the others cried out, “Oh my god! They’re crystal cores of junior and intermediate Class A magical beasts! There are 24 of them!”","Ling Hao stared at Shan Jingfei in disbelief. “Where did you find them?!”","Shan Jingfei was a capable student, but she wasn’t skilled enough to obtain as many crystal cores as a Class A student could."]},{"number":2691,"title":"Chapter 2691 - I’m on Feng Wu’s Side","paragraphs":["“Only students from Class A can do that. You...” Ling Hao stared at Shan Jingfei.","That was what Shan Jingfei had been waiting for.","She smirked. “That’s right. Some students from Class A helped me with these crystal cores.”","She then looked at Xuecheng Team behind her.","The members of Xuecheng Team felt embarrassed.","They wouldn’t feel so awkward if Feng Wu was merely a student from Class B. However, she just happened to be the bigshot who had saved their lives.","Ye Hongxue was about to say something, when Feng Wu shook her head.","She sighed in resignation.","Ling Hao’s face darkened.","“Shan Jingfei, that’s cheating!” Ling Hao glared at Shan Jingfei, his face livid.","Shan Jingfei smirked. “Feng Wu doesn’t have a good boyfriend; she can’t blame anyone but herself!”","Ye Han went on, “Qiu Zeyu asked Class A students to help Jingfei. First place has already been determined. No one but Jingfei will have it! You can all stop trying!”","She was talking to Feng Wu.","First place was predetermined?","Everyone looked at Cheng Fang since he had mentioned it earlier.","Cheng Fang nodded, confirming Ye Han’s claim.","“That’s not fair!” Ling Hao shouted. “How can Class A get involved? That’s not a fair game!”","Ye Han said, “Get some Class A students to help you, then. Cultivation isn’t everything. A lot of the time, your connections are part of your capability.”","Shan Jingfei gloated. “The Secret Essence Mine is full of danger. Are you sure you don’t want to join us?”","Feng Wu smirked.","Shan Jingfei smirked back before turning to Shao Xiao and the others.","“I’m inviting you on my team. If you abandon Feng Wu, I’ll permit you to join my team. You’ll be under my protection.”","She was trying to drive a wedge between Feng Wu and the others.","In a critical moment like this, she was confident that those people would give up on Feng Wu. At least, that was what she would do.","But she was disappointed.","Huo Shan smirked. “I’ll never join you. I support Feng Wu!”","He thought,? If you’re so proud of your boyfriend in Class A, wait until you find out who Feng Wu’s boyfriend is. You’ll be so jealous!","Shan Jingfei smirked, believing that Huo Shan was as dumb as Feng Wu was.","However, the others followed suit.","Ling Hao said, “I’ll never join you. I support Feng Wu!”","Ling Hao was an old Class B student, but he had just turned against Shan Jingfei.","Shao Xiao stepped out and said the same thing.","Shan Jingfei was shocked.","Wang Zhi also chimed in.","Shan Jingfei was shocked.","Even Cheng Fang, who hadn’t liked Feng Wu so much at first, said the same thing in the end.","Shan Jingfei was so furious that she thought she was going to lose her mind.","What was wrong with these people?!"]},{"number":2692,"title":"Chapter 2692 - Aren’t You Coming?","paragraphs":["“Do you have a death wish?!”","Ye Han stared at Cheng Fang. “Are you an idiot? They’re too stupid to cherish their lives, so you’re going to do the same?”","Cheng Fang shook his head. “I just feel that I have a higher chance of staying alive with Feng Wu.”","Shan Jingfei and Ye Han couldn’t believe their ears.","Xin Zhixuan didn’t think that way.","When she calmed down and tried to analyze the situation, she realized that Cheng Fang might be telling the truth. Maybe Feng Wu really was a Supreme-level medicine refiner, no matter how slim the chance was.","Shan Jingfei said, “Fine. If you want to die, be my guest! This is your last chance. I won’t ask you again!”","She walked away after that.","Her teammates followed her.","Ye Han smirked when she walked past Cheng Fang.","Cheng Fang took Ye Han’s sleeve and said sincerely, “Ye Han, you really should come with us. I mean it. Feng Wu will help us. She’s a Supreme-level medicine refiner.”","Ye Han said, “You idiot!”","She threw off his hand with so much force that Cheng Fang stumbled.","Ye Hongxue and her team were the last to leave.","She suddenly asked Feng Wu, “You’re Feng Wu, you said?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Ye Hongxue said, “We accepted Qiu Zeyu’s request, so we have to do this. However, if you find our conduct unacceptable, we’ll terminate this assignment immediately.”","The others all nodded.","Feng Wu had saved their lives; this task was nothing in comparison.","Ye Hongxue didn’t know what impact those words had on Ling Hao and the others.","Ling Hao and his teammates had been prepared to fight the powerful Class A students. However, these students were showing Feng Wu a lot of respect.","That tone...","One word from Feng Wu, and they would stop helping Shan Jingfei.","Wasn’t that a bit over the top?","Did Shan Jingfei know that?","All eyes were on the arrogant Shan Jingfei, who was as vain as a peacock. She was leading the team away and was too far away to hear them.","Shan Jingfei thought Xuecheng Team was on her side, but she couldn’t be any more foolish.","They realized how ridiculous Shan Jingfei was.","Feng Wu smiled at Xuecheng Team. “How do you feel?”","Ye Hongxue smiled. “We’re much better now. Thank you for your help, or we would have...”","Feng Wu waved her hand. “Don’t worry about it. It’s no big deal.”","“But it means all the world to us.” Ye Hongxue and her teammates meant every word.","At that moment, Shan Jingfei finally realized that her “patrons” hadn’t caught up with her team. She turned around to find Xuecheng Team talking to Feng Wu.","She couldn’t believe it.","She bellowed, “Feng Wu! They accepted my task! How dare you try to steal them away?!”","Steal them away? Somehow, that sounded entirely accurate.","Ye Hongxue wanted to explain, but Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry about it. You do what you need to do now. If you want to return the favor, we can always talk about it when we get back.”","Ye Hongxue gritted her teeth and nodded.","“Hongxue, what are you doing there?” Shan Jingfei sounded threatening."]},{"number":2693,"title":"Chapter 2693 - 80,000 Underground Tunnels","paragraphs":["Ye Hongxue’s face darkened.","Shan Jingfei lost her temper because she was worried that the other team would really switch sides. Feng Wu had a strange ability to make people follow her. It had been the case with Shao Xiao and his team.","At that thought, Shan Jingfei ran back to Ye Hongxue and shouted at Feng Wu. “Do you want to steal them as well? They’re from Class A! They won’t follow you just because you try to recruit them! Don’t make me laugh!”","She then turned to Ye Hongxue. “Hongxue, let’s go.”","Ye Hongxue gave Feng Wu a regretful look. After what Feng Wu said, they had to follow Shan Jingfei.","Ling Hao and the others only came back to themselves after Shan Jingfei and her team left.","“Did I hear correctly?” Ling Hao was surprised. “Feng Wu, did you save their lives?”","Shao Xiao was equally surprised. “They’re Xuecheng Team, which is one of the top teams in Class A. Xiao Wu, did you save them?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Anything wrong with that?”","“Of course not,” said Ling Hao. “Ye Hongxue said so, and of course, we believe you. I just find it hard to imagine...”","Everyone was astonished.","“Feng Wu, you have to understand: Before we came here, we thought you were one of the weakest students in Class B. Do you remember? I was shamelessly telling you that I could let you tag along, and help you out.”","The thought made Ling Hao blush.","“But you kept showing us your capability along the way. You defeated the Magic Vine Beasts and demonstrated that you’re a Supreme-level medicine refiner. Amidst everything else, you also helped Xuecheng Team. We’ve also just learned that you got into Class B by defeating Shan Jingfei, and you’re in fact the top student in our class. We need some time to digest everything.”","It could be so stressful being on the same team as Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Digest it while we walk. This Secret Essence Mine is big. There are 80,000 underground tunnels, and we can easily get lost. Be careful.”","Shao Xiao said, “I have some rope. Let’s tie it around our waists. That way, if something goes wrong, we won’t be separated.”","After that, Feng Wu led the team, and was followed by Huo Shan, Ling Hao, Wang Zhi, Cheng Fang, and Shao Xiao.","They all tied the rope around their waists so that no one in the team would be separated.","“80,000?” The idea made Ling Hao want to die. “Can we get out?”","They all looked at Shao Xiao because he was the one who had brought up the 80,000 tunnels.","Shao Xiao said, “I don’t have a map, but even if I did, it’s still easy to get lost in a dark cave like this. I don’t know what we should do.”","They all looked at Feng Wu.","She was going to be their savior.","Feng Wu smiled. “We’ll get out.”","Ling Hao said, “But how? On the surface, we can use the sun, the growth rings on tree stumps, or flowing water to figure out the direction. How do we know where we’re going in such narrow tunnels?”","Feng Wu said, “Do you know who that swordsman is?”","Everyone shook their heads. Ling Hao asked, “Do you?”","It was a familiar face, but Feng Wu couldn’t recall who he was. She shook her head. “I don’t, for now. However...”"]},{"number":2694,"title":"Chapter 2694 - Level 8","paragraphs":["Feng Wu smiled. “We all know how formidable that man is. He created this big valley with a single strike and exposed this underground mine.”","Everyone nodded.","They had all seen it.","Feng Wu then said, “But do you know why this Secret Essence Mine remained intact?”","“Why’s that?” the others asked.","“Because it’s protected by a formation,” said Feng Wu.","“That swordsman has some terrifying skills. When he created this valley with his strike, the temperature dropped by a hundred degrees; there was no way we could have survived out there. We had to enter the Secret Essence Mine.","“Because of the formation, however, the inside of the mine is constantly changing. We’ll get lost even if we stay still. Therefore, we must find our way out of here. Otherwise, we’ll all die.”","Feng Wu looked at the other team members. “We can’t wait for the school to rescue us.","“Because the people have to know formations as well. Otherwise, they’ll be trapped in these 80,000 tunnels as well.”","If they stayed here, they would freeze to death.","If they entered the mine, they might get lost and die.","“I don’t think we have much chance of getting out of here alive...” Ling Hao murmured.","Everyone felt defeated.","Were they so close to death?","Feng Wu smiled. “Enough with the bad news. Here’s some good news.”","Everyone stared at her.","“What?”","“Has the formation stopped working?”","“Do we have a map?”","“Do we have a lot of supplies?”","...","Everyone’s eyes lit up, and they all started asking questions.","Feng Wu shook her head.","Everyone was disappointed by her reply. She then told them something else.","“I want to congratulate you because I’m on your team.”","“So, you know formations!” Ling Hao stared at Feng Wu in amazement.","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes.”","Everyone was astonished.","Feng Wu asked. “You don’t believe me, then?”","Everyone shook their heads. “No, we believe you!”","Having seen Feng Wu’s magnificent capability and medical skills, they would believe anything she said. Yes, she was young, but her capability had never been limited by her age.","“What level are you, in terms of formations?” Shao Xiao knew a little about formations and remembered that Imperial College’s defense formation was Level 8.","Feng Wu said, “Level 8.”","Pffft!","Shao Xiao stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, “Is it so hard to believe?”","Shao Xiao said, “Come on! Of course it is! Our school’s formation is Level 8!”","Feng Wu said, “The one in school is a combination of numerous Level 8 formations. It’s much more powerful than an ordinary one.”","Shao Xiao said, “That’s correct. Imperial College’s defense formation is a combination of countless formations. Are you really a Level 8 formation master?”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right.”","Shao Xiao didn’t want to believe it...","If they believed her, it would make them look like idiots in comparison.","Could someone really be so perfect?!","Feng Wu smiled. “We all know how formidable that man is. He created this big valley with a single strike and exposed this underground mine.”","Everyone nodded.","They had all seen it.","Feng Wu then said, “But do you know why this Secret Essence Mine remained intact?”","“Why’s that?” the others asked.","“Because it’s protected by a formation,” said Feng Wu.","“That swordsman has some terrifying skills. When he created this valley with his strike, the temperature dropped by a hundred degrees; there was no way we could have survived out there. We had to enter the Secret Essence Mine.","“Because of the formation, however, the inside of the mine is constantly changing. We’ll get lost even if we stay still. Therefore, we must find our way out of here. Otherwise, we’ll all die.”","Feng Wu looked at the other team members. “We can’t wait for the school to rescue us.","“Because the people have to know formations as well. Otherwise, they’ll be trapped in these 80,000 tunnels as well.”","If they stayed here, they would freeze to death.","If they entered the mine, they might get lost and die.","“I don’t think we have much chance of getting out of here alive...” Ling Hao murmured.","Everyone felt defeated.","Were they so close to death?","Feng Wu smiled. “Enough with the bad news. Here’s some good news.”","Everyone stared at her.","“What?”","“Has the formation stopped working?”","“Do we have a map?”","“Do we have a lot of supplies?”","...","Everyone’s eyes lit up, and they all started asking questions.","Feng Wu shook her head.","Everyone was disappointed by her reply. She then told them something else.","“I want to congratulate you because I’m on your team.”","“So, you know formations!” Ling Hao stared at Feng Wu in amazement.","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes.”","Everyone was astonished.","Feng Wu asked. “You don’t believe me, then?”","Everyone shook their heads. “No, we believe you!”","Having seen Feng Wu’s magnificent capability and medical skills, they would believe anything she said. Yes, she was young, but her capability had never been limited by her age.","“What level are you, in terms of formations?” Shao Xiao knew a little about formations and remembered that Imperial College’s defense formation was Level 8.","Feng Wu said, “Level 8.”","Pffft!","Shao Xiao stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, “Is it so hard to believe?”","Shao Xiao said, “Come on! Of course it is! Our school’s formation is Level 8!”","Feng Wu said, “The one in school is a combination of numerous Level 8 formations. It’s much more powerful than an ordinary one.”","Shao Xiao said, “That’s correct. Imperial College’s defense formation is a combination of countless formations. Are you really a Level 8 formation master?”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right.”","Shao Xiao didn’t want to believe it...","If they believed her, it would make them look like idiots in comparison.","Could someone really be so perfect?!"]},{"number":2695,"title":"Chapter 2695 - Save Them","paragraphs":["“What’s the level of the formation in this mine?” Shao Xiao asked.","Feng Wu thought for a moment before saying, “Level 8 and a half. To be more precise, the outer circle is Level 8, and the center is Level 8 and a half.”","Shao Xiao stared at Feng Wu in surprise.","The others stared at Shao Xiao.","Shao Xiao had said that there were 80,000 tunnels underground, which meant that he knew the Secret Essence Mine better than anyone else.","“Is that true?” the others all asked him.","The question roused Shao Xiao from his astonishment. He looked from Feng Wu to the others before he nodded repeatedly.","OMG!","Where did Feng Wu learn that?","Ling Hao immediately realized how she had known. “Feng Wu, you really understand this formation! Can you break through it?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “No, I can’t, but it’s really easy to walk through it and reach the central area.”","‘Really easy.’","Everyone stared at her in resignation. It was anything but easy!","They were thrilled that they had teamed up with such a capable cultivator.","Feng Wu said, “I’ll take the lead. You guys hold the rope and follow me. Don’t get lost. Remember, there are 80,000 tunnels down here. Take a wrong turn, and you may be trapped here forever.”","Hearing her grave tone, the others grew serious as well.","They walked in silence.","Feng Wu said, “We should be out in three hours.”","The others nodded. That was much better than they had expected.","About an hour later, they heard someone crying for help.","“Help! Help me!”","Cheng Fang said nervously, “It’s Ye Han! Ye Han’s in danger! Feng Wu, please help her!”","The others didn’t say anything, but deep down, they hoped that Feng Wu would help her.","Feng Wu smirked. “Do you know where her team is right now?”","Cheng Fang shook his head.","“They’re 30,000 tunnels away from us,” Feng Wu said grumpily.","30,000?!","“How can we hear her, then?” Cheng Fang was perplexed.","Feng Wu said, “Because of the formation.”","Seeing that Feng Wu was growing impatient, Cheng Fang didn’t dare say another word.","Shao Xiao nodded at Cheng Fang.","Ye Han and her teammates had been so arrogant and rude to Feng Wu. Why should she help them?","“But...” Cheng Fang felt conflicted.","“These are human lives we’re talking about here, and Ye Han isn’t the only one. There are at least ten of them, including Xuecheng Team,” Cheng Fang said in a low voice.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Take this.”","She then put a paper crane in his hand. She had just made it herself.","She casually said, “This paper crane will take you to them.”","Cheng Fang couldn’t believe his ears.","Feng Wu said, “Go ahead. I thought you wanted to save them.”","Cheng Fang said, “I... I...”","Feng Wu said, “After you find them, follow the paper crane. It’ll take you to the core of the formation.","“I’ll only wait three hours. If you still haven’t come by then, I’ll open the core and leave this place with your other teammates.”","Cheng Fang felt like crying.","He hadn’t planned to help Ye Han himself. Why had it suddenly become his mission?"]},{"number":2696,"title":"Chapter 2696 - Regret","paragraphs":["“I, I...” Cheng Fang’s hands shook.","Feng Wu smiled and gave him a meaningful look.","She had had enough of Cheng Fang. All he ever did was make requests while he just stood on the side and watched. She only tolerated him because he was a member of the team.","If she had her way, she would have given up on him after she saved him once.","“I... But I...” Cheng Fang gave Shao Xiao a pleading look.","Shao Xiao was going to offer moral support, when Ling Hao tugged at his sleeve and gave him a warning look.","The realization struck him.","Feng Wu was displeased.","If Shao Xiao tried to speak up for Cheng Fang, she might suggest that he go with Cheng Fang.","That wasn’t the worst case scenario. The worst possibility was that Feng Wu might be disappointed in them.","At that thought, Shao Xiao shook his head at Cheng Fang. He had to be considerate.","No one took Cheng Fang’s side.","Cheng Fang was almost in tears.","Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder. “Off you go.”","Cheng Fang had used up all his excuses. Taking the paper crane, he slowly walked away, looking over his shoulder every few steps.","He hoped that Feng Wu would tell him to come back, but he waited and waited, and nothing happened. When he turned back again, his team had walked out of sight.","He was all alone.","He wanted to rush back to his team.","However, the paper crane took off at that moment. It flapped its wings and gave Cheng Fang a contemptuous look.","Even a paper crane was mocking him now. Cheng Fang felt like crying.","The crane started flying away.","Cheng Fang was in a difficult spot.","He couldn’t bring himself to go back to his team.","However, he didn’t think he was capable enough to find Ye Han and save her.","Moreover, the cave was massive. Take a wrong turn, and one could be lost in it forever. It was terrifying to walk alone in this place.","Even a grown man couldn’t live with that fear.","After that mocking glance, the paper crane flew even faster.","“Hey! Wait for me!” Cheng Fang ran after it.","Without the paper crane, he would get lost in the 80,000 tunnels. He would lose his mind.","The paper crane was flying just fast enough that he could catch up with it if he walked as fast as he could.","He was filled with fear and he was exhausted.","He stumbled through the tunnels, his face streaked with tears.","Why couldn’t he just keep his mouth shut?","Save Ye Han...","He wasn’t much better than her. How was he going to do that?","Moreover, Ye Han was with Xuecheng Team. If they couldn’t do anything, what good could he do?","Cheng Fang thought of Feng Wu.","He wondered why Feng Wu wouldn’t help him. How could she be so relentless?","With all those things spinning in his head, Cheng Fang pressed on hurriedly. Several times, the poor light made him fall. Soon, he was covered in bruises.","But he didn’t dare stop because if he did, he could become lost and die.","He now saw how decisive Feng Wu was."]},{"number":2697,"title":"Chapter 2697 - Captain Jupiter","paragraphs":["Cheng Fang knew that Feng Wu wouldn’t come to his aid.","It felt like he had been walking forever.","When he thought he was going to die from exhaustion, he saw a dot of light in the distance.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu and her teammates were walking in silence. No one made a sound, and the air felt stifling.","Feng Wu suddenly stopped.","The others were perplexed.","Feng Wu frowned. “There’s trouble up ahead.”","The others asked, “What trouble?”","Feng Wu couldn’t say. All she knew was that the Magic Soul Vine was stirring in her sleeve.","The Magic Soul Vine came from the Dongsang Kingdom and would only stir when it detected people from Dongsang.","Feng Wu frowned at the realization.","If she was guessing correctly, the woman killed by the swordsman had come from the Dongsang Kingdom, while now, she had run into more Dongsang people.","The path went around a corner a few steps away.","There was a crossroad.","Feng Wu raised a hand, stopping the others.","The others stopped and looked nervously at her.","“I heard something,” Feng Wu whispered.","“Get ready for battle!”","The others tensed up.","By now, they trusted Feng Wu completely and did as they were told.","However, where was the enemy?","They waited and waited, but no one turned up. Perplexed, they all turned to Feng Wu.","There was a grave look on Feng Wu’s face.","She raised her Fallen Star Sword and stared at a wall.","The others looked at one another.","Where was the enemy? It was only a wall.","Was Feng Wu too on edge?","They were in a tunnel that was only wide enough for two people to walk side by side.","Feng Wu rearranged their positions.","She stood on one side of the tunnel, and her teammates stood on the other side about ten meters away from her.","Time crawled by.","Their minds began to wander, when something happened.","They saw shadows on the wall.","They were silhouettes of people.","There were at least five of them.","Was it another team?","But why were they inside the wall?","They were in fact in the formation. Were they friend or foe?","Feng Wu gave her teammates a warning look and took out some tear-inducing potion.","The others nodded and held their breaths.","They heard these people talking on the other side.","It sounded like gibberish.","Shao Xiao and the others were baffled. What was that language? They couldn’t understand a word.","But Feng Wu could.","That was the language of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Feng Sang hadn’t been there before, nor had she learned the language. However, she had refined the Magic Soul Vine, which was one of the most potent magical plants in Dongsang. Afterward, she could understand the language.","She listened to their conversation.","“We should stop talking in our own language. We need to blend in.”","“Takeno has a point. Our purpose is to infiltrate Junwu and obtain classified information. We were picked because we’ve studied their culture for years and can speak their language fluently. After we step out of here, we should behave like native people of Junwu. Remember that.”","“Yes, Captain Jupiter!”"]},{"number":2698,"title":"Chapter 2698 - Spies","paragraphs":["Takeno? Captain Jupiter? Dongsang Kingdom?","They were going to steal information from the Junwu Empire!","Shao Xiao and the others were astonished. They hadn’t expected to eavesdrop on such a big secret.","“I heard we had a predecessor called the revival list. Unfortunately, the participants are all dead. We’re the reinforcements and will be under the command of General Fujihara.”","“I heard the general has hidden well. So far, no one in the Junwu Empire has discovered his real identity.”","“With him as our leader, we’ll make great achievements.”","“Too bad Ishida isn’t with us here. They’re out searching for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.”","“Captain Jupiter, does the Immortal Spiritual Fruit really exist?”","Captain Jupiter didn’t reply. Instead, another member of the team answered.","“Of course it exists. However, I’m not sure if they can find it, or if they can preserve it after they find it. The Immortal Spiritual Fruit is supposed to be able to bring people back from the dead. The queen is weak. If we can offer the fruit to our king, we’ll be set for life.”","The Immortal Spiritual Fruit?","Feng Wu felt as if she had been struck by lightning.","She had always been an open and aboveboard person. She hardly ever owed anyone anything, but there were two people whom she genuinely felt sorry for.","One was her beautiful master, and the other one was Bao Er.","That girl was growing weaker and weaker. If she had the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, she would still have a little hope. Otherwise, she wouldn’t live for much longer.","Feng Wu was still eavesdropping, when Captain Jupiter scolded the others.","“Enough with the small talk! We’re about to leave the formation! I’ll go out first. You guys follow me!”","“Yes, captain.”","The people of the Dongsang Kingdom were all about following orders.","Everyone stopped talking after that.","Feng Wu glanced at Shao Xiao and the others.","By then, they had realized how important this was, so they all raised their guard and nodded at Feng Wu, indicating that they were ready for battle.","Feng Wu struck out when Captain Jupiter walked out of the formation from behind the wall.","She grabbed him, covered his mouth and nose with one hand, and pinned his hands behind his back with the other. The potion she had smeared on her hand could easily knock someone out.","Captain Jupiter was about on the same level as Feng Wu.","She was a Level 9 Spiritual Lord that had reached perfection, but Jupiter was already a Level 1 Spiritual King.","However, Feng Wu had taken him by surprise. Together with the potion, the captain didn’t know how to react to the attack.","Feng Wu hit him in the neck, and Jupiter collapsed to the ground.","One after another, Jupiter’s team members walked out from behind the wall.","Feng Wu took care of four of them, and her teammates captured the fifth.","The tunnel was too narrow, so they took the Dongsang team to an opening a few hundred meters away.","Once they got there, they dropped the spies on the ground and surrounded them.","All five of them were awake, but the potion had made their eyes watery.","“You —”","Jupiter was the first to realize what was going on."]},{"number":2699,"title":"Chapter 2699 - Imitation","paragraphs":["He glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled. “Who are you? Tell me your name.”","By then, Jupiter and his team members had recovered a little. They looked at one another, all feeling uneasy.","Who would have thought?","They had been so ambitious. However, they were captured before they could make a move.","Jupiter gave his team a warning look before he smiled at Feng Wu.","They knew the War Academy was nearby, so Jupiter hatched a plan when he saw Feng Wu and her team.","“Who are you? Why are you doing this to us? We’re students of the War Academy!” He glared at Feng Wu.","Students of the War Academy?","Feng Wu looked at their clothes.","These people were prepared.","They were wearing the uniform of Class A!","“Are you our seniors from the War Academy?” Feng Wu smiled. “Which class are you in?”","“We’re from Class A! You’re from Class B, right?” Jupiter said arrogantly. “We’re your seniors! Let us go!”","Feng Wu looked them up and down.","She had to admit that these Dongsang people were very fluent in the language of Junwu. They behaved like natives of the Junwu Empire, too. She wouldn’t have been able to tell where they were from if she hadn’t heard their earlier conversation.","Shao Xiao and the others were shocked.","How could these people be so composed? With everything that was going on, they were still trying to pretend to be students of the War Academy.","Feng Wu smiled at them. “Class A? What’s your name?”","“I’m Du Le!” Jupiter smirked. “Who are you?”","“Du Le?”","Feng Wu didn’t know many people from Class A, so she looked at Shao Xiao.","Shao Xiao smiled wryly. “I do recognize that name. I think he’s a member of a certain team...”","“We’re an independent team!” Jupiter glared at Feng Wu. “We’ve just returned from Peace Grassland. We were on a secret mission in the Dongsang Kingdom and barely came out alive. Is this the greeting we get after coming back home? You’ve attacked one of your own! This is treason!”","Jupiter sounded more confident as he went on.","It was as if he really were Du Le.","If Feng Wu and the others hadn’t heard their conversation, they would have been fooled since these people had consummate acting skills.","Of course, that was only for ordinary people. With the Magic Soul Vine, Feng Wu could identify a Dongsang man from a mile away.","Feng Wu sighed and started talking.","“I heard we had a predecessor called the revival list. Unfortunately, the participants are all dead. We’re the reinforcements and will be under the command of General Fujihara.”","Jupiter and his teammates paled.","“I heard the general has hidden well. So far, no one in the Junwu Empire has discovered his real identity.”","Feng Wu was smiling at Jupiter’s team when she said those words.","“With him as our leader, we’ll make great achievements.”"]},{"number":2700,"title":"Chapter 2700 - Amazing Girl","paragraphs":["“Too bad Ishida isn’t with us here. They’re out searching for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.”","“Captain Jupiter, does the Immortal Spiritual Fruit really exist?”","Feng Wu didn’t simply repeat the conversation; she accurately mimicked their tones as well.","Jupiter and his team members stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","They felt angry and defeated at the same time.","They were angry because the girl had seen through their disguise but was still mocking them.","They felt defeated because right up to the moment Feng Wu showed up, they had been confident that they were going to make outstanding achievements.","Jupiter then gave his teammates a warning look.","They nodded at him.","The next moment, they tried to crush the poison hidden in their tooth.","These spies had emptied their molars before they came here and hidden the poison in the hollow tooth.","If they were caught, they could bite down, crush the poison and kill themselves before they were interrogated.","Other people might not be able to stop these spies, but Feng Wu wasn’t just anyone.","She had seen it coming, which was why she had used the potion.","She had enhanced the formula and added some weakening ingredients. As a result, the spies didn’t have the strength to bite down.","Jupiter noticed it, too.","He stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “What did you do?!”","Feng Wu crouched down with a half-smile.","“You tried to impersonate a senior student, and when we saw through your disguise, you tried to kill yourselves. You must be dreaming if you think you can get away so easily.” Feng Wu patted Jupiter’s cheek. “I won’t let any of you die before you tell me everything you know.”","Shao Xiao whispered to Feng Wu, “He pretended to be Du Le. Does that mean Du Le is...”","Feng Wu nodded gravely. “Don’t worry. I’ll make them tell me everything.”","Shao Xiao nodded.","Feng Wu sneered at Jupiter. “The truth is, I don’t have too much time to ask questions. I’m going to give you an opportunity to tell me everything voluntarily.”","Jupiter smirked and looked away.","Feng Wu said, “Is that a no?”","Jupiter raised his chin.","Feng Wu said, “Fine. I’ll start with washing off the makeup on your face.”","She gave Shao Xiao some potion. “Wipe away the disguise on their faces.”","They had tied up Jupiter’s team. so Shao Xiao was able to remove the disguise from their faces.","Jupiter was shocked.","It had taken Master Mu Yan a lot of effort to draw these new faces on them. She had said that no water could wash it off.","The makeup could only be removed by a concoction made by Mu Yan herself. No one else on this continent could do it. That was why they were convinced that they could impersonate the real students.","But now...","Jupiter couldn’t lie to himself anymore when he saw his teammates’ real faces. Their cover was blown.","Who was this teenage girl?","How could she remove Master Mu Yan’s disguise?"]}]);
